<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">RUKA mu Kinyanga: eBibiria mu Kinyanga</book>
  <para style="h">RUKA</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ruk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ruka</para>
  <para style="toc1">eInjiri imbu bwakianga Ruka waandika yo</para>
  <para style="mt2">eInjiri imbu bwakianga</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ruka</para>
  <para style="mt2">waandika yo</para>
  <para style="imt">Ntangiro</para>
  <para style="ip">eInjiri imbu bwakianga Ruka waandika yo, iyo kitabo kima mu bitabo binye byaroso munkati n'eRirai Rishasha imbi byatura ebuingo bwa Yesu n'ebinwa biti mbi byakoranga we. Mu bitabo binye mbyo, kira kima chabikirwa mbu «Injiri», ngerieba mbu «Mwasi Wakonda». Ebitabo mbyo byaandikwanga kuruma n'erikwa ra Yesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Matayo, Mariko, Ruka na Yohana nge baandikanga ebitabo mbyo. Ruka ntw'aandikanga ho bushwa n'ebuingo bwa Yesu n'ebinwa mbi byakoranga we, ina waandikanga hotu ekitabo ch'emeta abi inchi chabikirwa mbu «Mikorere y'esantumwa». Ekitabo ncho chatura ebinwa mbi byakoranga ebanafunsi ba Yesu kuruma n'erikwa n'erifuka, n'erikuruka ra Yesu mu mbingu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kusira mwea wosi shu ematu ngi aandikwanga eInjiri ino ya Ruka, abe impi haandikirenga we yo. Ina basomi bingi basimirana mbu yaandikwanga buna mu mwaka we 70 kuruma n'eributwa ra Yesu Kirisitu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ruka nge mwandiki w'eInjiri ino, wabesenga hotu munganga (Bakorosai 4.14). Eburenga bwerieba rae emwebe kumunda n'ekitabo kino bwashea mbu Ruka wabesenga wasoma masomo a kwiyo nguru.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ruka wahunanga iandika shu-shu ebinwa bushwa n'ebuingo bwa Yesu n'ebinwa mbi byakoranga we n'ieba mbu bwetanga byo kongo bampe bakasanirwa murisoma byo (Ruka 1.1-3). Ruka ntíwabesenga Muyuta, ina waandikanga imbu bwamukia entí Muyuta wamukochǎ irukira. Ekinwa ncho chasungwa shu-shu mu ntambi nji iturange we ekutime y'eBayuta (Ruka 1.8).</para>
  <para style="ip">eInjiri imbu bwakianga Ruka waandika yo, iyo kitabo chasusana n'ebitabo bya Matayo na Mariko imbu bukiange ebitabo bino byatura ebinwa mu inse sasusana, nakiro mbu byarengana kakeke.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu bitabo bino binye, ekitabo cha Ruka chisine ngi chatura nguru emyasi y'eributwa ra Yohana Murubiki. Ruka wisimike nguru mu binwa mbi byakae emusasiro (Ruka 3.3; 11.4; 17.3-4; 23.34) nambi byeba bushwa n'emahemo (Ruka 3.21; 5.16; 6.12; 11.1-12; 22.32).</para>
  <para style="iot">Emutondeko w'ebinwa</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Entangiro n'echasingwa eInjiri ino yaandikwa… 1.1-4</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Emyasi y'eributwa ra Yesu n'ematayarisho emurimo wae… 1.5—4.13</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Emahano a Yesu n'ebishisharo byae… 4.14—21.38</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Erikwa, erifuka n'erikuruka ra Yesu mu mbingu… 22.1—24.53</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s">Ntangiro y'emyasi ya Yesu Kirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Emukwakare Teofire, bea bingi bakwereka iandika emyasi y'ebinwa byetanga munkati nitu. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Bakuandika yo imbu bwaturirwanga bate yo nambi barukiranga yo raroso, na nge baninkwanga emurimo weritura emwasi wa Ongo. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Ngyasingwa nani hotu nakukianga namasibirira emwasi shu-shu, nasunga nti rakomenwa nikuandikiri ǒngo mukwakare Teofire. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Namaronja mbo kongo usiba eriira r'ebinwa byahanwanga ǒngo.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maraika watura ebusebutwa Yohana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Mu matu abesenga Herote mubake w'echuo cha ku Yundea, kwabesenga <char style="w">kuhani</char> uma nt'ubikirwange mbu Sakaria, wa mu kikembe ch'ebakuhani ba Abiya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abiya wabesenga mukwakare wa meta munani mu kikembe ch'ekuhani Sakaria. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma 1Bir 24.7-18.</char></note> na mukari Risabeti nti wa muruanda rw'ekuhani mukiri Aroni. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Ebati babi babesenga bea baombokara mu makako a Ongo. Babesenga nti bamisa shu emyomba iti ya Nyere Kuritu. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Ina nti basira mwana, bushwa mbu Risabeti nti ngumba nabo babi nti bamakunguha nguru. <verse eid="LUK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Otu ruma, Sakaria wabesenga ukorange emurimo wae mu makako a Ongo, bushwa mbu erotu ndo rwabesenga ukoro rw'ekikembe chabo. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Itukana n'emwenjo w'ebakuhani, Sakaria ngwarondorwa mu mishari murikime mu <char style="w">Numba ya Ongo</char> isacha mo emwaka. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Mu ntambi Sakaria wabesenga usachange emwaka, ebea bati basia habutara bahemange. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Nampo <char style="w">maraika</char> wa Nyere Kuritu wasaire Sakaria, wasimana muruharo rw'ekwabume rw'ebutanda bwerisachie emwaka. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Sakaria, murimusunga wisarima, watingirwa na boba. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Ina emaraika wamwire mbu: «Sakaria, ang'isubaha, Ongo wamarukira emahemo abe. Mukari wabe Risabeti wasekubute mwana wabume na ukumuninka rina ra Yohana. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Ukubese na ngoa hima n'imoa ringi, na bea bingi basemoere eributwa rae. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Bushwa mbu wasebese mukwakare mu makako a Nyere Kuritu. Watomuyo <char style="w">ndifai</char> abe mau ati-ati. Waserisayo Mutima Washurukara itukire mu bura bwa nina. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Wasekuruchayo bingi b'ebana ba Isiraeri kuri Ongo wabo. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Wasesondore erieya ra Nyere Kuritu na nti uri n'emutima hima n'emaa buri emutahwa Eria, kongo waronganya tu ebana na bishe babo. Wasebutwa hotu kongo wabindura ebakwemi ebatinangǎ ebinwa bya Ongo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Mara 3.23-24.</char></note> kongo babese na bwenge buri bea bakomenwa mu makako a Ongo. Nampo wasetunganyieyo Nyere Kuritu uanda rwakonda indu rwamurindira.»<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Ina Sakaria washisha <char style="w" lemma="Maraika">emaraika</char> mbu: «Kinki chasenisheayo mbu ebinwa bino b'iira? Bushwa mbu ani na mukari'ani twamakunguha nguru.» <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Maraika wamusako mbu: «Ani nge Kaburieri,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Ndan 8.16; 9.21; Ruk 1.26. </char></note> ani nge nisimananga mu makako a Ongo! Iwe ng'wanituma ikuture emwasi uno wakonda. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Ebinwa mbyo biseberererayo mu matu abyo, ina bushwa mbu nt'ukusimira byo, ukubese karumbu. Utukochiyo ieba ieya n'erotu indu rusekiayo ebinwa bino byabererera.»<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Mu ntambi njo, ebea mbi babesenga barindira Sakaria hambuka bashishara bushwa n'erɨsɨa rawe mu <char style="w">Numba ya Ongo</char>. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Warekia wasaa mo, wafundwa ieba nabo. Ina bushwa mbu iwe ngie karumbu, wabucha ieba nabo na mine, basiba mbu wakusunga kiasha kumunda n'eNumba ya Ongo.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />N'ematu a Sakaria erikora arekia asira, wakuruka kukwae. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Kuruma na matu makeke, mukari Risabeti wabese murito. Wámana myeri isanu ntwatasaa-saanga ekumbuka, ntwebange mbu: <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />«Mukai byakonda ebyamanikore Nyere Kuritu! Wamanikuto nkene munkati n'emeso ebea.»<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maraika watura ebusebutwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Ebukure bwa Risabeti bwarekia bwarengeka myeri mutuba, Ongo watuma <char style="w">maraika</char> Kaburieri ku Nasareti, ubungu ruma rwa ku Ngariraya. <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />Wamutuma kuri kitasa kima nge Maria. Ekitasa ncho chabesenga nti nge muchumba wa Yosefu, mushukira uma w'ekisasa ch'emubake Ndauti. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Emaraika ngo weyere Maria mu mwabo n'imwire mbu: «Nakukea, ǒngo urishee nchumo ya Ongo! Nyere Kuritu uri hima nabe.»<figure style="fig" file="DN00401b.tif" size="col" copy="Darwin Dunham" ref="1.28">Emaraika wasaire Maria</figure><verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Maria washishara mu kinwa ncho, waanikira mu mutima wae mbu: «Nkei ya buni ino?» <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" /><char style="w">Maraika</char> wamwire mbu: «Usubahi, eMaria, bushwa mbu umashee nchumo kwa Ongo. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Ukuria bukure, ukubuta mwana wabume, na ukumuninka rina nge Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Wasebese mukwakare, wǎbikirwa Mwana wa Ongo ingu uri hiyo n'ebiti. Nyere Kuritu Ongo wasemuninkayo ekitumbi ch'ishiku Ndauti. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Iwe nge usesimanireyo ebea ba ku Isiraeri ematu ati, n'ebwami bwae butabesiyo na ngendero.» <verse eid="LUK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Maria washisha emaraika mbu: «Ekinwa kino chasebese buni na ntínosi wabume?» <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Emaraika wamusako mbu: «eMutima Washurukara usekuhite, n'emaa a Ongo ingu uri hiyo n'ebiti asekubumbe buri kirumbirumbi. Ngyasingwa, emwana wasebuta ǒngo wasebese Washurukara, wasebikirwa mbu Mwana wa Ongo. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Rukira! Risabeti w'eruanda rwabe nae ngie murito, wasebuta mwana wabume nakiro mbu wamakunguha nguru. Iwe ngu wabeseyo ubikirwange mbu ngumba ngie uri na bukure bwa myeri mutuba. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Bushwa mbu kusira kinwa kihundusangǎ Ongo.» <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Nampo Maria weba mbu: «Ani mukobe wa Nyere Kuritu, kai bibesi imbu bwameba ǒngo!» Kuruma nampo, maraika wenda rae.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maria wenda katangura Risabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Mu matu a, Maria wasimana n'ienda tete mu chuo ch'esangu, murubungu ruma rwa ku Yundea. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Wakime mwa Sakaria n'ikea Risabeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Entambi Risabeti warukiranga enkei ya Maria, emwana witenja-tenja mu bura bwa Risabeti, nampo warisiwa n'eMutima Washurukara. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Weba mu murenge mukiri mbu: «Ongo wamakukasane irenga ebamina bati, n'emwana wasebuta ǒngo nae hotu wakasanirwa! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Ani inye murihierwa na nina wa Nyere Kuritu mu mwani? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Bushwa nakukia narukira emurenge w'enkei yabe mu mate ani, emwana witenja-tenja na ngoa kumunda n'ebura bwani. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Ukasanirwa ǒngo bushwa umarisia mbu ebinwa byakweba Nyere Kuritu bisebererera!»<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Erumbo rwa Maria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Ngerikia Maria weba mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">«Emutima wani watatirisa Nyere Kuritu,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />Namoere Ongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:47">Muramya wani.<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Bushwa wamanikwire bonso ani mukori wae.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Muriira, itukire enompena, ebea bati basembikira mbu nakasanirwa,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />bushwa mbu Ongo Mine Maa wamanikore binwa bikiri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Erina rae rashurukara ho!<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Na wasenda ukwirengi bonso</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:50">ebamusubaha b'esankiso siti.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Wamakoresha emaa ae murikoresha ebunkangwe bw'emombo wae,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:51">wamansansabanya ebari n'emutima w'engari.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Wamakuto ebami mu bitumbi byabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:52">n'itumbia ebihohea.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Yub 5.11; 12.19.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Wakusukucha ebakwa rwaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:53">ina wakukurucha ebatumba kobokobo.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Wakweya kasake emukori wae Isiraeri</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:54">na ntíwakobya imukwire bonso,<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />imbu bwarananga we na batitanku bitu, ietere</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:55">kuri Iburahimu n'erubuto rwae ematu ati.»<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Maria wamana kwa Risabeti myeri ishatu, kuruma nampo wakuruka ku kwabo.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eributwa ra Yohana Murubiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Entambi ya Risabeti y'eributa yakia yarumira, wabuta mwana wabume. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Ebanunsane na banachabo, barekia barukirǎ bwakukwire Nyere Kuritu Risabeti bonso, bamoa hima nae. <verse eid="LUK 1:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Kuruma na matu munani, banachabo beya kamonesha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.59 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Bar 12.3.</char></note> emwana. Bahuna imuninka erina r'ishe Sakaria. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Ina nina watina mbu: «Ntímbo, erina rae nge Yohana.» <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Bamwire mbu: «Ina kusira mwea muruanda rwabe uri n'erina ndo!»<verse eid="LUK 1:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Basime ishe w'emwana mu rimushisha watiku erina rashimae kuri emwana e. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Sakaria wakonga bo kisai, na waandika mu cho mbu: «Erina rae nge Yohana.» Ebati bisarima. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Hiha-hiha ebunu bwa Sakaria bwoboka, wabucha tu ieba n'itata Ongo. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Ebea bati imbi babesenga nko batingirwa na boba. Emwasi ngo wansansabana mu sangu siti s'echuo cha ku Yundea. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Ebati mbi barukiranga emwasi ngo banikira na kwishishirisha mu mitima mbu: «Emwana uno wǎbeseyo buni?» Bushwa, muriira, emaa a Nyere Kuritu abesenga hima nae.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Erumbo rwa Sakaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Sakaria ishe w'emwana warisiwa n'eMutima Washurukara, n'ibucha ihurukwa, n'ieba mbu:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />«Watatwe Nyere Kuritu, Ongo wa Baisiraeri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:68">bushwa mbu wamasake ebea bae n'ishukaya bo.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Wamaturishie Rukombora mine bunkangwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:69">itukire muruanda rw'emukori wae Ndauti.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Nge bwebanga we kare-kare mu mǎnu <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa">ebatahwa</char> bae bashurukara mbu<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />wasetutumireyo ingu usetushukayayo mu mine y'ebarenda bitu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:71">na mu mine yambi ebatubaangǎ.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Waraanga mbu wasekwireyo batitanku bitu bonso;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:72">n'isubukia erirai rae rashurukara,<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />nge chaserenga we kuri titanku witu Iburahimu mbu<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />wasetushukaya mu mine y'ebarenda bitu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:74">kongo twamukore na nti tusira boba,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />na tushurukare n'ibese n'iombokara mu makako ae</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:75">ematu itu ati.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.75 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Ntan 22.16-17.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Na ǒngo, mwanani, ukubikirwa <char style="w">mutahwa</char> wa Ongo ingu uri hiyo n'ebiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">bushwa ukusondore Nyere Kuritu murimutunganyie ense,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />na kongo usubukia ebea bae mbu waseshukaya bo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:77">n'isasira esansambi sabo.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Iira, Ongo witu urisere nchime na burongu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">waturebeki chaka ituka ko kwiyo.<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />Washei bo chaka imbi barerika mu mwirimya n'ebahendwange n'eroku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">kongo watushea imisa ense y'ebuhoro.»<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Emwana ngo wabesenga woshukange na maa emutima. Wenda karika inku ekusira bea ieya n'erotu rw'isheanga we kuri Baisiraeri.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Eributwa ra Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mat 1.18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Mu biranga mbyo, Kaisari<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Kaisari: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rina ra kinsi mwami wasimanirenga echuo cha ku Roma.</char></note> Okisito wa ku Roma wakuto momba mbu baanse ebea b'ebyuo biti byasimanire we. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Emwanso ngo nge waroso waronjiwanga, mu matu Kurenio nti nge wasimanire echuo cha ku Suria. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Ebea bati benda kiandikisha kira mwea murubungu rwae rw'ebubutwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Yosefu nae watuka murubungu rwa ku Nasareti, mu chuo cha ku Ngariraya, n'ienda mu chuo cha ku Yundea murubungu rw'emubake Ndauti, erubikirwange mbu Beterehemu. Wendanga nko bushwa wabesenga uma mu bana b'eruanda rwa Ndauti. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Wenda kiandikisha nko hima na Maria muchumba wae, na nti murito. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Barekia bari ku Beterehemu, ematu ae erikwikokora arumira. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Wabuta mwana, entangi yae. Wamubumbe byeri n'imuraamya mu muringa w'eririshie esanyama, bushwa barukwanga buari mu nkambi y'ebeni.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maraika wasaire ebasumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Na mu chuo ncho, kwabesenga basumba mu michacha nti barangangǎ ebituana byabo mutu. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" /><char style="w">Maraika</char> wa Nyere Kuritu wasaire bo nsisu, na chaka ch'ebusime bwa Nyere Kuritu chabumbe bo. Nabo basubaha nguru.<figure style="fig" file="WA03803b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="2.9">Emaraika wasaire ebasumba</figure> <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Ina emaraika were bo mbu: «Anga musubaha, bushwa naburishie Mwasi Wakonda eusekokomya nguru ebea bati. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Runotu runo Rukombora wamabutwa bushwa ninu murubungu rwa Ndauti, iwe nge <char style="w" lemma="Masia, Kirisitu, Rukombora">Kirisitu</char> na nge tu Nyere Kuritu. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Na mukumuteerera buno: mukukumana ekabonsobonso kabumbirwa mu byeri na nti kekinde kumunda n'emuringa w'eririshie ebituana.»<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Nampo hasungwa kikembe kikiri cha <char style="w" lemma="Maraika">bamaraika</char> ituka mu mbingu, bakumana emaraika ngo, nti batatange Ongo n'ieba mbu:<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />«Ongo watatwe mu mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:14">na buhoro mu chuo kuri ebea mbi ebashima we.»<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ebasumba benda ku Beterehemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Maraika">Ebamaraika</char> barekia bamakuruka mu mbingu, ebasumba babucha ierane mbu: «Eo, twendi ku Beterehemu kongo twasunga echakusaa ko, inchi echakutwire Nyere Kuritu.» <verse eid="LUK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Ngebumbo, benda tete, bakumana Maria na Yosefu, n'emwana wikinde mu muringa w'eririshie mo ebituana. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Barekia bamasunga ekabonsobonso, batura emyasi nji yakianga emaraika were bo bushwa n'emwana ngo. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Ebea bati mbi barukiranga emwasi ngo ewaturanga ebasumba, bashishara. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Ina Maria iwe, waranganga ebinwa biti mbyo kumunda n'emutima wae n'ianikira mu byo nguru. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Nampo, ebasumba bakuruka nti batatange Ongo n'imumoe bushwa n'ebinwa biti ebyarukiranga bo n'ebyamasunga bo, bushwa mbu ebiti byakweta imbu ebwaturirwanga bo byo n'emaraika.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Emwana waninkwa rina ra Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Emwana warekia wamarumisha matu munani wabutwa, bamumonesha.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bayuta babesenga bamoneshanga emwana w'emuyu erotu rw'emunani wabutwa.</char></note> Bamuninka rina mbu nge Yesu. Erina ndo nge raninkwanga we <char style="w" lemma="Maraika">n'emaraika</char>, nina nti tinensi murito.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu washeiwa mu Numba ya Ongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Ematu erihoswa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Soma <ref loc="LEV 12:1-8">Bar 12.1-8</ref>.</char></note> ra Maria na Yosefu akia arumira, itukana n'ebweba emyomba ya Musa, benda n'emwana ku Yerusaremu kongo bamuninkana kuri Nyere Kuritu. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Bushwa raandikwa mu Myomba ya Nyere Kuritu mbu: «Kinsi ntangi ya muyu iseninkanwayo kwa Nyere Kuritu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Ituk 13.2.</char></note>» <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Basibura tumpite tubi na byana bibi bya pisho imbu bweba emyomba ya Nyere Kuritu.<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ebutahwa bwa Simioni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Mu matu ngo, ku Yerusaremu kwarikanga mwea uma wabikirwa mbu Simoni. Emwea ngo wabesenga waombokara na ntwasubaha Ongo. Wabesenga urindirengi na mbusha y'erisunga erishukara ra Baisiraeri. eMutima Washurukara nti uri hima nae, <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />wabesenga wamamushea mbu iwe watakwi kuba nensi nt'wasunga <char style="w" lemma="Masia, Kirisitu, Rukombora">Kirisitu</char> ingu usetumwayo na Nyere Kuritu. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Simioni wenjiwa n'eMutima Washurukara mu <char style="w">Numba ya Ongo</char>. Ebabuti ba Yesu bamurisha mo kongo bamuronjee imbu bweba eMyomba. <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simioni waangirira emwana Yesu mu mine, watata Ongo, weba mbu:<figure style="fig" file="WA03805b.tif" size="col" copy="Graham Wade" ref="2.28">Simioni waangirira Yesu</figure><verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />«Eo ke Nyere Kuritu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29">umabereresha ebwaraanga ǒngo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29">ngie umanireke ani mukori wabe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29">nikwe rani mu buhoro,<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />bushwa namisungire ani kisine emuramya watuka kuri ǒngo,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />ingu watayarishanga ǒngo mu makako ebea bati,<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />na ngo Muramya ng'usebeseyo echaka ch'ebyuo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:32">nae ng'waserishayo ebusime mu bea babe Baisiraeri.»<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Mu rirukira ebinwa mbyo ebyebange Simioni bushwa n'emwana, ebabuti ba Yesu bashishara. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Simoni wakasane bo, were Maria, nina w'emwana mbu: «Emwana uno wamabutwa kongo wakiria n'isimanya bea bingi ku Isiraeri. Wasebese kiteerere chatuka kwa Ongo ekisetinwa n'ebea, <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />kongo emihaki y'ebea bingi eyarebiswa itabukare. Na ǒngo Maria, ukurukirayo bwae buri mwea wasoswa itumo mu mutima.»<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Emutahwa Ana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Kwabesenga <char style="w">mutahwa</char> uma mumina, erina rae Ana, kikumi cha Fanueri, w'eruanda rwa Aseri. Wabesenga nti wamakunguha nguru. Warikanga na moke myaka irinda ho itukire babingana. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Kuruma nampo, wamana myaka makumi munani na inye mu bushumbakari. Warika mu <char style="w">Numba ya Ongo</char> nti umukorengi mutu na mumwishi, nt'urekenga ebio na nti uhemange. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Weya mu ntambi njo, wabucha itata Ongo. Watura emyasi y'emwana kuri ebea bati ebabesenga barindirengi imbu busekiayo Ongo washukaya ebea ba ku Yerusaremu.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ebabuti ba Yesu bakuruka ku Nasareti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Ebabuti ba Yesu barekia bamakinda ironja imbu bweba eMyomba ya Nyere Kuritu, bakuruka hima nae mu chuo cha ku Ngariraya, murubungu rwabo rwa ku Nasareti.<verse eid="LUK 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Emwana ngo wabesenga woshukange n'ibese na maa, nti urisere butesa, n'enchumo ya Ongo yabesenga hima nae.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mu Numba ya Ongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Kira mwaka, ebabuti ba Yesu nti bendanga ku Yerusaremu mu rotu rukiri <char style="w" lemma="Pasaka">rw'ePasaka</char>.<verse eid="LUK 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Yesu warekia wabese na myaka ikumi na ibi, wenda hima nabo ekunkumanano y'erotu rukiri itukana n'emwenjo w'eBayuta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">EkuBayuta, emwana wamarumisha myaka ikumi na ibi, nti timwana tu. Ngerieba mbu ngie wamukomenwǎ ieya hari ebamakunguhe mu binwa bya Ongo.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Ematu ePasaka arekia ameta, bakuruka ku kwabo, ina emwana Yesu iwe wasia ku Yerusaremu n'ebabuti bae nti tibosi. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Babesenga banikirange mbu kuti uri hima nambi ebendanga nabo. Barekia bamenda uendo rw'otu ruma, babucha imusondekanyie kuri banachabo na kuri mbi bamosi. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Ina bushwa ntíbamusunganga, bakuruka tu ku Yerusaremu nti bamusondekanyange. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Kuruma na matu ashatu, bamukumana mu <char style="w">Numba ya Ongo</char>, nt'warika munkati n'ebahani b'eMyomba, nti urukirange bo n'ishisha bo binwa.<figure style="fig" file="DN00416b.tif" size="span" copy="Darwin Dunham" ref="2.46">Emwana Yesu usishanange ebakwakare binwa mu Numba ya Ongo</figure> <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />N'ebati mbi bamurukiranga bashishara murisunga ebwenge bwae n'emisubyo yae. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Ebabuti bae barekia bamamusunga, bashishara nguru. Nina wamushisha mbu: «Emwana'ni, bushwanki utukore biri buno? Ani na iso twamakusonda na nti twatingirwa na koha.» <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Yesu wasako bo mbu: «Banu munisonderengi inki? Ntibanu mosi rero mbu rakomenwa nibesi mu numba ya Tita?» <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Ina batateereri ekinwa ncho chakianga were bo.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Ngerikia ke Yesu wakuruka hima nabo ku Nasareti, wenderana irukire bo. Nina wabesenga nt'usubukianga ebinwa biti mbyo kumunda n'emutima wae. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Yesu wenderana ibese na butesa, nt'oshukange n'ikokomya Ongo hima n'ebea.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Emahubiri a Yohana Murubiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoh 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Mu mwaka w'erikumi n'isanu w'ebwami bwa Tiberio mubake wa ku Roma, ebakoranga nae nge bano: Ponso Pirato nti nge wasimanire echuo cha ku Yundea, na Herote nti nge wasimanire ku Ngariraya, na musike wabo Firipo nti wasimanire echuo cha ku Iturea na cha ku Tarakoniti. Risania nae ntwasimanire echuo cha ku Abirene. <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Anasi bana Kayafa nabo babesenga nti nge <char style="w" lemma="Kuhani">bakuhani bakiri</char>. Mu matu ngo, Ongo waninka Yohana musike wa Sakaria ekinwa chae nti uri munkati n'ebweru. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Yohana wetana mu byuo biti bya mwendende erusi Yorondani, nti uhubiringi eMwasi Wakonda. Were ebea mbu: «Mubunduke kongo mureke esansambi sinu, murubikwe, na Ongo wasebusasira.»<figure style="fig" file="WA03809b.tif" size="col" copy="Graham Wade" ref="3.3">Yohana uhubiringi ebea</figure> <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Ngebumbo, ebinwa byabererera ebyaandikanga <char style="w">mutahwa</char> Isaya mu kitabo chae mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">«Murenge wa mwea ukuange mu bweru mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">‹Mutunganyanye ense ya Nyere Kuritu, muombore ekusetayo we!<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Kira mpuku isebumbirwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Kira ntata na kira ou biserengechiwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Esanse saomba-omba siseomborwayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">n'esanse s'ebiribu sisebumbirwayo.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Kira mwea wasungi imbu bukianga Ongo washukaya.›»<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Nampo bea bingi beyerenga Yohana warubike bo. Nae were bo mbu: «Banu muri buri nsoka! Banu muhakange mbu mumakocha ibeka ebusubuke bwa Ongo imbu bweyange? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Kai mwendi mushea mu mikorere mbu mumabunduka mwireke esansambi sinu. Kiro mwendi mwitata ho mbu Iburahimu nge titanku winu. Nibwirengi mbu Ongo wamukocha ibundura emakoi ano abesi bana ba Iburahimu! <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />N'enompena, emwanda ngie uri hitina n'emiti. Kira muti ingu ntwabuta byuma byakonda usekerwa n'itawa munkati n'ekasha.»<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Ngerikia ke ebea bamushisha mbu: «Tukie ke buni?» <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Nae wasako bo mbu: «Kinsi ngu uri na nchangi sibi waninkane nima kuri ingu usira kikai, nangu uri na bio nae wakie hotu bubo.» <verse eid="LUK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Batuanyi ba horo nabo bamweyere hotu kongo warubika bo. Bamushisha mbu: «eMuhani, tukie buni?» <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Na Yohana mbu: «Kiro mwendi banu mutarikange bimpe hiyo nambi byakongwa mu mituro.»<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Ebasura nabo bamushisha mbu: «Na bate tukie buni?» Nae wasako bo mbu: «Kiro mwendi muronja bukongobanya mu mwea uti-uti abe imuhambike kinwa, ina mwendi mumoere ebihembo byinu.»<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Ebea babesenga barindirengi erieya ra <char style="w" lemma="Masia, Kirisitu, Rukombora">Kirisitu</char>, n'ebati baanikira mbu kuti ke Yohana nge iwe. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Nampo, Yohana were bo mbu: «Ani naburubika mu mecha, ina ingu weyange kuruma nani uri na maa inirenga. Kasa nani ntínakomenwa iobora n'emirí y'ebirato byae. Iwe useburubika mu Mutima Washurukara na mu kasha. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Watinge rweri mu mine yae mwifufura engano. Usekumanyanya engano n'iranga yo mu mwiso wae, ina waseshika esampafa mu kasha inki katarimanga.»<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Yohana wabesenga uturengi ebea mbo eMwasi Wakonda n'ininka bo mahano mingi. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Emubake Herote wabinga Herondia mukari wa Firipo musikyabo. Wákora hotu bimpe bibí bingi. Bushwa nambyo, Yohana wamufine. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Ina Herote watarika tu kimpe kibi mwitaa Yohana mu mwiyororo.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Erirubikwa ra Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mar 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Ebea bati mbo barekia bamarubikwa, Yesu nae warubikwa. Warekia uhemange, embingu yoboka, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />eMutima Washurukara wahite hiyo nae kimubi buri pisho. Na murenge warukirwa ituka mu mbingu weba mbu: «Ǒngo nge musike wani kitwana chani, nakushima nguru.»<figure style="fig" file="WA03810b.tif" size="col" copy="Graham Wade" ref="3.22">Yohana warubika Yesu</figure><verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ekisasa cha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mat 1.1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yesu warekia wabucha emurimo wae, wabesenga nti uri na myaka buna makumi ashatu. Ebea babesenga bahakange mbu Yesu musike wa Yosefu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:23">Yosefu wabesenga nti musike wa Heri,<verse eid="LUK 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />na Heri wabesenga nti musike wa Matati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:24">na Matati wabesenga nti musike wa Rawi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:24">na Rawi wabesenga nti musike wa Mereki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:24">na Mereki wabesenga nti musike wa Yana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:24">na Yana wabesenga nti musike wa Yosefu.<verse eid="LUK 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Na Yosefu wabesenga nti musike wa Matatia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:25">na Matatia wabesenga nti musike wa Amosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:25">na Amosi wabesenga nti musike wa Nahumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:25">na Nahumu wabesenga nti musike wa Esiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:25">na Esiri wabesenga nti musike wa Nake,<verse eid="LUK 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />na Nake wabesenga nti musike wa Mati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:26">na Mati wabesenga nti musike wa Matatia</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:26">na Matatia wabesenga nti musike wa Simei,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:26">na Simei wabesenga nti musike wa Yoseki</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:26">na Yoseki wabesenga nti musike wa Yota.<verse eid="LUK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Na Yota wabesenga nti musike wa Yoanani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">na Yoanani wabesenga nti musike wa Resa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">na Resa wabesenga nti musike wa Serubaberi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">na Serubaberi wabesenga nti musike wa Saratieri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">na Saratieri wabesenga nti musike wa Neri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">na Neri wabesenga nti<verse eid="LUK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />musike wa Mereki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:28">na Mereki wabesenga nti musike wa Ati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:28">na Ati wabesenga nti musike wa Kosamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:28">na Kosamu wabesenga nti musike wa Erimatamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:28">na Erimatamu wabesenga nti musike wa Eri.<verse eid="LUK 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Na Eri wabesenga nti musike wa Yeshua,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:29">na Yeshua wabesenga nti musike wa Erieseri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:29">na Erieseri wabesenga nti musike wa Yorimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:29">na Yorimu wabesenga nti musike wa Matati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:29">na Matati wabesenga nti musike wa Rawi.<verse eid="LUK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Na Rawi wabesenga nti musike wa Simioni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:30">na Simoni wabesenga nti musike wa Yuta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:30">na Yuta wabesenga nti musike wa Yosefu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:30">na Yosefu wabesenga nti musike wa Yonamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:30">na Yonamu wabesenga nti musike wa Eriakimu.<verse eid="LUK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Na Eriakimu wabesenga nti musike wa Merea</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:31">na Merea wabesenga nti musike wa Mena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:31">na Mena wabesenga nti musike wa Matata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:31">na Matata wabesenga nti musike wa Natani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:31">na Natani wabesenga nti musike wa Ndauti.<verse eid="LUK 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Na Ndauti wabesenga nti musike wa Yese</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:32">na Yese wabesenga nti musike wa Obeti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:32">na Obeti wabesenga nti musike wa Buasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:32">na Buasi wabesenga nti musike wa Sarumoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:32">na Sarumoni wabesenga nti musike wa Nasoni.<verse eid="LUK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Na Nasoni wabesenga nti musike wa Aminatabu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">na Aminatabu wabesenga nti musike wa Atimini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">na Atimini wabesenga nti musike wa Ramu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">na Ramu wabesenga nti musike wa Esironi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">na Esironi wabesenga nti musike wa Peresi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">na Peresi wabesenga nti musike wa Yuta.<verse eid="LUK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Na Yuta wabesenga nti musike wa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">na Yakobo wabesenga nti musike wa Isake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">na Isake wabesenga nti musike wa Iburahimu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">na Iburahimu wabesenga nti musike wa Tera</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">na Tera wabesenga nti musike wa Nahori.<verse eid="LUK 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Na Nahori wabesenga nti musike wa Serungu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">Serungu wabesenga nti musike wa Reu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">na Reu wabesenga nti musike wa Perengi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">na Perengi wabesenga nti musike wa Eberi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">na Eberi wabesenga nti musike wa Sera, na Sera wabesenga<verse eid="LUK 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />nti musike wa Kainama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:36">na Kainama wabesenga nti musike wa Aripakisati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:36">na Aripakisati wabesenga nti musike wa Semu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:36">na Semu wabesenga nti musike wa Noa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:36">na Noa wabesenga nti musike wa Rameke.<verse eid="LUK 3:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Na Rameke wabesenga nti musike wa Metusera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">na Metusera wabesenga nti musike wa Enoke</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">na Enoke wabesenga nti musike wa Yareti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">na Yareti wabesenga nti musike wa Mahareri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">na Mahareri wabesenga nti musike wa Kainama.<verse eid="LUK 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Na Kainama wabesenga nti musike wa Enosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:38">na Enosi wabesenga nti musike wa Seti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:38">na Seti wabesenga nti musike wa Andamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:38">na Andamu wabumbwanga na Ongo.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu werekwa na Mushumbu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat 4.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mar 1.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yesu watuka ekusi muri Yorondani ntwamarisa eMutima Washurukara. N'eMutima ngo wamwenja mu bweru. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Nanko, <char style="w">Mushumbu</char> wamwereka mu matu makumi anye. Mu matu ati ngo, Yesu ntwarerisa bio. Kuruma n'ematu ngo, wakwa rwaka.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Kuruma nampo, <char style="w">Mushumbu</char> wamweyere n'imwire mbu: «Kuba ǒngo Musike wa Ongo, eba n'erikoi rino ribinduki mukati.» <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yesu wamusako mbu: «Raandikwa mu Mitiro Yashurukara mbu: ‹Emwea watakoche iishi bushwa n'emikati ho.›»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Isub 8.3.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Ituka mpo, Mushumbu wamuria hakangama nguru. Na murikohya, wamushea emami ati echuo, <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />n'imwire mbu: «Nasekuninka emaa n'ebutumba bw'emami ati ingi, bushwa mbu nareninkwa ebiti mbi, nani namuninkana byo mu kinsi mwea ewashima ani. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Umanisimanike, ebiti mbi bisebesa byabe.» <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Ina Yesu wamusako mbu: «Raandikwa mu Mitiro Yashurukara mbu: ‹Usimanikenga Nyere kurwabe Ongo wabe n'imukore iwe kisine.›»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Isub 6.13.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Nampo, Mushumbu wamuria ku Yerusaremu. Wamutarisha hamambio <char style="w" lemma="Numba ya Ongo">eNumba ya Ongo</char> n'imwire mbu: «Kuba ǒngo ho Musike wa Ongo, itae ekwansi itukire hano,<figure style="fig" file="DN00405b.tif" size="col" copy="Darwin Dunham" ref="4.9">Mushumbu watarisha Yesu hiyo n'enumba</figure> <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />bushwa raandikwa mu Mitiro Yashurukara mbu: ‹Ongo waseere <char style="w" lemma="Maraika">ebamaraika</char> bae bakurange.› <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Raandikwa mbu: ‹Basekuria mu mine yabo, kongo ekisando chabe kiro chasitara mwikoi.›»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Sab 91.11-12.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Ina Yesu wamusako mbu: «Raandikwa mu Mitiro Yashurukara mbu: ‹Ang'ienda ǒngo werekange Nyere kurwabe Ongo wabe.›»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Isub 6.16.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />
    <char style="w">Mushumbu</char> warekia wamakind'iereka Yesu mu sanse siti, wamureke kasa kashangi kakeke.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wabucha emurimo wae mu chuo cha ku Ngariraya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat 4.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mar 1.14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Yesu wakuruka mu chuo cha ku Ngariraya nti urisere n'ebunkangwe bw'eMutima, n'emyasi yae yeya kuti-kuti mu sankaro'nso. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Wabesenga uhanange mu <char style="w" lemma="Sinangoki">masinangoki</char> abo, n'itatwa n'ebea bati.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu watinwa ku Nasareti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mar 6.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Yesu weya murubungu rwa ku Nasareti kwoshukenga we. Erotu <char style="w" lemma="Sabato">rw'eSabato</char> rwarekia rweya, wakime mu <char style="w">sinangoki</char> imbu esenga buronjanga ho we. Wasimana mwisoma eMitiro Yashurukara. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Bamuninka ekitabo <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa">ch'emutahwa</char> Isaya. Nampo, wobora cho, wasunga impi haandikwa mbu:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />«Mutima wa Nyere Kuritu uri hima nani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">bushwa wamanirondora nihubiri ebasene eMwasi Wakonda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Wanituma iture ebaminwa mbu baseoborwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">n'ebihumihumi mbu bisekae.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Wanituma kobora ebanenwa,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />n'iture ebea imbu emwaka wameya ingu usekiayo Nyere Kuritu washea enchumo yae.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Isa 61.1.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Kuruma nampo, wondonda ekitabo, waninka cho emukori w'esinangoki n'irika. N'ebea bati ebabesenga kumunda <char style="w" lemma="Sinangoki">n'esinangoki</char> babesenga nti bamukaengi nguru. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Yesu wabucha ke iere bo mbu: «Emitiro ino yamarukira banu hano yamabererera runotu.» <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Ebati bamukokome n'ishishara mu binwa byakonda ebyebanga we. Beba mbu: «Mbeni uno nti mwana wa Yosefu?»<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yesu were bo mbu: «Iira, nosi mbu mukunire emushumo uno: ‹Emunganga, iramye ǒngo kisine!› Na bumbo tu mukunire mbu: ‹Twamarukira ebiti byakukora ǒngo murubungu rwa ku Kaperenaumu, kai kora tu byo kuno kurinu.›» <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Nae weba mbu: «Iira nibwirengi: kusira <char style="w">mutahwa</char> eusimirwanga ku rwabo. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Nibwirengi iira: kwabesenga bashumbakari bingi mu chuo cha ku Isiraeri mu biranga by'emutahwa Eria. Mu matu ngo, embura ntíyakenga mu myaka ishatu na chunda, na kwabese rwaka rukiri mu chuo kiti. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Ongo ntíwatumanga Eria kuri mwea uti-uti, ina ho kw'emushumbakari wa ku Sarepata, mu chuo cha ku Sindoni. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Na mu chuo cha ku Isiraeri kwabesenga hotu babembi bingi mu biranga by'emutahwa Erisha. Kusira mwea uti-uti waramanga, ina ho Naamani w'echuo cha ku Suria.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma 2Bam 5.14.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Ebea bati ebabesenga kumunda <char style="w" lemma="Sinangoki">n'esinangoki</char>, murirukira ebinwa mbyo, basubuka nguru. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Basimana, bakururaa Yesu ieya na hikura n'erubungu erwabesenga rwumbwa mu ntata. Bamutarisha hambasiro kongo bamurekera kumbo n'erou. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Ina iwe weta munkati-nkati nabo, n'ienda rae.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wahensa kifwasi mu mwea</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mar 1.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Nampo Yesu wahitire ku Kaperenaumu, mu chuo cha ku Ngariraya. Erotu <char style="w" lemma="Sabato">rw'eSabato</char> rwarekia rwameya, wahana ebea. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Nabo bashishara nguru murisunga imbu buhanange we, bushwa wabesenga uhanange bo na burai. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Mu <char style="w">sinangoki</char> njo mwabesenga mwea uma watingirwa na kifwasi. Nae wakuwa mu murenge mukiri mbu: <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />«eYesu wa ku Nasareti, ǒngo utusondange mo nki? Ukweya katushiria? Ani nikosi nguru, ǒngo nge Mushururuka watumwa na Ongo.»<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yesu wamufine mbu: «Bibira, na tuka kumunda n'emwea uno!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:35">Hiha-hiha, ekifwasi ncho chamurekera ekwansi mu makako ebea, n'ituka kumunda nae nti tíchamubabaya. <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Ebea bati bashishara nguru n'ishishana mbu: «Inki kino? Tutangasunganga binwa biri buno! Emwea uno uhensange ebifwasi mu bukwakare na maa ae, nabyo byatuka!» <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Emyasi ya Yesu yansansabana ekuti mu chuo ncho.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu waramya bakoni bingi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mar 1.29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yesu watuka kumunda <char style="w" lemma="Sinangoki">n'esinangoki</char>, wenda kakime mwa Simoni. Inabe wa Simoni wabesenga ntwamatingirwa na kaburura kasuma, bakonga ke Yesu wamuramye. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Yesu windama kwihi n'emumina ngo, wafine ekaburura mbu katuke kumunda nae, nako katuka. Hiha-hiha, emumina ngo wasimana n'ibucha ironjee bo bio.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Emwishi warekia wamasika, ebabesenga n'ebakoni babo ba kira bususe barisha bo kuri Yesu. Watereka emine yae hambasiro na kira uma mubo, waramya bo. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Ebifwasi byatuka kumunda na bea bingi, na nti bikuange mbu: «Ǒngo nge Musike wa Ongo!» Ina Yesu wáfine byo, na ntwasierenga byo mbu byebe, bushwa byateereranga mbu iwe nge <char style="w" lemma="Masia, Kirisitu, Rukombora">Kirisitu</char>.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wahubiri ku Yundea</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mar 1.35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Ebutu bwarekia bwamacha, Yesu watuka murubungu n'ienda kishika kwahehe. Kikembe kikiri cha bea babucha imusondekanya. Barekia bamamusunga, basonda imuhangire mbu anga wasia tu bo. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Ina Yesu were bo mbu: «Rakomenwa nihubiri eMwasi Wakonda <char style="w" lemma="Bwami bwa Ongo, Bwami bwa mu mbingu">w'eBwami bwa Ongo</char> mu simpe mbungu hotu, nge chasingwa Ongo wanituma.»<verse eid="LUK 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Nae wenderana n'erihubiri mu chuo cha ku Yundea kumunda <char style="w" lemma="Sinangoki">n'emasinangoki</char>.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu wabikira ebanafunsi baroso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mar 1.16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Otu ruma, Yesu wasimana mu kirindo ch'enyansa Kenesareti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyansa ya Kenesareti iro rimpe rina r'enyansa ya ku Ngariraya.</char></note> na bea bingi nti bamukutakutange kongo barukira ekinwa cha Ongo. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Wasunga mitumbu ibi kumushi n'eririba, n'ebarobi nti bamatuka kumunda nayo, babesenga bashuange etukira twabo. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Yesu wakime mu mutumbu uma, na nti nge wa Simoni. Yesu wamwire mbu wahimire o kore kakeke n'ensocho. Nampo warika mo, wabucha ihana ebea.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Warekia wamakind'ihana, washisha Simoni mbu: «Kensea emutumbu ehari emecha mingi na muhiche etukira twinu, murobe bikwa.»<verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simoni wamusako mbu: «eMuhani, twamanuba n'eriroba emutu uti, twakuhina. Ina bushwa mbu ǒngo nge umeba, nasehicha tu etukira.»<verse eid="LUK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Barekia bamahicha etukira, bashura bikwa bingi nguru n'etukira twahiere mu ngerero y'isonda ibereka.<figure style="fig" file="WA03818b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="5.6">Petero na banachae bashura bikwa bingi bushwa na Yesu</figure> <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Nampo basime banachabo b'emutumbu umpe mbu beye kasake bo. Nabo beya, barisia emitumbu ibi bikwa, nayo yabucha itia. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Simoni Petero warekia wasunga ebinwa mbyo, waanda emaru mu makako a Yesu n'ieba mbu: «Nyere Kuritu, umatukange kwihi nani, bushwa mbu ani mwea wa nsambi!» <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Simoni webanga mbo bushwa iwe na babine bati bashishara nguru murisunga ebwingi bw'ebikwa ebyashuranga bo.<verse eid="LUK 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Yakobo na Yohana basike ba Sebendayo ebabesenga hotu barobi hima na Simoni, nabo bashishara. Yesu ke were Simoni mbu: «Kiro usubaha, itukire enompena ukukora murimo w'iroba bea.»<verse eid="LUK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Ngerikia ke bakurura emitumbu yabo kumushi, bareke ebiti n'imisa Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu waramya mubembi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mar 1.40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Yesu warekia uri m'ubungu ruma mu chuo ncho, kwasaa mwea uma nti urisere bibembi emubi uti. Warekia wasunga Yesu, windama embaso ieya n'ekwansi, n'imuhema mbu: «eNyere Kuritu, umasasa, umuniramya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Mat 8.2.</char></note>.» <verse eid="LUK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yesu woro emwine, wamutinge mo n'imwire mbu: «Nashima! Rama!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:13">Hiha-hiha, emwea ngo warama ebibembi. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Yesu wamuhangire nguru mbu: «Ang'iture mwea emwasi uno. Ina enda kishea kuri <char style="w" lemma="Kuhani">ekuhani</char>. Nanko, ukutonga ebisabo imbu bwebanga Musa, kongo rashea mu bea ebati mbu umarama.»<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Na kiro mbo, emwasi wa Yesu wenda nkuru na bea bingi benda batumanange mwirukira ebinwa byae n'irama emakoni abo. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Ina wabesenga ntwishikange nabo kwahehe n'ihema Ongo nko.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu waramya mwea wa rumbonsa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mar 2.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Otu ruma Yesu warekia uhanange ebea. <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisayo">eBafarisayo</char> <char style="w" lemma="Bahani b'eMyomba">n'ebahani b'eMyomba</char> ebatukanga mu kira ubungu rw'echuo cha ku Ngariraya na ku Yundea n'ituka ku Yerusaremu, babesenga nti barerika mpo. Yesu wabesenga nti uramyange ebakoni mu maa a Nyere Kuritu.<verse eid="LUK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Bea bima beya na nti baria mwea wa rumbonsa mu kipoi. Basonda inse y'imukimisha kumunda n'enumba kongo bamutereka hamakako na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Ina barukwa ense y'erimukimisha kumunda bushwa n'enteko nkiri y'ebea. Bushwa nancho, bataya hamambio enumba njo, bakakura mu matebura, bahicha emwea w'erumbonsa munkati-nkati n'ebea, nt'uri mu kipoi chae, n'imusicha mu makako a Yesu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bayuta bima, muriimba emanumba abo, babesenga bariangǎ miti hiyo n'itereka mu yo matebura.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Yesu warekia wamasunga erisimira rabo, weba mbu: «Emirani, esansambi sabe samasasirwa.»<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Bahani b'eMyomba">Ebahani b'eMyomba</char> <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisayo">n'eBafarisayo</char> babucha kwishisha mbu: «Inye mwea ngu eukambange Ongo? Inye ngwamukocha isasira nsambi, kuba ntí Ongo wisine?» <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yesu warekia wamateerera emihaki yabo, washisha bo mbu: «Bushwa nki banu mwishishange ebinwa biti mbyo mu mitima yinu? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Kini kinwa nge chatamba, mu rieba mbu: ‹Esansambi sabe samasasirwa›, abe ieba mbu: ‹Simana, enda?› <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Nisondange musibe mbu ani <char style="w" lemma="Mwana w'eMwea">eMwana w'eMwea</char> niri na bukwakare bwerisasira esansambi hano hansi.» Ngebumbo, Yesu were emwea w'erumbonsa mbu: «Ani nge nikwirengi mbu: simana, ria ekipoi chabe na kuruka ku kwabe.»<verse eid="LUK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Hiha-hiha, emwea ngo wasimana kubusondori nabo ebati. Waria ekipoi chabesenga chikindirengi mu we, wenda ku kwae nti utatange Ongo. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Ebea bati bashishara n'itingirwa na boba. Batata Ongo n'ieba mbu: «Runotu, rero twamasunga binwa bya bishisharo!»<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu were Rawi mbu wamumise</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mar 2.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Kuruma nampo, Yesu watuka mu numba njo. Wasunga mukongori uma wa horo erina rae nge Rawi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rawi nge wabikirwa tu mbu Matayo. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Mat 9.9.</char></note>, ntwarika hamesa yae y'erikongore ehoro. Yesu wamwire mbu: «Nimise!» <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Rawi wasimana, wasia ebiti n'imumisa.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Ituka mpo Rawi waronjee Yesu bio bingi mu numba yae. Bakongori bingi ba horo na bampe bea bingi babesenga barisange hima nabo. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" /><char style="w" lemma="Bafarisayo">eBafarisayo</char> <char style="w" lemma="Bahani b'eMyomba">n'ebahani b'eMyomba</char> barekia bamarukira mbo, babucha ihuhuma. Bashisha <char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">ebanafunsi</char> ba Yesu mbu: «Bushwa nki banu murisange n'iomore hima n'ebakongori b'ehoro, n'ebakori b'ebibi?»<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesu wasako bo mbu: «Ebankangwe ntibarae mu munganga, ina ebakoni. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Nti neyanga kabikira ebea mbi baombokara mu makako a Ongo, ina ebari n'ebubi kongo babunduka ituka mu sansambi sabo.»<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">eBafarisayo bashisha Yesu bushwa n'ebio</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mar 2.18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />
    <char style="w">Bafarisayo</char> bima bashisha Yesu mbu: «<char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">Ebanafunsi</char> ba Yohana hima n'ebitu baronjanga mahemo na bihangisanga ringi irisa bio, ina ebanafunsi babe ibo barisange n'iomo.» <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yesu wasako bo mbu: «Banu mwanikirange mbu mumakocha ihangire ebira ba'ngu waherucha irisa bio entambi ukiri hima nabo? Anga! <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Ina kuseyayo matu shiherucha ngo wakuturwa munkati nabo, n'ematu ngo ke nge asekwihangisayo bo irisa.»<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yesu wakere bo emushumo uno: «Kusira mwea ngu wamukera kiraka mu nchangi nchasha n'iranda cho mu nchangi yamanaa. Kuti wakia mbo, wabese nti wamabenga enchangi nchasha, n'ekiraka ch'enchangi nchasha kitamukocha itingane n'enchangi yamanaa. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Na kusira hotu mwea wamuria <char style="w">ndifai</char> nchasha kumunda na nku y'ohu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Inku s'ohu ito sabesenga inku satunganyiwa na ohu rwa mpene. Bayuta babesenga bushienga ndifai mu nku s'ohu sishasha bushwa mbu ito sitakoche ibereka entambi endifai ibukange. Babesenga baronjanga mbo bushwa mbu esanku s'erohu insi samanaa satamba-tamba na nti samubereka tete. Hano hebange mbu ebinwa mbi byabesenga bihanange Yesu byabesenga bishasha na nti bitamusonyana n'emwenjo wema wa karekare.</char></note> esamanaa. Emwea wámaronja mbo nti endifai nchasha isebuya esanku s'ekihu; nampo endifai isekubuka n'esanku sisekwa busa. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Ina rakomenwa iria endifai nchasha kumunda n'ohu rushasha. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Emwea wamomo mu ndifai ya karekare wataraenga tu mu ndifai nchasha, bushwa waseba mbu: ‹Endifai ya karekare yashamuka nguru!›»<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu nge mine Sabato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mar 2.23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Otu ruma rwa <char style="w">Sabato</char>, Yesu wabesenga wetange mu mashwa a ngano. <char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">Ebanafunsi</char> bae babucha ikekeraa etukobe tw'engano, babungabunga to mu mine n'irisa etuma. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" /><char style="w">Bafarisayo</char> bima bashisha bo mbu: «Era! Bushwa nki banu mukiange binwa ebyahangirwa ikorwa erotu rw'eSabato?»<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yesu wasako bo mbu: «Ntinensi musoma imbu bwaronjanga Ndauti wisine n'ebea bae entambi yarukiranga bo rwaka? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Wakimenga mu <char style="w">Numba ya Ongo</char>, watinge mikati eyasiburwanga Ongo, warisa yo n'ininka mu yo ebea bae, n'emikati njo yakomenwanga rero iriwa ho <char style="w" lemma="Kuhani">n'ebakuhani</char> bisine.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Bar 24.9.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Ngyasingwanga ke Yesu were bo mbu: «Ani <char style="w">Mwana w'eMwea</char> nge mine erotu <char style="w" lemma="Sabato">rw'eSabato</char>.»<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu waramya mwea w'ikasa ra rumbonsa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mar 3.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Otu rumpe rwa <char style="w">Sabato</char>, Yesu wakime mu <char style="w">sinangoki</char> n'ibucha ihana ebea. Kumunda mo nti muri mwea uma wa rumbonsa mu rikasa r'ekwabume. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" /><char style="w" lemma="Bahani b'eMyomba">Ebahani b'eMyomba</char> <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisayo">n'eBafarisayo</char> babesenga bakairirengi Yesu kuti useramya mwea mu rotu rw'eSabato, kongo bashee kinwa chimusongere. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Ina bushwa Yesu wabesenga wosi emyanikiri yabo, ngerikia ke were emwea w'erumbonsa mu rikasa mbu: «Simana! Kensere habusondori n'ebea.» Nae wenda kasimana mpo. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Ngerikia ke Yesu were bo mbu: «Nibushishange: mbeni eMyomba yatukonga ikora byakonda abe ebyema mu rotu rw'eSabato? Iramya mwea abe imushura?»<verse eid="LUK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Yesu wakae bo ebati, kuruma nampo were emwea ngo mbu: «Oro erikasa rabe.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:10">Nae woro erikasa, n'erikasa rae rabesa tu shu. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Ina ebahani b'eMyomba n'eBafarisayo mbo basubuka nguru, babucha ishishana bisine kinki echamukore bo Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu warondora esantumwa ikumi na sibi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mar 3.13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Otu ruma, Yesu wataya mu rou, wenda kakeresha mwihema Ongo emutu muti. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Ebutu bwarekia bwamacha, wabikira <char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">ebanafunsi</char> bae, n'irondora mu bo ikumi na babi, wabikira bo mbu <char style="w">ntumwa</char>. <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />N'emina abo nge ano: Simoni ingu wakianga Yesu waninka erina ra Petero na musikyabo Nderea, na Yakobo, na Yohana, na Firipo na Baritoromayo, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />na Matayo, na Tomasi, na Yakobo musike wa Arufayo, na Simoni w'ekikembe ch'eBaseroti, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />na Yuta musike wa Yakobo, na Yuta Isikarioti ingu wasiburanga Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu uhanange bea n'iramya bakoni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat 4.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Yesu wahita mu rou hima n'esantumwa sae, n'isimana hari buari bwarambama. Himpo nge habesenga <char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">ebanafunsi</char> bae hima na kikembe kikiri nguru cha bea ebatukanga murubungu rwa ku Yerusaremu, na mu chuo cha ku Yundea, na mu sankaro-nkaro s'esambungu sa ku Tiro na ku Sindoni mwendende enyansa. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Ebea mbo beyanga karukira Yesu na kongo waramya emakoni abo. Nambo ebabesenga barenubiwa n'ebifwasi barama. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Ebea bati basondanga imutinge mo, bushwa mbu kumunda nae kwabesenga kusaange maa aramyange ebati.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Erikasanirwa n'eriherwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mat 5.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yesu wakae <char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">ebanafunsi</char> bae n'ieba mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">«Mukasanirwa banu mbi ebasene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">bushwa mbu <char style="w" lemma="Bwami bwa Ongo, Bwami bwa mu mbingu">eBwami bwa Ongo</char> bwinu.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Mukasanirwa banu mbi muri na rwaka enompena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">bushwa mbu mukusukutǎ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Mukasanirwa banu mbi murengi enompena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">bushwa mbu mukûsea.<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />«Mukasanirwa banu, kuba ebea babubaa, bamikuto kuri banu, bamabukamba n'ibubishie emina inu bushwa nani <char style="w" lemma="Mwana w'eMwea">eMwana w'eMwea</char>! <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Ebinwa mbyo bisekia byamasaa, mumoanga na kwikuba-kuba, bushwa mbu mubikirwa bihembo bikiri mu mbingu. Bumbo nge bwakianga bishiku babo bakore <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa">ebatahwa</char>.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Ina mumaherwa banu ebatumba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:24">bushwa murikinda ishee esangoa sinu.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Mumaherwa banu mbi musukuta enompena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">bushwa mbu mukukwa rwaka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Mumaherwa banu mbi museange enompena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">bushwa mbu mukusungayo buhanya n'irire.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Mumaherwa banu kuba ebea bati babutatange, bushwa mbu bumbo nge bwakianga bishiku babo batata hotu ebatahwa b'emanko!<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mushime ebarenda binu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mat 5.38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12a">7.12a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />«Ina banu mbi munirukirange, nibwirengi mbu mwendi mushima ebarenda binu, mwendi mukora byakonda kuri imbi babubaa. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Mwendi muhemere mukisa imbi ebabuherange. Mwendi muheme imbi babuterange. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Emwea wamakurasa kihi mu ritema rima, mushee n'erimpe hotu. Emwea wamakunyaka erikoti rabe, musieri n'erishibabu hotu. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Emwea wamakuhema kikai muninke cho, n'ewakunyaka bikai byabe, angimuhema mbu wakukurichii byo. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Mwendi mukore bampe imbu busondange ikorerwa hotu banu.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />«Banu muri n'ishima ra buni kuti mushima ho mbi ebabushima? Bushwa mbu n'ebea b'esansambi nabo bashimangǎ ho imbi ebashima bo. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Kuba banu mukorengi byakonda kuri ho mbi ebabukorengi byakonda, ini nchime isheange banu? Bushwa mbu n'ebea b'esansambi nabo hotu bakoranenga bumbo. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Kuba banu musombyange ho mbi ebinyihire banu ho mbu bamubutua, ini nchime isheange banu? N'ebea b'esansambi hotu nabo basombyangǎ banachabo b'esansambi mu mwinyihiro mbu basetua imbu bwakwisombyanga bo! <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Ina banu, mwendi mushima ebarenda binu. Mwendi mukore bo byakonda n'isombya bo na nti tímwinyihire ikuruchiwa. Nampo mukuninkwa uhembo rukiri na mukubeseyo bana ba Ongo ingu uri hiyo n'ebiti, bushwa mbu iwe mongo mu bea bati ebabi nambi ebatashimanga mu byakorerwa bo. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Mwendi mukwirane bonso, imbu bubukwirenga Tita winu bonso.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiro muhukumu bampe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mat 7.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />«Kiro mwendi banu muhukumungi bampe, na Ongo nae watendi ubuhukumungi. Kiro mwendi banu mwansiranengi bibí, na Ongo nae watendi ubuansirengi bibí. Mwendi musasira bampe, na Ongo nae wendi ubusasirange na banu hotu. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Mwendi banu muninkange bampe, na Ongo nae wasenda ubuninkange. N'ekisebuninka we, waserisía cho shu n'isoseka cho, n'irisia esanku sinu mu meno. Bushwa mbu Ongo wasebupimireyo mu nengo nji ipimirengi mo banu kuri bampe.»<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Yesu wakere tu ebanafunsi bae emushumo uno, washisha bo mbu: «Mbeni kihumihumi chamakochǎ ibunja kimpe kihumihumi? Ebati babi batakiri mu kiribu? <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" /><char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">Emwanafunsi</char> watarenganga emuhani wae. Ina kinsi mwanafunsi ingu warihanwa shu, wamubesě buri emuhani wae.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />«Buni bwamusunga ǒngo ekasu kari kumunda n'eriso ra munakinu, ina utungarae mu kitika kiri mu riso rabe? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Abe, buni bwamukocha ǒngo iere munakinu mbu: ‹Reke nikukutu ekasu mu riso rabe›, na kendekese kumunda n'eriso rabe ǒngo mukiri kitika! Ǒngo mwea w'enkuse! Kuto kasa ekitika kiri mu riso rabe, kongo ukae ishu n'ikuto ekasu mu riso ra munakinu.»<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Emuti n'ebyuma byao</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mat 7.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12.33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />«Kusira muti wakoma wamubuta byuma byema, abe kusira muti wema wamubuta byuma byakonda. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Bushwa mbu kira muti usibwanga mu byuma byao. Ebea batamusiro byamba abe nkobe mu muti w'erusoa. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Ngebumbo, emwea wakoma webanga binwa byakoma imbu bwakonda emutima wae. N'emwea wema webanga binwa byema imbu ebwema emutima wae. Bushwa mbu ebunu bw'emwea bwebanga binwa ebirisere mu mutima wae.»<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Emanumba abi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat 7.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />«Bushwa nki banu mumbikirange ‹Nyere Kuritu, Nyere Kuritu›, na mutungakora imbi bibwirengi ani? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Nihunange ibushea imbu bwasusa emwea ngu unimisange, n'urukirange ebinwa byani n'ikora byo: <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />wasusanyiwa na mwea wumbanga numba. Watima nguru eroto n'ieya na mu rutandare. Kuruma nampo, wûmba emusingi hiyo n'erutandare n'iumba enumba hiyo n'emusingi. Mbura nyankende yarekia yamake, erusi rwarisa n'emikombi y'irasa mu numba njo, ina itatengi, bushwa mbu yimbwanga shu. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Ina ingu warukira ebinwa byani na watangaronja byo, wasusanyiwa na mwea wumbanga numba mu roto na nti tíwimba musingi. Emibimbi yarekia y'irasa mu numba njo, mu kashangi ho kakeke, yenduka n'ikakukara.»<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu waramya mukori wa mukwakare w'ebasura</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat 8.5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Yesu wakianga wameba ebinwa biti mbyo kuri ebea mbi babesenga bamurukirange, wenda murubungu rwa ku Kaperenaumu. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Nanko kwabesenga mukwakare uma wa basura wa Baroma. Emukwakare ngo wabesenga na mukori wae uma washima we nguru. Emukori ngo wabesenga usambange nti uri mu nsanga nareke. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Entambi yakianga emukwakare o warukira emwasi wa Yesu, watuma kuri we bakungu bima ba Bayuta imuhema weye karamya emukori wae. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Ebakungu mbo barekia basaa hari Yesu, bamuhema nguru mbu: «Emwea uno wakomenwa umukori ebikuhemange we, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />bushwa mbu iwe utushimanga bate eBayuta, nae ngwakutwimbenga <char style="w" lemma="Sinangoki">n'esinangoki</char> yitu.»<verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Naha Yesu wenda hima nabo. Warekia weya kwihi n'enumba y'emukwakare ngo, watuma bira bae bamweberi kuri Yesu mbu: «eNyere Kuritu, kiro winubya, bushwa mbu ani ntínakomenwa ikukoke mu mwani. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Ngyasingwa nasunga nti tínakomenwa ieya harikire ǒngo. Ina, ǒngo eba kinwa kima ho, n'emukori wani waserama. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Niri n'ebanisimanirenga mu murimo witu, ina nani niri nambi basimanirenga ani. Namere uma mbu: ‹Enda!› Nae ntwenda na! Namere umpe mbu: ‹Iya!› Naha nti weya! Namere ntumwa yani mbu: ‹Kora buno!› Nae nti wakora na bumbo!»<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Yesu warekia warukira ebinwa mbyo, washishara bushwa n'emukwakare ngo. Wakae kuri ekikembe ch'ebamumisange, n'ieba mbu: «Nibwirengi, ntangasunganga mu chuo kiti cha ku Isiraeri mwea uri n'isimira nguru buri uno!»<verse eid="LUK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Ebea mbi batumwanga barekia bakuruka ekunumba, bakumana emukori ngo ntwamarama.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wafura musike w'emushumbakari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Kuruma n'ebinwa mbyo, Yesu wenda tu murubungu ruma nge Naina. <char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">Ebanafunsi</char> bae hima na kikembe kikiri cha bea bamumisa. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Wakianga wasond'ieya mu rubi rw'erukito rw'erubungu ndo, kwasaa bea baria kinda cha ngomo ya musike. Na nina w'emusike ngo nti mushumbakari. Bea bingi b'erubungu ndo babesenga nti batindikiange nyamukwirirwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Nyere Kuritu warekia wasunga nyamukwirirwa, wamukwire bonso n'imwire mbu: «Ang'ire.» <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Yesu washere kwihi n'itinge mu sanduku, n'ebea mbi babesenga baria esanduku basimana. Weba mbu: «Nikwirengi ǒngo musike, sumuka!» <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Himpo, wasumuka, warika n'ibucha ieba. Yesu wámukurucha kuri nina. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Ebea bati batingirwa na boba, batata Ongo nti bebange mbu: «<char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa">Emutahwa</char> mukiri wasaire tu ku kwitu! Ongo wameya kashukaya ebea bae.» <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Emwasi ngo wansansabana ku Yundea ekuti na mu byuo biti bya mwendende.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohana watuma banafunsi bae babi kuri Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mat 11.2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">Ebanafunsi</char> ba Yohana bamuture emwasi w'ebiti mbi byetayo. Nampo Yohana wabikira babi mu bo. <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />Watuma bo kwa Nyere Kuritu kamushisha mbu: «Mbeni ǒngo nge Masia ingu wakomenwanga ieya, abe turindire umpe?» <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Ebanafunsi mbo barekia beya kuri Yesu, bamwire mbu: «Yohana Murubiki wamatutuma kuri ǒngo tukushishe kuba ǒngo nge Masia ingu weyange, abe turindire umpe.» <verse eid="LUK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Mu ntambi iya-iya, Yesu waramya bea bingi imbi babesenga banubange na makoni mingi, n'eburema hima nambi batigirwa n'ebifwasi. Waninka hotu bihumihumi bingi enchumo y'erikae. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Nampo, Yesu wasako ebanafunsi ba Yohana mbu: «Mwendi kature Yohana ebiti mbi byamasunga banu n'irukira banu: ebihumihumi ngie bikaengi, n'ebirema ngie byendange, n'ebabembi ngie baramange,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hano, erirama r'emubembi nge rishukara.</char></note> n'ebatwitwi ngie barukirange, n'ebakwire ngie bafukange, n'eMwasi Wakonda ngie uturwange kuri ebasene. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Wamakasanirwa kinsi mwea ngu watariminyiyo erisimira rae kuri ani.»<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Ebanafunsi ba Yohana barekia bamakuruka kuri we, Yesu wabucha iture ebikembe by'ebea emyasi yeba kuri Yohana mbu: «Mbeni mwendanga mu bweru kasunga ko nki? Mbeni eriseke indi rabesenga rirubyiwange n'eriuhu? Anga! <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Mwendanga kasunga ko inki ke? Mbeni mwea ingu wambara nchangi yahunda? Anga! Ebambarangǎ nchangi sa busi bwasuma na bari mu muanoano, barikanga mu manumba ebwami. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Mbeni mwendanga kasunga nki ke? <char style="w">Mutahwa</char>? Ae, nibwirengi banu mbu iwe wabesenga nti mukwakare irenga emutahwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Yohana ngo nge washembwa mu Mitiro Yashurukara mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">‹Rukira! Natuma entumwa yani ikusondori,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">kongo yatunganya ense yasetere mo ǒngo!›»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Mara 3.1.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Nibwirengi mbu: «Mu bea mbi barikire mu chuo, kusira mukwakare warenga Yohana. Ina kinsi ingu mwanunke mu <char style="w" lemma="Bwami bwa Ongo, Bwami bwa mu mbingu">Bwami bwa Ongo</char>, iwe nge mukwakare imurenga.» <verse eid="LUK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Ebea bati mbi barukiranga Yohana, n'ebakongori b'ehoro hotu basimira mbu Ongo nge waombokara, na Yohana warubika bo. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Ina <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisayo">eBafarisayo</char> n'ebahani b'eMyomba ibo bitinire ebisondange Ongo kuri bo. Bushwa nancho, batina mbu batarubikwi na Yohana. <verse eid="LUK 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yesu weba tu mbu: «Nisusanye ebea ba runotu na banye? Ibo bea bari buni? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Barengekane na bana mbi barika kwansi mu butara nti babikirange babine mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">‹Twakubwombere ngoma ina ntímukumina!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">Twakubusimbenga rumbo rwa kiro ina ntímukure!›<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />«Ngebuno hotu bweyanga Yohana Murubiki, iwe nti witinishanga irisa bio n'iomo <char style="w">ndifai</char>. Banu nti mwebanga mbu uri na bifwasi. <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Ani <char style="w">Mwana w'eMwea</char> nameya nirisange n'iomo, banu mwebange tu mbu: ‹Mukai! Uno murohoroho tuna mutamiri, mwira w'ebakongori b'ehoro na bisa esansambi.› <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Ina ebati mbi basimira Ongo, basibirira mbu ebutesa bwae bwaombokara.»<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mu numba ya Simoni Mufarisayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisayo">Mufarisayo</char> uma wabikira Yesu mbu weye karisa bio mu mwae. Yesu wenda mu numba y'eMufarisayo ngo, warika n'irisa bio. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Na murubungu ndo mwarikanga mumina uma nti uri na nkuru yema. Emumina ngo warekia warukira emwasi mbu Yesu urisange bio mw'eMufarisayo, weya mo na nti wahata murangi uma urisere marashi a busi bwasuma. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Weya n'isimana kuruma na Yesu, kwihi n'ebisando byae n'urengi. Ebiririo byae byabucha irare mu bisando bya Yesu, wakono byo n'ebuteo bwae. Warimba ebisando<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">EkuBayuta, kuba emwea uhunange ishea umpe eshima mu rimukoke, wabesenga urimbanga ebisando byae.</char></note> bya Yesu n'isingo byo marashi. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />eMufarisayo ngu wabikiranga Yesu mu mwae warekia wasunga bumbo, w'iebesha mu mutima mbu: «Emwea uno wamubesengi mutahwa, wamusibange mbu emumina uno umutigengi mo wasusa buni. Wamuteererange rero mbu iwe uri na nkuru yema.»<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yesu were eMufarisayo ngo mbu: «Simoni, niri na chikushisha.» Simoni wasako mbu: «eMuhani, eba.» <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yesu weba mbu: «Kwabesenga bea babi bisombya behe kwa mwea uma. Uma wabesenga na mwinda wa tinari<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tinari yabesenga behe. N'etinari nima nge yabesenga ikorerwanga mu mubisi w'otu ruma.</char></note> mia isanu, n'eumpe makumi asanu. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Shemine ebehe mu risunga mbu barukwa maa erikurucha ebehe byae, wasasira bo. Niri ke, mu bano babi, inye ngwaseshima emwea o nguru?» <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simoni wasako mbu: «Nasunga nti ungu wasasirwanga emwinda mukiri.» Yesu wamwire mbu: «Umasako shu.»<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Nampo, Yesu wakae kuri emumina ngo n'iere Simoni mbu: «Usunga emumina uno? Nakukime muno mu mwabe nt'ukumbese mecha ishua ebisando, ina emumina uno, iwe wamashuwa ebisando byani n'ebiririo byae n'ikono byo n'ebuteo bwae. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Ǒngo umanikoke na nt'ukunirimba ebisando, ina emumina uno ntíwakureke irimba ebisando byani itukire nakime muno. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Ǒngo nt'ukusingo mafuta mu muntwe wani, ina iwe wamasingo ebisando byani marashi. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Bushwa nancho, nikwirengi mbu nakiro esansambi s'emumina uno singi nguru, ina esiti samasasirwa. Kino nge chashea mbu emumina uno washima nguru. Ina ngu wasasirwa mu bikeke watakoche ishea nchime ningi.»<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Nampo ke, Yesu were emumina ngo mbu: «Esansambi sabe samasasirwa.»<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Imbi babesenga barisange hima na Yesu, babucha kwiebesha mbu: «Uno nae inye usasirange esansambi?» <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Ina Yesu were tu emumina ngo mbu: «Enda rabe na buhoro, erisimira rabe ramakushukaya.»<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Ebamina ebasakenga Yesu mu murimo wae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Kuruma naha, Yesu weta mu sambungu nkiri-nkiri n'eseke-seke nti uhanange n'itura eMwasi Wakonda <char style="w" lemma="Bwami bwa Ongo, Bwami bwa mu mbingu">w'eBwami bwa Ongo</char>. Esantumwa sae ikumi na sibi sabesenga hima nae, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />na bamina bima mbi baramyiwanga nae bifwasi na makoni ampe. Munkati n'ebamina mbo, habesenga uma erina rae nge Maria, ingu ubikirwange mbu wa ku Makitara ingu wakianga Yesu wahambura mo bifwasi birinda, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />na Shani mukari wa Kusa, murangi w'ebehe bya Herote, hima na Susana na bampe bingi. Ebamina bano babesenga bakutongǎ behe byabo mwisake Yesu n'esantumwa sae.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mushinga wa mweki w'embuto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mar 4.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Bea ba kinsi ubungu babesenga biyerengi Yesu, na kikembe kikiri cha bea bakumanana. Nampo Yesu wakere bo emushinga uno mbu:<verse eid="LUK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />«Mweki uma wendanga keka mbuto sae. Warekia urekeraange esambuto mu rishwa rae, sima sarare mwendende n'ense. Ebea banyenchaa to n'emirónge yara to.<figure style="fig" file="WA03841b.tif" size="col" copy="Graham Wade" ref="8.5">Emweki urekeraange esambuto sae</figure> <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Simpe sakire habasirwa n'erutandare. Sarekia samashuka, sakama bushwa n'erirukirwa mecha. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Simpe mbuto sakire munkati n'emenke. Emenke njo yashuka hima n'embuto n'iekenya to. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Ina simpe mbuto ito sarare mu oto rwakonda, sashuka na kira kakobe kabuta mpinga iyana.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Yesu warekia wamakinda ieba ebinwa bya, weba mbu: «Ingu uri n'emate erirukira warukire!»<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu webange mu mishumo bushwa nki?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mar 4.10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">Ebanafunsi</char> ba Yesu bamushisha ke buni nge bweba emushinga ngo. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Wasako bo mbu: «Banu mumashee nchumo y'erisiba enama <char style="w" lemma="Bwami bwa Ongo, Bwami bwa mu mbingu">y'eBwami bwa Ongo</char>, ina ntí ngebumbo mu bea bampe. Ibo nerengi bo ebinwa bino mu ngano, kongo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">‹Bakae ina batasungi kikai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">barukire ina batasibi kikai.›»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Isa 6.9.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wansonsomora emushinga w'emweki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mar 4.13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />Yesu weba mbu: «Emushinga w'emweki weba buno mbu: embuto nge kinwa cha Ongo. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />N'embuto eyararenga mwendende n'ense nge sasusanyiwa n'ebea barukiranga ekinwa cha Ongo. Ina <char style="w">Mushumbu</char> weyanga kakuto ekinwa ncho mu mitima yabo kongo batasimiri n'ikocha ishukara. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Esambuto nsi sararenga hutandare sasusanyiwa nambi barukiranga ekinwa cha Ongo n'isimira cho na ngoa. Ina ekinwa ncho kitarikanga na miri kumunda nabo. Basimiranga cho mu ntambi nkeke ho, emyereko yamahiere bo nti basia cho. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Embuto nsi sakirenga munkati n'emenke sasusanyiwa n'ebea mbi barukiranga ekinwa cha Ongo. Ina eminubo, ebusoki n'erishima by'echuo byekenyanga ekinwa ncho mu mitima yabo. Ngyasingwanga batabuti byuma byako. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Na nsi esararenga mu roto ndu rwakoma, ito sasusanyiwa n'ebea mbi barukiranga ekinwa cha Ongo n'ibika cho mu mutima wakonda na w'iira. Bimbo nge baranganga ekinwa ncho n'isumya mutima n'ihiere mwibuta byuma byakonda.»<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Emushinga w'eritara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mar 4.21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />Kuruma nampo, Yesu weba mbu: «Kusira mwea wamusacha eritara n'ibumbe ro mu kikai abe warie ro kumunda n'entange. Ina urembeanga ro mu kango kongo ebakimengi mu numba basunge echaka. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Kiti nchi chabiswa kisetaburwayo, na kinsi nama isesaayo hambuka.<verse eid="LUK 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />«Kai mukohyanga n'eburukirange banu ebinwa. Bushwa mbu ingu urikire na kikai wasenikwa tu kimpe, ina ingu usira kikai wasenyakwa nanchi chanikirengi we mbu chae.»<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banachabo Yesu na nina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mar 3.31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Otu ruma, banachabo Yesu na nina beya kamusunga, ina ntíbakochanga imusunga bushwa n'ekikembe kikiri ch'ebea. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Ngerikia ke ebea bere Yesu mbu: «Banakinu na nsoko basimana hambuka, basondange ikusunga.» <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Ina Yesu wasako bo mbu: «Banakitu na koyo nge bimbi barukirange kinwa cha Ongo n'ikora cho.»<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wakobesha enyansa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mar 4.35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Otu ruma Yesu wakime mu mutumbu hima <char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">n'ebanafunsi</char> bae. Were bo mbu: «Tusoke mu o mwiri w'enyansa.» Benda. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Barekia basokange, Yesu wenda toro. Hiha-hiha, iuhu rasuma rikaso mu nyansa. N'emecha abucha ikime mu mutumbu, beya mu ngerero y'isonda itia. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Ebanafunsi bae bakensere kwihi nae, bamusimo nti bebange mbu: «Nyere Kuritu, Nyere Kuritu, twakwa!» Yesu warekia wabambuka, wafine emibimbi, nayo yakoba n'emecha na o akoba.<figure style="fig" file="WA03847b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="8.24">Yesu wafine emibimbi y'emecha</figure> <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Nampo ke Yesu washisha ebanafunsi bae mbu: «Erisimira rinu riri kuni?» Basubaha n'ishishara, babucha ishishana mbu: «Mwea wa buni uno? Ufinengi emibimbi n'enyansa, nabyo nti baronja ebweba we nakuba!»<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu waramya mwea watingirwa na bifwasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mar 5.1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Kuruma nampo, Yesu n'ebanafunsi bae basoka enyansa. Basia emutumbu mu chuo ch'eBangerasi, mu o mwiri w'echuo cha ku Ngariraya. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Yesu wakianga watuka mu mutumbu, wakumanana na mwea uma murubungu ntwatingirwa na bifwasi. Emwea ngo wamananga matu mingi ntwatambaranga tu nchangi, na nti watarikanga tu mu numba, ina ekutuburi ho. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Warekia wasunga Yesu, wirake na kwirunda ekwansi mu makako a Yesu, n'ieba mu murenge mukiri mbu: «eYesu Musike wa Ongo ingu uri hiyo n'ebiti, mbeni kuri kinwa munkati ani nabe? Nikuhemange, ang'ininubya!»<verse eid="LUK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Webanga mbo bushwa mbu Yesu wabesenga wamere kifwasi ncho mbu kituke kumunda n'emwea ngo. Ekifwasi ncho chabesenga kitingengǎ emwea ngo meta mingi. Nakiro mbu bamumina emaboko n'ebisando mu burebure na byuma kongo wataromboki, wabesenga ukekeraanga byo. Ekifwasi ncho chabesenga kimutaangǎ inku kutarikanga bea. <verse eid="LUK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesu wamushisha mbu: «Erina rabe ng'inye?» Nawe wasako mbu: «Erina rani ‹Kikembe.›» Wasakonga mbo bushwa mbu kumunda nae kwabesenga bifwasi bingi. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Ebifwasi mbyo byakonga Yesu mbu wamahensa bo kiro warekera bo ekwirunga.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Nampo habesenga nti harikire iimba rikiri ra mpunu sihuange hambasiro n'erou. Ebifwasi mbyo byakonga Yesu nguru mbu wareki byo, bikimi mu riimba r'esampunu. Yesu warisia byo. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Ngerikia ebifwasi byatuka mu mwea ngo n'ikime mu sampunu. Eriimba riti r'esampunu rahita n'erou n'ikwirekera mu nyansa n'itia.<figure style="fig" file="WA03846b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="8.33">Esampunu satia mu nyansa</figure> <verse eid="LUK 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Ebasumba b'esampunu barekia basunga ekinwa ncho, benda tete katura emwasi ekumbuka n'ekutunsari. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Ebea beya kasunga ebyameta. Barekia beya hari Yesu, bakumana emwea ngo wamakuturwa mo ebifwasi ntwarika mu makako a Yesu. Emwea ngo wabesenga nti wamambara nchangi, n'ebwenge bwae nti bwamakuruka. Ebea mbo basubaha. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Ebasunganga ebyakweta, babucha itura emwasi kuri bampe bea imbu bwakukianga emwea ngu wabesenga n'ebifwasi warama.<verse eid="LUK 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Ebea bati b'echuo ch'eBangerasi batingirwa na koha nguru. Bushwa nancho, bere Yesu mbu: «Tutukiriri mu chuo kitu.» Ngebumbo, Yesu wakime mu mutumbu na kwikuruke rae.<verse eid="LUK 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Emwea ngu wakuturwanga ebifwasi wahema Yesu mbu wendi hima nae, ina Yesu wamutinire, wamwire mbu: <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />«Kuruka ku kwinu, enda katura ebiti byamakukore Ongo.» Emwea ngo wenda kurwabo n'itura ebiti murubungu ruti ebyakumukore Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu waramya mwisi wa Yairo na mumina uma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mar 5.21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Yesu warekia wakuruka wasoka mu umpe mwiri w'enyansa, nkumanano nkiri yamukoke na ngoa bushwa mbu ebati babesenga bamurindirengi. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Nampo, mukwakare uma wa <char style="w">sinangoki</char> mbu nge Yairo weya. Wisunda ekwansi mu bisando bya Yesu n'imuhema mbu weye ku kwae, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />bushwa mbu engomo yae y'ekikumi yabesenga iri mu nsanga nareke. Ekikumi ncho chabesenga kiri na myaka buna ikumi na ibi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Yesu warekia wendange kwa Yairo, kikembe kikiri cha bea chabesenga nti kimukutakutange. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Mu kikembe ncho mwabesenga mumina uma warisamba bukoni bwituka mo nchama. Wabesenga wamahea n'ebukoni mbo myaka ikumi na ibi. Wabesenga ntwamahea ebehe byae biti kuri ebanganga. Ina kwarukwa na uma ewakochanga imuramya. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Emumina ngo wasaire Yesu kuruma nae, waturana mwendende enchangi yae. Hiha-hiha, ebukoni bwae bwerituka enchama bwarama nakuba.<verse eid="LUK 8:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yesu washisha mbu: «Inye ngwamanitinge mo?» Ebea bati bituna, ina Petero weba mbu: «eNyere Kuritu, utungasunga mbu bea bingi bakutimba n'ikukutakuta?» <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Ina Yesu weba mbu: «Kuri ho mwea ewamanitinge mo, bushwa mbu nasunga ntyemaa amanituka mo.» <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Emumina ngo warekia wasunga mbu bamamukima, wirisha wisine nti utitimanengi na boba na kwisunda mu makako a Yesu. Nampo habusondori n'ebea bati, watura echakusingwa wamutinge mo nambu wamarama we hiha-hiha. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yesu ke wamwire mbu: «Emwisiani, erisimira rabe ramakushukaya. Enda rabe mu buhoro.»<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Yesu warekia ukiri webange ebinwa bya, kwa Yairo <char style="w" lemma="Sinangoki">mukwakare w'esinangoki</char> kwasaa mwea uma n'iere Yairo mbu: «Enyere kuritu, Oho! Mwisyabe wamakera emutima! Ang'inubya tu eMuhani.» <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Ina Yesu warekia warukira mbo, were Yairo mbu: «Ang'isubaha, simira ho, waserama.»<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Yesu warekia weya mu numba ya Yairo, ntíwananga ikime mo na umpe mwea warenga Petero, Yohana, Yakobo, hima n'ishe w'emwana na nina. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Ebea bati babesenga barengi na kwikama-kama bushwa n'erikwa r'ekikumi ncho. Ina Yesu were bo mbu: «Kiro mure, bushwa mbu ntíwakwa ina urere!» <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Ebea mbo babucha imusea, bushwa ibo basibanga mbu wamakind'ikwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Yesu wamutinge mu rikasa n'imwire mu murenge mukiri mbu: «Emwisiani, simana!» <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Hiha-hiha, wakurucha emutima, n'isimana. Yesu were bo mbu: «Mumunike bio.» <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Ishe na nina bashishara nguru. Ina Yesu wahangire bo nguru mbu kiro bereka itura kuri mwea uti-uti imbi byamasunga bo.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu watuma esantumwa ikumi na sibi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10.5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mar 6.7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Otu ruma, Yesu warikecha esantumwa sae ikumi na sibi, waninka to maa na burai bwerihensa ebifwasi n'iramya ebakoni. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Watuma to katura emyasi <char style="w" lemma="Bwami bwa Ongo, Bwami bwa mu mbingu">y'eBwami bwa Ongo</char> n'iramya ebakoni. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Were to mbu: «Mu ruendo rwinu, anga muria kikai kiti-kiti abe nkoma, abe inku, abe bio, abe behe, kira mwea warianga ho nchangi nima. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Murikanga mu numba yasekokerwa mu banu nambu bwatuki banu murubungu ndo. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Mu kinsi ubungu indu rwasekia bisa kuro batina ibukoke, mutukanga mu ro nti banu mutitongi emukungú w'ebisando byinu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Itito emukungú w'ebisando ngerieba mbu emwea ewakutumwanga usira tu mwinda kuri ebea ebakurishiwanga emwasi nabo bitine o.</char></note> Ekinwa ncho kiseshea bo mbu bakukora bubi.» <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Esantumwa senda, seta ubungu m'ubungu, siturange eMwasi Wakonda n'iramya ebea ekuti.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Herote wasubaha emwasi wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mar 6.14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Herote, mukwakare w'echuo cha ku Ngariraya, warukira emyasi iti y'ebinwa bikorwange. Nawe wakwa koha bushwa mbu bea bima babesenga bebange mbu Yohana Murubiki ngwamafuka. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Na bampe babesenga bebange mbu <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa">emutahwa</char> Eria nge wamasungwa tu. N'ebampe beba mbu uma mu batahwa ba karekare nge wamafuka. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Ina Herote weba mbu: «Ani nge nebanga mbu bakere emuntwe wa Yohana. Mbeni ingu nirukirange emyasi yae, iwe inye tu?» Bushwa nancho, Herote wasonda ke buni bwasesunga we Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wasukucha bea erefu isanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoh 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Ntumwa">Esantumwa</char> sarekia sakuruka, bature Yesu emyasi iti nji yakukora bo. Naha wenda nabo hima. Kuruma nampo, Yesu wishika nabo kwihi na ku Betesaita. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Ebikembe by'ebea byarekia byamasiba mbu kuko nge kwameta we, byamutucha ko. Yesu wakoke bo n'ibucha ieba nabo bushwa <char style="w" lemma="Bwami bwa Ongo, Bwami bwa mu mbingu">n'eBwami bwa Ongo</char>. Nampo waramya ebati mbi bahunanga mbu waramye bo.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Emwishi warekia wamabucha itamba, entumwa ikumi na sibi sa Yesu samweyere n'imwire mbu: «eNyere Kuritu, Reke ebea bano bendi kasonda nkambi na bio mu sambungu esiri kwihi-kwihi bushwa mbu hano turi hasira bea.» <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Ina Yesu wasako bo mbu: «Banu bisine muninke bo bio!» Nabo bamusako mbu: «Bate turi ho na mikati isanu na bikwa bibí. Ǒngo uhunange mbu twendi kachure ebea bati bano bio?» <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Himpo habesenga nti harikire babume buna erefu isanu. Yesu were esantumwa sae mbu sirikeche bo mu bikembe bya bea makumi asanu-asanu.<verse eid="LUK 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Esantumwa sakora bumbo, sarikecha ebea bati ekwansi. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Kuruma, Yesu watinge emikati isanu njo n'ebikwa bibí mbyo, wakae ekwio, watata Ongo. Nampo, wabengaa byo, waninka byo <char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">ebanafunsi</char> bae mbu babanyii ebea bati. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Ebati barisa n'isukuta. Esantumwa sasombo ebyasianga bo, barísia mitundu ikumi na ibi.<figure style="fig" file="WA03855b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="9.17">Yesu wasukucha bea bingi bio</figure><verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petero weba mbu Yesu nge Kirisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mat 16.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mar 8.27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Otu ruma Yesu wabesenga uhemange Ongo iwe wisine. <char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">Ebanafunsi</char> bae babesenga barikire kwihi nae, washisha bo mbu: «Mbeni ebea bebange mbu ani ng'inye?» <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Nabo mbu: «Bima bebange mbu ǒngo nge Yohana Murubiki, bampe mbu ǒngo nge Eria, n'ebampe mbu ǒngo uma mu <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa">batahwa</char> ba karekare ewafukanga.» <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Yesu washisha bo mbu: «Na banu ke mwebange mbu ani ng'inye?» Petero wamusako mbu: «Ǒngo nge <char style="w" lemma="Masia, Kirisitu, Rukombora">Kirisitu</char> ingu watutumire Ongo.»<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu watura emwasi w'erikwa n'erifuka rae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mat 16.20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Mar 8.30—9.1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Yesu wahangire bo nguru mbu kiro bereka iture umpe mwea emwasi ngo. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Were tu bo mbu: «Rakomenwa ani <char style="w">Mwana w'eMwea</char> ninube n'itinwa n'ebakungu, <char style="w" lemma="Kuhani">n'ebakuhani</char> hima <char style="w" lemma="Bahani b'eMyomba">n'ebahani b'eMyomba</char>. Niseshurwa, ina erotu rw'emeta ashatu nti nafuka.»<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Ngerikia were ebea bati mbu: «Kuba emwea warae inimisa, watendi wiraengi mo. Ina wenda uriange emusaraba wae n'initucha ematu ati. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Bushwa mbu ingu usondange iramya ebuingo bwae waseriminyayo bo, ina ingu waseshia ebuingo bwae bushwa nani waseramyayo bo. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Emwea wamashee ebusoki bw'echuo kiti, wabese ntwamashee kikai nki ke kuba wariminya ebuingo bwae abe kwitaa mu roku wisine? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Emwea wamanikwire nkene n'ikwire ebinwa byani nkene, ani <char style="w" lemma="Mwana w'eMwea">eMwana w'eMwea</char> nasemukwireyo hotu nkene. Rasebeseyo buno mu rotu ruseyayo ani mu busime bwani, na nge busime bwa Tita, na nge <char style="w" lemma="Maraika">bw'ebamaraika</char> bashurukara. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Iira, nibwirengi mbu: bima mu banu mbi muri hano, batakwiyo kuti ntíbasunga nensi ebwasimana <char style="w" lemma="Bwami bwa Ongo, Bwami bwa mu mbingu">eBwami bwa Ongo</char>.»<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wabundurwa embaso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat 17.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mar 9.2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Kuruma na matu buna munani Yesu warekia wamakinda ieba ebinwa mbyo, iwe waringa Petero, Yakobo na Yohana, wataya nabo hiyo n'erou kahema Ongo. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Warekia uhemange, embaso yae yabinduka, n'esanchangi sae wasana n'inyenya nguru. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30-31" />Nampo, kumunda n'echaka ncho kwasaa babume babi, Musa bana Eria. Ebabume babi mbo, babesenga nti bebanange na Yesu bushwa n'ebusekinda we emurimo wae, mu rikwire ku Yerusaremu. <verse eid="LUK 9:30-31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Entambi njo, Petero na babine babesenga bamenda toro twingi. Ina barekia basimuka, basunga ebusime bwa Yesu n'ebabume babi mbo babesenga basimana hima nae. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Ebabume babi mbo barekia basonda isiana na Yesu, Petero wamwire mbu: «eNyere Kuritu, rakonda buno buri bate hano. Twimbe hema ishatu: nima yabe, impe ya Musa na impe ya Eria.» Nae wabesenga webange nti tíwosi echebange we.<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Mu ntambi Petero wabesenga webange mbo, erutundo rwahita n'ibumbe bo. Esantumwa nso sasubaha mu ribumbirwa n'erutundo ndo. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Kwarukirwa murenge uma wasaa mu rutundo ndo ntwebange mbu: «Uno nge Musikyani ewarondoranga ani. Mwendi banu mumutee mate!» <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Kuruma n'erirukira emurenge o, Yesu wasungwa ntwamasia wisine. Ebinwa biti mbyo ebyasunganga esantumwa mpo, ntíbaturenga mwea uti-uti enama njo ematu ati ngo.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu waramya mwana uri na kifwasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mat 17.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mar 9.14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Mu richa r'ebutu, Yesu n'entumwa sae ishatu nso bahita erou. Kikembe kikiri cha bea bamweyere. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Hiha-hiha, mwea uma munkati n'ekikembe wakua mbu: «eMuhani, nakukonga unikairi mu musikyani, bushwa mbu iwe nge mwanani uma ho! <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Ukiange wamatingirwa n'ekifwasi, hiha-hiha, emwana ntwirake, nti chamuinya-inya nguru n'erihuro nti ramutuka mu bunu. Ekifwasi ncho kitangamutuka mo tete, kimunubyange nguru. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Nakongayo <char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">ebanafunsi</char> babe mbu bahense cho, ina karankuso.»<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yesu wasako mbu: «Ah! Banu ebea b'ematu ano, banu bea bema! Murukwa n'erisimira! Naserikayo ninu tu matu anga? Niseshireyo kuni n'erirukira ebinwa binu? Risha musikyabe hano.» <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />N'emwana ngo warekia weyange hari Yesu, ekifwasi ncho chamutaa ekwansi n'imuinya-inya nguru. Ina Yesu wakeme cho, waramya emwana n'imukurucha kuri ishe. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Ebea bati bashishara mu risunga ebunkangwe bwa Ongo.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu watura tu ebusesiburwa we</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mar 9.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Ebea bati barekia bashisharange mu binwa biti ebyamaronja Yesu, iwe were <char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">ebanafunsi</char> bae mbu: <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />«Munitee emate shu: Ani <char style="w">Mwana w'eMwea</char> nisesiburwa mu mine y'ebea.» <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Ina ibo batateereri ebweba ebinwa mbyo, bushwa mbu byabesenga byamabiswa kuri bo kongo batasibi byo, nabo basubaha imushisha buni nge bwebange byo.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inye nge mukwakare?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mar 9.33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Otu ruma, ebanafunsi ba Yesu basonda isiba inye nge mukwakare munkati nabo. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yesu warekia wamasiba emihaki yabo, warisha mwana, wamuria hamushi nae, <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />were bo mbu: «Emwea uti wasekokeyo emwana uno mu rina rani, ntyani ngwamanikoke. Na kinsi ngu wanikoke, wakoke ingu warinituma. Bushwa mbu emwanunke munkati ninu nge mukwakare.»<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kinsi ngu ntímurenda winu uri mu ruharo rwinu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mar 9.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Ngyasingwanga Yohana weba mbu: «eNyere Kuritu, twakusunga mwea uma uhensange kifwasi mu rina rabe, twamuhangireyo, bushwa mbu iwe ntíuma mu bate.» <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Yesu wamusako mbu: «Kiro mumuhangire, bushwa mbu kinsi ingu ntímurenda winu urikire mu ruharo rwinu.»<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">eBasamaria batina ikoke Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Ematu erikuruka ra Yesu mu mbingu arekia ari keya, wasunga mbu rakonda wataye ku Yerusaremu. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Watuma kasa bea bima kubusondori nae. Benda, beya mu ubungu ruma rwa <char style="w" lemma="Samaria">Basamaria</char> kongo bamutunganyie ekwasehiere we. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Ina ebea b'erubungu ndo batina ikoke Yesu ku rwabo bushwa mbu wabesenga uteanange ienda ku Yerusaremu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Itukire karekare, eBayuta n'eBasamaria nti batashimanga. Bushwa nancho, eBasamaria babesenga batananga mbu eBayuta bete munkati n'echuo chabo mu rienda kahema ku Yerusaremu.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" /><char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">Ebanafunsi</char> bae, Yakobo na Yohana barekia basunga mbo, beba mbu: «eNyere Kuritu, ushima tuheme kasha kahitiri bo ituka ekwio n'ishiria bo?» <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Ina Yesu wikebera kuri bo n'ifine bo. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Ituka mpo benda mu rumpe ubungu.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ebasondange itucha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mat 8.19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Yesu n'ebanafunsi bae barekia bari mu munse, mwea uma were Yesu mbu: «Nendi nikumisange ekuti kwaseta ǒngo.» <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Ina Yesu wamwire mbu: «Emiterere irikanga na biribu by'isame mo, n'emirónge irikanga na birumba, ina ani <char style="w">Mwana w'eMwea</char> nisira n'ehamusame ani.»<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Yesu were umpe mwea mbu: «Nimise.» Emwea o nae weba mbu: «eNyere Kuritu, nikuhemange mbu nendi kasa kataa tita.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.59 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">EkuBayuta, itaa tita ng'erimuranga mu matu ebukungu bwae ieya n'erotu rusekwayo we.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesu wamwire mbu: «Reke ebakwire batae ebakwi babo, ina ǒngo enda katura emwasi <char style="w" lemma="Bwami bwa Ongo, Bwami bwa mu mbingu">w'eBwami bwa Ongo</char>.»<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Umpe mwea were Yesu mbu: «eNyere Kuritu, nendi nikumisange, ina nikuhemange mbu nendi kasa karaa eruanda rwani.» <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesu wamusako mbu: «Emwea wamabucha ihinga nukaengi tu kuruma, nti twakomenwa ikora mu <char style="w" lemma="Bwami bwa Ongo, Bwami bwa mu mbingu">Bwami bwa Ongo</char>.»<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu watuma banafunsi makumi arinda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:7-16">Mat 10.7-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Kuruma n'ebinwa mbyo, Nyere Kuritu warondora bampe bea makumi arinda.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bimpe bitabo byeba mbu bea makumi arinda na babi.</char></note> Watuma babi-babi bamusondori ieta mu kira ubungu na kira nku kwasondanga ienda we. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Were bo mbu: «Emukene mwingi, ina ebakori nge bakeke. Ngebumbo, mukonge Nyere Kuritu mine emukene watume bakori kakao. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Mwendi! Ina mukohyanga! Nabutuma banu buri byana bya mburi munkati n'esambibi s'ebusara. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Anga muria behe, abe kimbesa, abe birato, kiro mukea mwea munkati n'ense. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Kinsi numba yakime mu banu, mukeanga kasa bo mbu: ‹Ebuhoro bubesi muno!› <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Kuba mu numba njo muri mwea waraa mu buhoro, ebuhoro bwinu busie nae. Ina kuba ntímbo, ebuhoro mbo busebukuruke tu banu. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Murikanga mu njo numba, murisanga n'iomo kiti-kiti chaninkwa banu, bushwa mbu emukori w'emurimo wakomenwa ininkwa ebihembo byae. Kiro mukime-kime mu kira numba. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Kinsi ubungu ruti rusekokerwa mu banu, murisanga kiti chaninkwa banu. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Muramyanga ebakoni b'erubungu ndo na mwebanga na bisa kuro mbu: ‹<char style="w" lemma="Bwami bwa Ongo, Bwami bwa mu mbingu">eBwami bwa Ongo</char> ngie buri kwihi ninu.› <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Ina mu kira ubungu rwakime mu banu, kuba bisa kuro ntíbabukoke, mwetanga mu mitanga nti banu mwerengi bo mbu: <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‹Twabutiture banu emukungú w'erubungu rwinu ingu uri mu bisando bitu. Ina musibiriranga mbu eBwami bwa Ongo ngie buri kwihi ninu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Ruk 9.5; Mar 6.11.</char></note>› <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Nibwirengi muriira, mu rotu rwa hende, mukusungayo muro irenga ku Sondoma.»<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubansa mu sambungu esatina isimira Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mat 11.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />Yesu wenderee n'ieba mbu: «Buhanya kuri ǒngo ubungu rwa ku Korasini! Buhanya kuri ǒngo ubungu rwa ku Betesaita! Bushwa mbu kuba ebishisharo byakuronjiwa banu byamuronjiwange ku Tiro na ku Sindoni, kongo bisa nko bamabunduka kare, bamumbarange makunia n'irika mu mote mu rishea eminsori yabo, n'ireke esansambi sabo. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Ngyasingwa, erotu rwa hende, mukusungayo muro irenga bisa ku Tiro na ku Sindoni. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Na ǒngo ubungu rwa ku Kaperenaumu, ǒngo uhakange mbu basekutarishayo mu mbingu? Ukuhichiwayo ekwerunga.» <verse eid="LUK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Yesu were tu ebanafunsi bae mbu: «Kinsi waburukira banu, ani ngwandukira, nangu wabutina, wanitina ani, n'ewanitina ani, watina ingu wanitumanga.»<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Erikuruka r'ebanafunsi makumi arinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Kuruma nampo, ebanafunsi makumi arinda mbo bakuruka na ngoa nti bebange mbu: «eNyere Kuritu, n'ebifwasi nabyo bironjange ebweba bate entambi turikitange byo mu rina rabe!» <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yesu were bo mbu: «Nasungayo <char style="w">Mushumbu</char> uhukange buri kimpenya ituka ekwiyo. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Murukire! Nabuninka maa inanta nsoka na nkutu hima na maa ihundusa emurenda Mushumbu. Kusira tu kikai kiti-kiti chamabusindika. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Kai kiro mumoa bushwa mbu ebifwasi bironjange ebweba banu, ina mumoe bushwa mbu emina inu amatirwa mu mbingu.»<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Erimoa ra Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat 11.25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13.16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Mu ntambi iya-iya, eMutima Washurukara warisia Yesu ngoa, nampo Yesu weba mbu: «eTita, Nyere Kuritu w'embingu n'echuo, nikutatange bushwa mbu ebinwa byabisanga ǒngo ebea b'ebutesa n'ebasomi, umakando byo mu bana banunke. Ae Tita, ebiti mbyo ng'erisasa rabe.» <verse eid="LUK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Nampo, Yesu were ebea mbu: «Tita wareria ebikai biti mu mine yani. Kusira mwea unosi ani eMwana kuba ntí Tita, abe kusira mwea wosi Tita kuba ntíani eMwana nambi ebahunange ani mbu bamusibe.» <verse eid="LUK 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Kuruma nampo, Yesu wabinduke <char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">ebanafunsi</char> bae bisine, were bo mbu: «Ebasungange ebinwa bisungange banu, bakasanirwa! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Bushwa mbu, nibwirengi: <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa">batahwa</char> bingi na babake bahunanga isunga ebinwa bino bisungange banu, ina ntíbarisunga byo, n'irukira ebinwa birukirange banu, ina ntíbarerukira byo.»<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mushinga w'eMusamaria murongu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Kuruma nampo, muhani uma w'emyomba wasimana mwiereka Yesu. Wamushisha mbu: «eMuhani, mbeni namuronja buni kongo nashee ekaramo k'ematu ati?» <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesu wasako mbu: «Inki chatirwa mu myomba yitu? Buni nge burukiranga ǒngo yo kuba usoma yo?» <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Emwea ngo wasako mbu: «‹Ushimanga Nyere kurinu Ongo mu mutima wabe uti, mu mihaki yabe iti, mu maa abe ati na mu bwenge bwabe buti. Ushimanga hotu minu imbu bwishima ǒngo kisine.›»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Isub 6.5; Bar 19.18.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Nampo, Yesu wamwire mbu: «Umasubya shu, wenda uronja ebwameba ǒngo, kongo usheeyo ekaramo.»<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Ina emwea ngo, mwisonda kwininka eriira, washisha Yesu mbu: «Na inye nge mitu?» <verse eid="LUK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesu wasako mbu: «Mwea uma watukanga ku Yerusaremu mwihite ku Yeriko. Warekia uri mu munse, ebanyai bamuhenda, bamunyaa ebiti byabesenga nae. Bamuhumbaka n'imusia mu nsanga nareke, biire rabo. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Isisimuke, kwasaa <char style="w">kuhani</char> uma uhitirengi munse njo. Warekia wasunga emwea o, weta kumushi nae, witeane rae. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Bumbo hotu, <char style="w" lemma="Barawi">Murawi</char> uma nae weya mpo. Wakianga wamusunga, nae weitire mu uharo rwanse, na kwiire. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Ina <char style="w" lemma="Samaria">Musamaria</char> uma wabesenga wetange munse njo, weya mpo hari emwea ngo. Wakianga wamusunga, wamukwire bonso. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Wákensere kwihi nae, wakubure mu bihuru <char style="w">ndifai</char> na mafuta mwimushakire, wamina byo. Kuruma nampo, wamutarisha hiyo n'embunda yae, wamusicha hankambi y'ebeni n'irangana nae.<figure style="fig" file="WA03863b.tif" size="col" copy="Graham Wade" ref="10.34">Emusamaria murongu washakire emwea ngu wahumbwanga n'ebarenda.</figure> <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Mu richa r'ebutu, wakuto byunda bibí bya rufaranga n'itua byo kuri mine numba n'imwire mbu: ‹Uranganga emwea uno ishu, n'esafaranga siti sakoresha tu ǒngo hiyo nansi faranga mu rimushakire, nasekurucha to mu rikuruka rani.›»<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Ngerikia ke Yesu washisha ingo muhani w'eMyomba mbu: «Inye mu bashatu bano ngwasunga ǒngo buri munachabo emwea ingu wahendwanga n'ebanyai?» <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Emuhani w'eMyomba wasako mbu: «Ingu wamukwirenga ebonso.» Nampo ke Yesu wamwire mbu: «Na ǒngo hotu, wenda ukia mbo.»<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wakime mwa Marita na Maria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Yesu n'ebanafunsi bae barekia bendange, bakime mu kubungu kima. Nanko, mumina uma nge Marita wamukoke mu mwae. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Marita ngo nti uri na motowawe nti nge Maria. Iwe weya karika kumushi na Nyere Kuritu, mu rirukira ebyebange we. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Ina Marita iwe wabesenga nti utubatubange bushw'emirimo y'eriteka ebio. Ngyasingwanga weya kuri Yesu n'imushisha mbu: «eNyere Kuritu, utungakae bwakia moto wani wansiere emurimo ani kisine? Mwiri mbu wanisaki.» <verse eid="LUK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Nyere Kuritu wamusako mbu: «Marita! Marita! Ǒngo utubatubange n'inuba mu bikai bingi. <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Ina kuri kikai kima ho nge charaisha. Maria iwe wamarondora muhango wakoma nguru ingu utabakwiyo we.»<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu uhanange ebanafunsi bae ihema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat 6.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7.7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Otu ruma, Yesu wabesenga uhemange Ongo fasi nima. Mu rihea ihema, uma mu <char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">banafunsi</char> bae wamwire mbu: «eNyere Kuritu, tuhanise ihema, bwakianga Yohana wahana ebanafunsi bae.» <verse eid="LUK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yesu were bo mbu: «Entambi banu muhemange, mwendi banu mwebange buno mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">‹eTita!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">Erina rabe ritatwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">eBwami bwabe bweye.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Wendi utuninka ebio bitu kirotu.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Wendi utusasira esansambi situ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">bushwa mbu na bate hotu tusasiranga ebati mbi batukorengi bibí,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">ang'iturekerere ikire mu myereko.›»<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Kuruma were tu ebanafunsi bae mbu: «Kuba uma mu banu uri na mira we, nae wamamwendere munkati ebutu n'imwire mbu: ‹Era mira'ni, nisombye mikati ishatu, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />bushwa mbu uma mu bira bani wamaneyere na uri mu ruendo, nani namarukwa bio by'imushee.› <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Nangu uri kumunda n'enumba kuba wamamusako mbu: ‹Ndeki, ang'ininubya! Namakinda irindika erubi. Ani n'ebana bani twamikinde, ntakochi tu isimana bushwa ho n'erikuninka emikati.› <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Nibwirengi mbu, nakiro ngu uri kumunda enumba watamurindo bushwa erimuninka emikati bushwa n'ebwira ho, ina wamusumuka n'imuninka ebiti ebimuhemange we bushwa n'erikwimima rae.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />«Nani nibwirengi mbu: mwendi muhema kongo mwendi muninkwa, mwendi musonda kongo mwendi mushee, mwendi mukongota kongo bendi baburundurengi erubi. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Ngyasingwa, kinsi mwea ingu uhemange ng'uninkwanga, nangu usondange ng'usheenga, nangu ukongotange ng'urundurirwanga erubi. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Inye ishe wa mwana wamamuninka nsoka kuba emwanae wamukonga kikwa? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Abe wamuninke nkutu kuba wamukonga ii? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Banu kasa bea bema, ina banu mwosi ininka ebana binu bikai byahunda, nge rashea mbu Tita winu wa mu mbingu waseninkanayo eMutima Washurukara kuri mbi bamukongange!»<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wahensa ebifwasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat 12.22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22-27">Mar 3.22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Otu ruma, Yesu wabesenga uhensange kifwasi inchi chabunduranga mwea uma wabe karumbu na mutwitwi. Ekifwasi ncho chakianga chatuka, hiha-hiha emwea ngo wabucha ieba. Ebea bashishara nguru. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Ina bima munkati nabo, ibo babura mbu: «Emwea ngu uhensange ekifwasi mu maa a Beriseburi, mukwakare w'ebifwasi.» <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Na bampe bahuna imweka, bamukonga mbu waronjei bo kengeko kashea mbu ebishisharo byae bitukange kwa Ongo. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Ina bushwa mbu Yesu wasibanga emyanikiri yabo, were bo mbu: «Kuba bea b'ebwami buma bamakwana ibo mu ibo, ebwami mbo nti bwahona. Kuba tu ebana b'eruanda ruma bakwana ibo mu ibo, eruanda ndo nti rwakire. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Ramabese ke mbu <char style="w">Mushumbu</char> wikwanisha wisine, ebwami bwae butakochi tu isimana. Nibwirengi mbo mu risunga banu mwebange mbu ani nihensange ebifwasi mu kara ka Bereseburi. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Na kuba ke ani nihensange ebifwasi mu kara ka Beriseburi, mbeni ebashukira binu bahensange ebifwasi mu kara kanye? Ngyasingwa ebashukira binu mbo basebusheayo mbu banu bariu <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Kuti ani nihensange ebifwasi mu kara ka Ongo, ngerieba mbu <char style="w" lemma="Bwami bwa Ongo, Bwami bwa mu mbingu">eBwami bwa Ongo</char> bwamakinda ieya kuri banu.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />«Kuba emurai wambara ebikai biti byae byerikwana nabyo mwiranga enumba yae, himpo ebehe byae byarangwa mu buhoro. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Ina wamahendwa na umpe murai wamurenga, nampo wasemubaka ebikai biti byae byerikwane ebinyihire rero we n'ibanya ebikai by'emushokoro. <verse eid="LUK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Kinsi mwea ngu ntíuri hima nani nti murenda wani, na kinsi mwea watangasonja hima nani usebese nti unsansabanyange.»<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Emakurukiro ekifwasi mu mwea</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mat 12.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />Yesu wenderana n'erieba mbu: «Ekifwasi chamakinda ituka kumunda n'emwea nti chatubatuba mu bweru mwisondekanya maruhukiro. Chamarukwa maruhukiro, nti cheba mbu: ‹Nasekuruka mu numba yani emwakutuka ani.› <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Chamakuruka, chakumana enumba yahairwa n'itondwa shu. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Himpo ke, chasenda karinga bimpe bifwasi birinda byema nguru imurenga, nabyo nti byakime n'irika mo. N'emwea o wasebinduka wema nguru irenga mbu ebwabesenga we raroso.»<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Emukisa w'eriira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Yesu warekia webange ebinwa mbyo, mumina uma munkati n'enteko wakua murenge mukiri mbu: «Emumina ingu wakubutanga n'ikurisha mabere, wakasanirwa!» <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Ina Yesu wasako mbu: «Ebakasanirwa nge bimbi barukirange n'ironja mbu bweba ekinwa cha Ongo.»<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ebea bakonga Yesu kashingishiro</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat 12.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Bea bingi barekia batumanange hari Yesu, iwe wabucha ieba mbu: «Ebea b'ekiranga kino bema. Basondange isunga kashingishiro. Ina batasungiyo ko kuba ntínki ka Yona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Bushwa ebwabesanga Yona kashingishiro mu bea ba ku Ninawi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Yon 3.3-5.</char></note> nge bwabeseyo hotu ani <char style="w" lemma="Mwana w'eMwea">eMwana w'eMwea</char> kashingishiro mu bea ba runotu. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Mu rotu rwahende, Nyamumbo ingu watukirenga kumbo echuo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma 1Bam 10.1-10.</char></note> wasefukayo hima ninu banu bea b'ematu ano kongo wabusongere. Bushwa mbu iwe watukirenga kore nguru mwienda karukira binwa by'ebutesa by'emubake Soromono. Na hano nge harikire ngu warenga Soromono!<verse eid="LUK 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />«Erotu rwa hende rwakii rweya, bisa ku Ninawi nabo basefukayo hima ninu ebea b'ematu ano n'ibusongere. Bushwa ibo babundukanga n'ireke esansambi sabo bakianga barukirǎ emahubiri a Yona! Na hano nge harikire ngu warenga Yona!»<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eriso ng'eritara r'emubi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5.15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6.22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />«Kusira mwea usachanga eritara na wabise tu ro abe wabumbi ro na mbeketi. Ina urembeanga ro mu kango kongo ebea bakimengi basunga chaka. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Emeso ng'eritara r'emubi. Kuba emeso abe akaengi shu, emubi wabe uti userika mu chaka. Ina kuba emeso abe abiha-biha, emubi wabe na o hotu usebese mu mwirimya. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Bushwa nancho, ukohyanga. Echaka kiri kumunda nabe kitabinduki mwirimya. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Kuba emubi wabe uti uri mu chaka na kusira kitambo inchi kiri mu mwirimya, kai emubi wabe uti na o wasebese mu chaka, imbu bukianga eritara rakurishie chaka.»<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu watonde eBafarisayo n'ebahani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mar 12.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Yesu wakianga wahea ieba, <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisayo">Mufarisayo</char> uma were Yesu wendi karisa bio mu mwae. Yesu wenda mo n'ibucha irisa. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />eMufarisayo ngo washishara isunga Yesu warisa na nti twakushua emine. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Nampo Nyere Kuritu wamwire mbu: «Banu Bafarisayo, banu mushuanga ho ekusungwange mu rusara na mu ntengi. Ina banu murisere mbusha ya bwibi na bumpe bubi kumunda ninu. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Banu birunge! Ntíbanu mwosi mbu ingu wabumbanga imbi bisungwange ngwabumbanga hotu kumunda? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Kai mwendi musake ebasene n'ebikai imbi birikire kumunda n'esansara sinu nambi birikire kumunda n'esantengi sinu. Mumaronja mbo, ebiti biseshurukara mu mongerero winu.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />«Murikinda iherwa banu <char style="w">Bafarisayo</char>! Banu muninkanga Ongo echakumi ch'ematunguru, na ch'isusa, na ch'esanyenyi siti. Ina banu munenanga eriombokara n'inena erishima Ongo. Bimbyo nge byakomenwa rero ienda bikorange banu. Kiro mwobya tuna erikuto echakumi ch'ebimpe mbyo.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />«Muriherwa banu <char style="w">Bafarisayo</char>! Banu mumoerenga irika mu bitumbi bya kubusondori mu <char style="w" lemma="Sinangoki">masinangoki</char>. Banu mumoerenga tu nakuba ikeiwa n'isubahwa n'ebea mu sankumanano. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Muriherwa banu! Mususanyiwa n'emasinda ingi asira tu biteerere, ebea banantange o nti tíbasiba tu mbu hari masinda.»<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Uma mu bahani b'eMyomba were Yesu mbu: «eMuhani, mu rieba ongo mbo, na bate utukamba.» <verse eid="LUK 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesu wamwire mbu: «Na banu ebahani b'eMyomba, muriherwa! Banu murieshanga ebea mirio yaritohyaa, ina banu bisine mutwerekanga itinge mu yo mu risake bo.<verse eid="LUK 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />«Muriherwa banu! Banu mwimbishanga emasinda <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa">ebatahwa</char>, nakuba batitanku binu nge bashuranga bo. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Rashea mbu banu mubere n'emikorere ya batitanku binu, bushwa mbu basuku bashuranga batahwa, na banu nge mwimbengi bo emasinda. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Nge chasingwanga Ongo mu butesa bwae weba mbu: ‹Naseburebeka batahwa hima na <char style="w">ntumwa</char>. Baseshurayo bima n'inubya bampe mu bo.› <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Ngyasingwa ebea b'ematu ano basetuayo enchama y'ebatahwa eyakubukanga itukire echuo chabumbwa, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />itukire erishurwa ra Aberi ieya na mu rikwa ra Sakaria<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Ntan 4.8; 2Bir 24.20-22. </char></note> ewashurwanga mu <char style="w">Numba ya Ongo</char> munkati n'ebutanda bw'emaherero n'endikaro yashurukara. Iira, nibwirengi mbu enchama y'ebea bati mbi bashurwanga isebeseyo hambasiro n'emintwe yinu.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />«Muriherwa banu ebahani b'eMyomba! Mumabisa erufunguo rw'eririndo erubi rw'erisiba Ongo. Mutukimenga mpo banu bisine. Nambi basondange ikime, banu muminirenga bo erubi.»<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Yesu warekia wamasaa mu numba <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisayo">y'eMufarisayo</char> ngo, <char style="w" lemma="Bahani b'eMyomba">ebahani b'eMyomba</char> hima n'eBafarisayo babucha imusubuke nguru n'imushisha-shisha binwa bingi. <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />Benda bamwekange binwa kongo bashee buni bwasemusongere bo.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Mahano kuri ebea b'enkuse</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mat 10.26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Mu kashangi kika-kika, esangenche ningi sa maerefu a bea bakumanana nti banyantanange. Yesu wabucha kasa ieba <char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">n'ebanafunsi</char> bae mbu: «Mwiranganga n'echachu <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisayo">y'eBafarisayo</char>, ngerieba mbu enkuse yabo. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Kinsi chabiswa kisetaburwayo, na kinsi nama isesibwayo. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Ngyasingwa ebinwa biti biseba banu mu mwirimya biserukirwayo munkati echaka. N'ebinwa biti bisebayo banu mu nama ekundani kwabisama, biseturwayo hamambio.»<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ingu wakomenwa isubahwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mat 10.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />Yesu wenderana nieba mbu: «Nibwirengi banu bira bani, anga musubaha rotu imbi bamukocha ishura emubi ho, na batakoche ironja tu kimpe kikai irenga cha. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Nisebushea ingu mukomenwa isubaha: mwendi musubaha Ongo bushwa mbu iwe, wamakinda ishura, iwe nge wamukocha tu itaa emwea mu marunga. Mu riira, nibwirengi mbu iwe nge mukomenwa isubaha!<verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />«Kasa bishwi bisanu bisira busi! Ina Ongo iwe wosi kinsi kima mu byo. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Iwe wosi iansa n'ebuteo buti bw'emintwe yinu. Kai kiro mwendi musubaha, bushwa mbu banu muraisha nguru irenga bishwi bingi!»<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Erisimira n'erituna Yesu Kirisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mat 10.32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12.32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10.19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />Yesu weba tu mbu: «Nibwirengi mbu kinsi mwea wanirisia munkati na bea, ani <char style="w" lemma="Mwana w'eMwea">eMwana w'eMwea</char> nani nisemurisiayo munkati <char style="w" lemma="Maraika">n'ebamaraika</char> ba Ongo. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Ina kinsi mwea wasenituna munkati na bea, basemutunayo nae munkati n'ebamaraika ba Ongo. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Kinsi mwea weba bubi kuri ani eMwana w'eMwea, wasesasirwayo, ina kinsi mwea wakamba eMutima Washurukara, iwe watasasirwiyo.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />«Ebea basekiayo baburia kabuhukumu mu <char style="w" lemma="Sinangoki">masinangoki</char>, abe mu makako ebakwakare n'ebikondo, kiro mwianya mu binwa bisesubyayo banu, abe imbi bisebayo banu. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Bushwa mbu hiha-hiha eMutima Washurukara usebusheayo ebinwa byakomenwa ieba banu.»<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mushinga w'emutumba kitengi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Mwea uma munkati n'enkumanano were Yesu mbu: «eMuhani, eba na munakitu wambesi emuhango wani mu mwandu watusierenga tita.» <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yesu wamushisha mbu: «Era! Inye ngwakunironja ibinduke mushunguri winu abe mubanyii w'ebutumba bwinu?» <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Nampo Yesu were ebea bati mbu: «Mukohyanga, kiro mwendi mubese na karawa ka behe, bushwa mbu ebehe bitakoche iranga ebuingo bw'emwea, nakiro mbu wamubese mutumba nguru.»<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Yesu wakere bo emushinga uno mbu: «Kwarikanga mutumba uma wabesenga na mashwa. Emashwa ngo ase mo mukene mwingi. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Wabucha ianikira na kwishisha mbu: ‹Nikie buni buno bwarukwa ani buari bw'ibike mo emukene wani uti?› <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Nampo ke weba mbu: ‹Niseronja buno: nasekakura esambicho sani kongo nimba simpe nkiri-nkiri sibike mo emukene wani, n'ebimpe behe byani. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Kuruma nampo, ani kisine nasiebeshayo mbu: "Ani namibike behe bingi itukire myaka mingi. Kai ngie namiruhuke, nirise, n'omu n'imoa."›<verse eid="LUK 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />«Ina Ongo wamwire mbu: ‹Rero-rero ǒngo kitengi! Mu butu bwa runotu, ǒngo ukukwa. Nampo ke, ebikai biti byarekwibike ǒngo byasebese byanye?›»<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Yesu wamina ke kinwa mbu: «Bimbyo nge bibesenga kuri emwea ingu wibikengi behe bingi wisine, ina iwe ntíwanswa ibese na kikai mu makako a Ongo.»<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Erikwinyihire Ongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat 6.25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Kuruma nampo, Yesu were <char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">ebanafunsi</char> bae mbu: «Ngyasingwa nabwire mbu: kiro mwianya bushwa n'ebuingo bwinu, bushwa n'ebiserisa banu, abe kiro mwinubya bushwa n'emibi yinu kuba mukumbara inki. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Bushwa mbu ebuingo bwarenga ebio n'emubi warenga esanchangi. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Musunge ebikona: bitekanga mirime, bitakaonga nakuba, bisira buari bw'ibike mo mukene na bisira mbicho. Ina Ongo urishanga byo. Kasa banu murenga kore emirónge! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Inye mu banu, bushwa n'erikwianya rae, wamitarike otu ho ruma mu buingo bwae? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Kuba ke mutukoche ironja kikai kikeke buri ncho, banu mwianyange mu bikai bimpe bushwa nki? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Musunge kasa ebushukanga esantondo mu mashwa. Sitakoranga murimo, anga kwiruke na nchangi. Ina nibwirengi mbu nakiro emwami Soromono, mu busime bwae, ntwambaranga nchangi yakonda yarenga n'entondo nima. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Kuba ke Ongo wambichange bisu by'emashwa, imbi bisungwange runotu na bisekama mukoma n'itawa n'ishikwa, kai ke watamubumbaricha shu banu b'erisimira rikeke?<verse eid="LUK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />«Kai kiro mwianya mwisondekanya ebyarisa n'iomo banu. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Entí Bayuta b'echuo kino ibo nge basondekanyanga ebikai biti mbyo. Ina banu, Iso winu wosi mbu murae mu bikai biti mbyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Kai banu mwendi musodekanya eBwami bwa Ongo kasa, nae usebutarikeyo ebikai bino biti.»<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Erikwibike ebutumba mu mbingu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mat 6.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />Yesu were tu bo mbu: «Banu bea bakeke, kiro mwendi musubaha! Bushwa mbu Iso winu washimanga ibuninka eBwami bwae. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Mwendi muchuya ebikai byinu mu risake ebasene. Mwendi mwibike busoki imbu butabihiyo na butasiriyo, nge kiku kitasiriyo mu mbingu. Inko, ebǐbi bateyiyo ko n'erunsenge naro rutarisiyo ebehe mbyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Bushwa mbu impi habike banu ebutumba bwinu nge harikangǎ n'emitima yinu.»<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eririndire ikuruka r'eMwami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />Yesu were tu bo mbu: «Mwendi murika nti banu mwitunganyanyange ikora murimo n'ematara inu na o nti arika asakange. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Mubesenga buri bakori barindirengi nyere kurwabo utukange ekukibimbi ch'eriherucha, kongo entambi iserembera we n'ikongota, hiha-hiha nti bamurundure erubi. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Bakasanirwa ebakori imbi basekumanwayo bashere entambi iseyayo we! Nibwirengi muriira mbu: wasembarayo enchangi y'emurimo, warikechi bo n'ishee bo bio. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Bakasanirwa ebakori imbi basekumanwayo na Nyere kurwabo nti bashere munkati ebutu abe mu richa r'ebutu nti bakiri bamurindirengi.<verse eid="LUK 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />«Musibanga mbu kuba mine numba wamusibange rero entambi yameya emwibi kashuma mu mwae, watamusiange enumba yae ikakurwe. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Kai na banu mukohyanga, bushwa mbu ani <char style="w" lemma="Mwana w'eMwea">eMwana w'eMwea</char> nisekurukayo mu ntambi ntíyaanikire rero banu.»<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Emukori wakoma n'emukori wema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mat 24.45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Nampo Petero washisha Yesu mbu: «eNyere Kuritu, mbeni emushinga watukere ǒngo watukae ho bate bisine abe w'ebea bati?»<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Nyere Kuritu wasako mbu: «Inye ke nge kapita k'eriira na kari na bwenge? Nge ingu watumwa na nyere kurwabo mwisimane babine ininka bo bio mu ntambi yakomenwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Kakasanirwa ekapita nko kuba kakumanwa kakiri kakorange emurimo entambi yakuruka nyere kurwabo. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Nibwirengi muriira mbu: nyere kurwabo waseria ho ekapita nko kasimaniri ebehe byae biti. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Ina ekapita nko kuba kiebesha kisine mbu: ‹Nyere Kuritu wasɨa nguru kwendanga we!› N'ibucha ihumba ebakori banachae babume na bamina, n'ibucha irisa, n'ibucha iomo n'itamira. <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />Ekapita nko, Nyere kurwabo usekurukayo erotu ntírwaanikira we n'ekashangi ntíkosi rero we. Nampo Nyere kurwabo wasemukekeraa mo byunda bibí n'imusunga buri uma mu mbi bea ntíbinyihirwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />«Emukori ngu wosi ebyashima nyere kurwabo, ina wamarukwa kwitunganyanya n'irukwa ikora imbi byashima nyere kurwabo, waseraswayo tushushu twingi. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Ina emukori ingu wamubese ntwosi ebishimanga nyere kurwabo, wamakora ebyamusingwa wahumbwa, waseraswayo tushushu tukeke. Emwea waninkwanga bingi, wasekongwayo bingi. Nangu wabichiwanga bingi waseshishiwayo bingi nguru.»<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu weyanga kasianya ebea</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat 10.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />«Neyanga kataa kasha mu chuo, na namushimange nguru kabesǐ nti kamasaka! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Naria murio wa minubo ingu wakomenwa iria ani. Na niburubikange nguru mu mutima ieya nambu bwakia eminubo njo yabererera! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Mbeni banu mwanikirange mbu nareya karisha buhoro mu chuo? Anga! Nibwirengi mbu nareya karisha isiana. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Itukire runotu, bea basanu b'uanda ruma basesiana. Bea bashatu bendi babanganange na babi, na babi bendi babanganange na bashatu. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Bamwana n'ishe bendi babanganange, na kikumi na nina bendi babanganange. Bamwasana n'inabe bendi babanganange.»<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isiba ebiteerere by'esantambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mat 16.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yesu were esangenche s'ebea nabo hotu mbu: «Mumasunga erutundo rwasaire mu ruharo ruraamanga mo emwishi, hiha-hiha banu mwebanga mbu: ‹embura iseeke›, nayo nti yake nakuba. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />N'entambi isunganga banu eriuhu rasaire uharo rwa kumbo, banu mwebanga mbu: ‹Kusebese chuka kingi›, n'echuka nti chabesa hona. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Banu bea b'enkuse! Banu musibanga ebiteerere by'echuo na by'ekwiyo, bushwa nki mufundwa iteerera ebinwa byetange ematu ano?»<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Murongane n'ebarenda binu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mat 5.25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />Yesu weba tu mbu: «Inki chasingwa banu mutukoche ikora kinwa chakonda inchi chakomenwa ikorwa? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Umenda kaburana na mwea, wisumyanga urongane nae munkati n'ense. Kuba ntímbo, wasekusongere mu makako emushunguri, n'emushunguri nae wamukuria ekubaporisi, n'eporisi nae ntwakutaa mu mwiyororo. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Nikwirengi mbu utukoche isaa mo kuba ntí utua nensi erufaranga rwa hende.»<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Rakomenwa ireke esansambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Mu ntambi njo, bea bima beya kature Yesu emwasi imbu bwakianga Pirato watuma bea kashiria bisa ku Ngariraya bima, imbi babesenga bachinjange esanyama s'erisibure Ongo. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yesu washisha bo mbu: «Mbeni banu mwanikirange mbu bisa ku Ngariraya mbo bakushurwa bumbo, bushwa mbu babesenga bea ba nsambi irenga bisa ku Ngariraya bampe bati? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Anga ntímbo! Ina nibwirengi mbu kuba ntímubunduka ireke esansambi sinu, na banu bati mukushirira bumbo hotu. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />N'ebea ikumi na munani ebasikirwanga n'enumba nere murubungu rwa ku Siroamu, mbeni banu muhakange mbu ibo babesenga nge bea bema irenga bisa ku Yerusaremu bati? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Anga ntímbo! Ina nibwirengi mbu kuba ntímubunduka ireke esansambi sinu, na banu bati hotu mukushirirǎ bumbo».<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mushinga w'emuti ingu ntíwarebuta byuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Kuruma nampo, Yesu wakere bo emushinga uno mbu: «Kwabesenga mwea uma weka muti wa tini mu rishwa rae r'emisabibu. Otu ruma, weya kasonda mu o byuma, ina warukwa mo kiro n'echuma kima. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Nampo, were emukori w'erishwa rae ndo mbu: ‹Kae ke! Ngie myaka ishatu ino neyanga kǎsonda byuma mu muti uno w'etini, ina karankuso! Konda o, bushwa mbu ubisha-bishange ho eroto busa-busa.› <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Ina emukori ngo wamusako mbu: ‹Enyere kuritu, rekerere tu kasa o mu mwaka uno. Nashekere tu o n'itereka mu o bumpe buinu. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Kuri ntambi wamubuta byuma mu mwaka musindu, na kuba ntiwabuta ho, nti ngie ukukondao.›»<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu waramya mumina uma otu rwa Sabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Otu ruma rwa <char style="w">Sabato</char>, Yesu wabesenga uhanange ebea mu <char style="w">sinangoki</char>. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Kai mu sinangoki mo nti muri mumina uma mukoni. Emumina ngo wabesenga wamaronja myaka ikumi na mumane nt'unubiwange n'ishumbu. Erishumbu ndo rabesenga rarimukunya, na nti watakochanga tu ioro emongo. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Yesu warekia wamusunga, wamubikira n'imwire mbu: «Ekoyo, umakinda irama ebukoni bwabe.» <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Nampo Yesu watereka emine yae kuri we, nae woro emongo hiha-hiha n'ibucha itata Ongo.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Ina <char style="w" lemma="Sinangoki">emukwakare w'esinangoki</char> wasunga bubi bushwa na Yesu mu riramya mwea mu rotu <char style="w" lemma="Sabato">rw'eSabato</char>. Bushwa nancho, were ebea ebabesenga batumana mpo mbu: «Kurikanga matu mutuba ikora. Mwendi mweyange karamyiwa mu matu ngo, ina kiro rwabunduke otu rwa Sabato!»<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Ina Nyere Kuritu wamusako mbu: «Banu bea b'enkuse! Mbeni inye mu banu ingu wataboranga enkambu abe embunda yae haminirwanga yo n'ienda komosha yo mecha otu rwa <char style="w">Sabato</char>? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Emumina uno w'erubuto rwa Iburahimu, wabesenga waminwa na <char style="w">Mushumbu</char> myaka ikumi na munani, mbeni ntwakomenwa rero iborwa erotu rw'eSabato?»<verse eid="LUK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Yesu warekia wameba mbo, ebarenda bae bati bakwa nkene. Ina enteko iti y'ebea yakokoma mwisunga emikorere y'ebishisharo biti ebyabesenga bikorange we.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mushinga w'ekambuto kakeke nguru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mar 4.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Kuruma nampo, Yesu weba tu mbu: «Mbeni <char style="w" lemma="Bwami bwa Ongo, Bwami bwa mu mbingu">eBwami bwa Ongo</char> bwasusana nanki? Namususanya bo nanki? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />eBwami mbo bwasusanyiwa na kambuto kakeke ka harandari, inki kakianga mwea uma watinge n'ieka ko mu rishwa rae. Embuto njo y'oshuka, yabese ke muti mukiri, n'emirónge yeya k'umba birumba mu santabi sao.»<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Emushinga w'echachu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mat 13.33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Yesu weba tu mbu: «Nisesusanya <char style="w" lemma="Bwami bwa Ongo, Bwami bwa mu mbingu">eBwami bwa Ongo</char> nanki? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />eBwami mbo bwasusanyiwa na chachu eyakianga mumina uma wakubure yo mu nengo ishatu sa nchano y'ironja mikati, ieya na mu ntambi nji enchano iti yabimba.»<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Erubi rwekene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat 7.13-14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yesu warekia wendange ku Yerusaremu, weta mu mbungu nkiri-nkiri na mbungu nkeke-nkeke nt'uhanange ebea. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Mwea uma wamushisha mbu: «eNyere Kuritu, mbeni bea bakeke ho nge baseshukarayo?» Yesu wasako ebati mbu: <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />«Mwisumyanga ikime mu rubi rwekene. Bushwa nibwirengi mu riira mbu bea bingi baseerekayo mbu bakimi mu ro, ina batakochiyo.<verse eid="LUK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />«Etambi mine numba wakii wamasimana n'irindika erubi, mukusiayo hambuka n'ibucha ikongota erubi, n'ieba mbu: ‹eNyere Kuritu, turunduri!› Ina wasebusakoyo mbu: ‹Muntukiriri, ntínosi kusairengi banu.› <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Nampo ke mukubuchayo imwire mbu: ‹Twabesenga turisange n'iomo hima nabe, ubesenga ongo uhanange ebea mu mitanga ya kuritu.› <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Ina iwe wasebusakoyo tu mbu: ‹Ntínosi ekusairengi banu. Mutuke kwihi nani, banu bati bakori bema.›<verse eid="LUK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />«Mukusungayo Iburahimu, Isake, Yakobo <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa">n'ebatahwa</char> bati mu <char style="w" lemma="Bwami bwa Ongo, Bwami bwa mu mbingu">Bwami bwa Ongo</char>. Ina banu mukurekerwayo habutara! Nanko mukureyo n'ishiisha emeno. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Ebea basesaireyo ekuti mu chuo, nabo baserikayo nti barisange bio hima mu Bwami bwa Ongo. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Murukire! Bima mu basindu runotu basebeseyo baroso, na bima mu baroso runotu basebeseyo basindu.»<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu warire erubungu rwa ku Yerusaremu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat 23.37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Mu ntambi njo, <char style="w">Bafarisayo</char> bima beyere Yesu n'imwire mbu: «Tuka hano, iiri rabe kumpe, bushwa mbu Herote usondange ikushura.» <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesu wasako bo mbu: «Mwendí kere emuterere o mbu runotu na mukoma nasehensa ebifwasi n'iramya ebakoni, na mukakoma nasekindanya emurimo wani. <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Kasa nahwa imisa eruendo rwani runotu, mukoma na mukakoma, bushwa mbu <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa">emutahwa</char> ntwakomenwa ishurwa mu rumpe ubungu kuba ntí ku Yerusaremu.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />«Banu bisa ku Yerusaremu! Banu nge mushuranga <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa">ebatahwa</char>, n'esantumwa sibutumirenga Ongo banu mushuranga to na makoi. Meta mingi nakusonda ibusonja bukianga enkoko yasonja etunyau kumunda ebyubi byae, ina banu mwitinire! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Murukire ke! Erubungu rwinu rusesia kima. Na nibwirengi mu riira mbu: mutunisungiyo tu ieya n'erotu rusebayo banu mbu: ‹Wákasanirwe ingu weya mu rina ra Nyere Kuritu.›»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Sab 118.26.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu waramya mukoni mu rotu rw'eSabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Otu ruma rwa <char style="w">Sabato</char>, Yesu wenda kara bio mu numba ya mukwakare uma wa <char style="w">Bafarisayo</char>. Ebea mbi babesenga kumunda n'enumba barika nti bamukairirengi mwisunga ebisekora we. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Na habusondori na Yesu, kai nti hari mwea uma wasamba bukoni bwibimba-bimba emubi. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yesu washisha ebahani b'eMyomba n'eBafarisayo mbu: «Mbeni eMyomba yitu yarisia abe yahangire iramya mwea otu rwa Sabato?» <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Ina bibebere. Nampo ke, Yesu watinge mu mukoni, wamuramya n'imwire mbu wendi rae. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Kuruma nampo, Yesu washisha ebea mbo mbu: «Inye munkati ninu, emwana wae abe enkambu yae yamahuka kumunda n'ekiribu cha mecha, wamurukwa ieya tete n'ikuto yo mo bushwa ho mbu otu rwa Sabato?» <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Ina ntíbakochanga isako mu binwa mbyo.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ongo wasetarisha imbi bihicha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yesu warekia wamasunga ebukiange ebakubikirwa bitoma eburiki bwa roso, waninka bo ihano mbu: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />«Kuba mwea wakubikira mu kibimbi ch'iherucha, ang'ienda utairire irika mu kitumbi cha kubusondori. Munantambi kwakubikirwa umpe mwea wakurenga itunda. <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Nangu ewakububikiranga banu babi wameya, wakwiri mbu: ‹Siere uno ekitumbi warike.› Nampo ukusimana n'ienda karika mu kitumbi cha kuruma na nkene singi. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Ina kuba ubikirwa, wendanga kǎrika mu kitumbi cha kuruma, kongo ingu wakukubikiranga wasekia weya, wakwiri mbu: ‹Emirani, iya kuno kubusondori.› Nampo ukubese nti umaninkwa itunda munkati n'ebea bati mbo ebarirengi hima. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Ngyasingwa kinsi mwea witarishanga wasehichiwayo, na ngu wihichanga wasetarishiwayo.»<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Kuruma nampo, Yesu were emwea ewakumubikiranga mbu: «Kuba ǒngo ubikirange ebea mu kibimbi, rabesa mukoma-koma abe mwiyoro, kiro ubikira ho bira babe, abe basike binu, abe ebabuti babe, abe ebatumba imbi bari mwendende nabe, kongo nabo bakubikirayo. Nampo risebeseyo buri ikukuruchie ebyaninkanga ǒngo bo. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Ina kuba ubikira bea mu kibimbi, wendi ubikira ebasene, esankata, ebirema, n'ebihumihumi. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Nampo, Ongo wasekukasane bushwa mbu ebea bano basira ch'erikukuruchie. Na wasekukuruchieyo erotu rusekiayo ebakoranga byakonda bafuka.»<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Emushinga w'eririsa ebio mu Bwami bwa Ongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mat 22.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Mwea uma mu bea ebabesenga barisange hima na Yesu, wakianga warukira ebinwa mbyo, were Yesu mbu: «Wakasanirwa emwea ingu userayo bio mu <char style="w" lemma="Bwami bwa Ongo, Bwami bwa mu mbingu">Bwami bwa Ongo</char>.»<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesu wamukere emushinga uno mbu: «Kwarikanga mwea uma waronja bio bya kibimbi, wabikira bea bingi. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Entambi y'eririsa yarekia yamarumira, watuma emukori wae wendi kere ebakubikirwa mbu: ‹Mweye ke bushwa mbu ebikai biti byamarumira.› <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Ina kira mwea wabucha kwireme. Waroso wamwire mbu: ‹Nakuchura ishwa, na nahwa ienda kasunga ro. Nikuhemange unisasire.› <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Umpe wamwire mbu: ‹Nakuchura nkambu ikumi s'ihinga, na nendange kereka to kuba samukora. Nikuhemange unisasire.› <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Na umpe wamwire mbu: ‹Nakuherucha, na bushwa nancho nteyi ko.›<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />«Emukori wakuruka kature nyere kurwabo ebwamamusako bo. Nampo, mine numba wasubuka n'iere emukori wae o mbu: ‹Enda tete ekubutara bukiri, eta na mu mitanga y'erubungu, ringa ebasene, esankata, ebirema n'ebihumihumi bakimi muno.› <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Kuruma nampo, emukori wakuruka n'ieba mbu: ‹Enyere kuritu, ebiti byakunerenga ǒngo namakora byo, ina kumunda enumba kukiri buari.› <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Nampo ke, nyere kurwabo wamwire mbu: ‹Enda mu sanse s'esambungu na s'ekutunsari karinga ko bea, kimia bo na kamimo kongo enumba yani yarisa bea. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Nibwirengi mbu anga n'uma mu bakubikiranga ani ewaserora mu bio byani.›»<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buni bwamukia emwea wabese mwanafunsi wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mat 10.37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Otu ruma, bea bingi babesenga bamisange Yesu. Wabunduka kuri bo n'iere bo mbu: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />«Kinsi mwea ingu usondange inimisa, wanchime irenga ishe, na nina, na mukari, n'ebana bae, na basike babo, na bisi babo. Na wanchime irenga mbu bwishima we. Kuba ntímbo, watakoche ibese <char style="w">mwanafunsi</char> wani. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Kinsi mwea ngu watangaria emusaraba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eriria emusaraba: Hano Yesu uhunange iere ebanafunsi bae mbu bahwa irisia inuba n'ikwa.</char></note> wae n'inimisa, watakoche ibese mwanafunsi wani.<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />«Mbeni inye mu banu kuba usondange iumba numba nkiri, wamurukwa kasa irika n'ibucha iansa ebehe ebisekoresha we kongo wasiba imbi bikwengi we ebyamukindanya ebwimbe? <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Bushwa mbu wamimba emusingi, kuruma nampo wafundwa ikindanya ebwimbe bw'enumba njo, ebea bati mbi basenda basungange yo basenda bamuseange <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />n'ieba mbu: ‹Emwea uno wakubuchanga iumba na wafundwa tu irísía enumba!›<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />«Mu ntambi mubake murebe usondange ikwana na umpe mubake, rakomenwa warike kasa, kongo wasunga, kuba ietere emaa Ebasura bae erefu sibi, wamukocha ihima mine eurikire n'ebasura erefu makumi abi. <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Kuba wasunga mbu watamakocha, kai wasekia ukiri kore, wamutuma bea kuri mine bamushishe mbu wakie buni kongo washee buhoro. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Ngebumbo hotu kuri banu! Kusira uma mu banu ewamukocha ibese <char style="w">mwanafunsi</char> wani kuba watamakocha isia ebiti bikwengi we.»<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Emukwa ngu usira mufa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat 5.13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mar 9.50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />Yesu were tu bo mbu: «Emukwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Emukwa ushembwange hano, wabesenga buri ikoi, na ngwabesenga ukoreshiwanga mu rirunga ebio. Wamakinda iriminya ebushamuke bwaa, nti bataa o.</char></note> ushamukanga. Ina emukwa wamariminya ebushamuke bwaa, kinki ke tu echamukocha irishie tu o ebushamuke? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Emukwa ngo nti usira tu mufa abe mu roto abe mu buinu. Ebea bataangǎ o hambuka. Ingu uri n'emate erirukira warukire!»<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Emushinga w'emburi nji yariminanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat 18.12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Otu ruma, ebakongori b'ehoro na bampe bea ba nsambi batumananga kumushi na Yesu kongo bamwerikire. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" /><char style="w" lemma="Bafarisayo">eBafarisayo</char> <char style="w" lemma="Bahani b'eMyomba">n'ebahani b'eMyomba</char> barekia basunga mbo, babucha imutera mbu: «Bushwa nki ke emwea uno ukokengi ebea b'ebibi n'irisa hima nabo!» <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Nampo ke Yesu wákere bo emushinga uno mbu: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />«Kuba mwea uma mu banu uri na mburi sae iyana, na nima mu to yamarimina, buni bwamuronja we? Ngebumbo wahwa isia emakumi mwenda n'emwenda mu muchacha n'ienda kasonda eyakurimina mupaka washei yo! <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Wasekia wamashee yo, wasekuruka na ngoa ntwaria yo mu bituri byae!<figure style="fig" file="WA03831b.tif" size="col" copy="Graham Wade" ref="15.5">Emurangi washee emburi yae nji yariminanga</figure> <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Na wasekia wameya mu mwae, wasebikira bira bae n'ebanunsane n'iere bo mbu: ‹Mweye mumoe hima nani, bushwa mbu emburi yani nji yariminanga namashee yo!› <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Nibwirengi mbu, mu mbingu murikanga ngoa ningi kuba mwea uma ho wansambi wamabunduka n'ireke esansambi sae, irenga bea makumi mwenda na mwenda baombokara imbi ntíbarae tu mwireke esansambi sabo.»<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Emushinga w'ekichere nchi chariminanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />Yesu weba tu mbu: «Kuba mumina uma uri na bichere ikumi bya noro, na wamariminya kima mu mwae, ngebumbo wahwa isacha eritara n'ihae enumba mwisondekanya mupaka washei cho! <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Wasekia wamashee cho, wasebikira barakasi bae n'ebanunsane n'iere bo mbu: ‹Mweye tumoe mongo, bushwa mbu ekichere chani nchi chariminanga, namashee cho!› <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Nibwirengi mbu bumbo nge bukianga <char style="w" lemma="Maraika">ebamaraika</char> ba Ongo bamoa entambi mwea uma wa nsambi wamabunduka n'ireke esansambi sae.»<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mushinga w'emwana ngu wariminanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yesu wakere bo umpe mushinga mbu: «Kwarikanga mwea uma nt'uri na basike bae babi. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Emwansare were ishe mbu: ‹Etita, nikuhemange umbesi emuhango w'emwandu wani mu butumba bwabe.› Nampo ishe wabanyie bo ebutumba bwae.<verse eid="LUK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />«Kuruma na matu makeke, emwansare wachuya emwandu wae na kwiire mu kimpe chuo cha kore. Nanko washata n'ebehe byae mu bikai bya busa-busa. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Warekia wamakinda ebehe byae biti, mu chuo ncho mwakime rwaka rwasuma, wabucha irukwa na bio byeririsa. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Nampo, wenda kakore mwea uma w'echuo ncho. Emwea ngo wamutuma mu mashwa ae karanga esampunu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu kutime k'eBayuta, empunu nsirwa bushwa mbu itariwanga n'itatingirwanga mo. Binwa bya nkene n'uneno nguru kuri eMuyuta.</char></note> sae. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Wabesenga uhunange mbu wamurisange mu bio ebirisange mo esampunu, ina watashei mwea werimuninka mu byo.<verse eid="LUK 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />«Nampo ke, emushukira ngo wabucha kwiebesha mbu: ‹Ebakori ba tita bashatange n'ebio, ina ani nge nikwange n'erwaka kuno! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Nasesimana n'ienda kuri tita, n'imwire mbu: "Etita, namakora nsambi kuri Ongo na kuri ǒngo hotu. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Ntínakomenwa tu ibikirwa mbu ani musikyabe, ina unitingenga buri uma mu bakori babe."›<verse eid="LUK 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />«Nampo, emushukira wasimana n'ienda kuri ishe. Na warekia ukiri kore n'enumba, ishe wamusunga, wamukwire bonso nguru. Wamukanyahe, wamukoke n'imurimba.<figure style="fig" alt="Mutoto aliyepotea anapokelewa na baba yake" file="DN00485b.tif" size="col" copy="Darwin Dunham" ref="15.20">Emwana ngu wariminanga wakokerwa n'ishe</figure><verse eid="LUK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />«Musike we wamwire mbu: ‹Etita, namakora nsambi kuri Ongo na kuri ǒngo hotu. Ntínakomenwa tu ibikirwa mbu ani musikyabe.› <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Ina ishe were ebakori bae mbu: ‹Mwendi tete karisha nchangi yakoma na mumwambiche yo. Mumwambiche n'upete na birato.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu kutime k'eBayuta, ebyakɨa ishe w'emusike wamuninka byashea mbu wamamurisia buri mwana, ina ntí buri kahungu abe mukori. Enchangi njo yabesenga ropo imbarwanga mu otu rukiri, ina ntí ya murimo. Erupete rwashea mbu emusike waninkwa tu murimo w'erisimanire ebikai biti bya mumwabo. N'ebirato byashea mbu iwe ngie uri huru, bushwa mbu etuhungu twabesenga tutambaranga birato.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Na murishe chana cha nkambu echanone, mubae cho kongo twaronja bio bya kibimbi, <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />bushwa mbu musikyani uno wabesenga wamakwa ina wamafuka, wabesenga wamarimina ina wamashekana.› Nampo babucha irisa bio by'ekibimbi.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />«Mu kashangi nko, entangi yae yabesenga iri ekwishwa. Murikuruka rae, warekia uri kwihi n'enumba yabo, warukira engoma n'ebea basimbange n'imina. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Wabikira uma mu bakori n'imushisha kuba kinki nge chasaa nko. <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Emukori ngo wamusako mbu: ‹Moto wabe ngwamarembera, na iso wamamukere nkambu, bushwa mbu emwana e wameya na nti munkangwe.› <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Mukuwae wasubuka nguru n'itina ikime mu numba. Nampo ishe wasaa n'imuhema mbu wakimi. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Ina emusike wasako ishe mbu: ‹Namakukore myaka mingi, na nironjanga ebiti byinirenga ǒngo. Ina utunganininkanga n'echana ch'empene mbu nani nirise bio bya kibimbi hima na bira bani. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Ina musikyabe uno ewakukindanyanga ebehe byabe biti mwisingirana n'ebihanga, entambi yameya we, umamukere nkambu nji yanone!›<verse eid="LUK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />«Ishe wamwire mbu: ‹Emwana'ni, turikanga hima nabe kirotu, n'ebiti mbi birikanga nani byabe. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Kai rakomenwa irisa bio by'ekibimbi n'imoa, bushwa mbu moto wabe uno wabesenga wamakwa ina wamafuka. Wabesenga wamarimina ina wamashekana.›»<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Mushinga w'emukori mukongobanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesu wakere <char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">ebanafunsi</char> bae emushinga uno mbu: «Kwarikanga mutumba uma. Emutumba ngo nt'uri na mwea wae w'imurange ebehe byae. Emurangi ngo, ebea benda kamusongere kuri nyere kurwabo mbu ushatange n'ebehe byae. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Nyere kurwabo wamubikira n'imushisha mbu: ‹Ini myasi nji irukirange ani eyebange ebea bushwa nabe? Bushwa nancho, niansiri ebehe byani biti enompena, bushwa mbu uturangi tu byo.›<verse eid="LUK 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />«Emurangi ngo wabucha kwiebesha mbu: ‹Nyere Kuritu usondange inihensa mu murimo. Naseronja ke buni? Emaa erihinga nsira o, n'erihema-hema naro risendishie nkene. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Mbo! Namasiba ebuseronja ani kongo entambi nji basenihensa mu murimo, bampe bea bendi banikokengi mu manumba abo.› <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Nampo wabikira kinsi mwea ngu watingenga mwinda wa nyere kurwabo. Washisha ewaroso mbu: ‹Mbeni ongo'ri na mwinda wa nki wa nyere kuritu?› <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Emwea ngo wamusako mbu: ‹Nkunguru iyana sa mafuta.› Emurangi wamwire mbu: ‹Tinge ekaratasi kabe, rika hano tete, andika makumi asanu.› <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Kuruma nampo, wabikira umpe mwea n'imushisha mbu: ‹Na ǒngo uri na mwinda wa nki?› Nae wamusako mbu: ‹Tuterere iyana twa nchano ya ngano.› Emurangi wámwire mbu: ‹Tinge ekaratasi kabe, andika makumi munani.› <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Nampo ke, nyere kurwabo emurangi ngo mukongobanya wamutata bushwa n'ebwenge bwae. Nameba mbo bushwa mbu ebea b'echuo kino baronjangǎ ebinwa byabo by'ebukongobanya hima na banachabo irenga mbi bari mu chaka.»<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Bushwa nancho, Yesu weba tu mbu: «Nani nibwirengi mbu: mwendi mukoresha ebehe byinu by'ebukongobanya by'echuo kino mwironja bwira. Bushwa mbu, ebehe mbyo bisekiayo byamarukwa, Ongo wasebukokeyo mu mbingu mu numba y'ebuingo bw'ematu ati. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Emwea uri n'eriira mu bikai bikeke, ungo nge mwea w'eriira hotu mu bikai bingi. N'emukongobanya mu bikai bikeke nge mukongobanya hotu mu bikai bingi. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Kuba ke banu mufundwa ibese bea b'iira mwiranga ebehe by'ebukongobanya bya kino chuo, mbeni inye nge usebwinyihireyo mwibuninka behe byeriira? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Kuba mutumakocha iranga bya bampe bea mu riira, inye ke ngwamubuninkǎ binu?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />«Kusira mukori wamukocha ikore bakwakare babi. Bushwa mbu wasebaa ho uma n'ishima umpe, abe waserandakana ho n'uma n'inena umpe. Mutukoche ikore Ongo n'ikore ebehe mongo.»<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wahana mahano mingi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mat 11.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mar 10.11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisayo">eBafarisayo</char> bakianga barukira ebinwa mbyo, basea Yesu bushwa mbu babesenga bashima behe nguru. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Yesu were bo mbu: «Banu mwisheanga kuri ebea mbu banu ho nge bea baombokara, ina Ongo usibanga ebiri mu mitima yinu. Bushwa mbu, ekisungwanga mu meso ebea mbu kikai kikiri, Ongo iwe wanena cho.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />«eMyomba ya Musa n'ebitabo <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa">by'ebatahwa</char> nge byabesenga byemisange ebea ieya na mu matu a Yohana Murubiki. Itukire mu matu ngo, n'ituranga eMwasi Wakonda <char style="w" lemma="Bwami bwa Ongo, Bwami bwa mu mbingu">w'eBwami bwa Ongo</char>. Itukire mu matu ngo eMwasi Wakonda w'eBwami bwa Ongo nge uturwange ho mu matu ano, na kira mwea uronjange maa ae ati kongo wakime mu Bwami mbo. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Ratamba kuri echuo n'embingu irimina, ina eMyomba ya Ongo itatukiyo mo anga na kakinwa kakeke.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />«Kinsi wabume wahensa mukari n'ibinga umpe, wakora nsingirani. Nangu wabinga mumina ngu wahenswa na moke nae wakora hotu nsingirani.»<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mushinga w'emutumba bana Rasaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />Yesu wakera tu emushinga uno mbu: «Kwarikanga mutumba uma. Emutumba ngo wabesenga umbaranga nchangi sakonda nguru na sa busi bwasuma nguru, na nt'urisanga shu kirotu. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Kwarikanga hotu na musene uma mbu nge Rasaro. Rasaro ngo, emubi wae uti wabesenga urisere bihuru. Wabesenga urikanga hamiango mw'emutumba ngo. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Wabesenga wisanenga ebio mbi bikirengi itukire mu mesa y'emutumba ngo. N'esambibi sabesenga seyangǎ karamba ebihuru byae.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />«Otu ruma, Rasaro wakwa. <char style="w" lemma="Maraika">Ebamaraika</char> beya kamuringa n'imuria hari Iburahimu. Emutumba nae wakwa, n'ebea benda kamutaa. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Emutumba warekia uri mu marunga nt'unubange nguru, watarisha emeso, wasunga Iburahimu kore, na Rasaro kumushi nae. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Warake Iburahimu n'ieba mbu: ‹Etita, ninubange nguru mu kasha kano, nikwiri bonso! Nitumiri Rasaro warubike entonga y'emurimba wae mu mecha kongo waboboya erwami rwani.›<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />«Ina Iburahimu wamusako mbu: ‹Emwana'ni, uanikiranga mbu ubesenga na butumba bwingi mu chuo, ina Rasaro iwe nt'unubange. Na hano ke, uri mu sangoa na ǒngo unubange. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Usibanga tu mbu hari kiribu kikiri nguru munkati na bate ninu. Ngebumbo, ebari kuno, kuba bahunange isoka kuri banu nko, batamukocha. N'ebari kuri banu nko, batamukocha isoka kuno kuri bate.› <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Emutumba weba mbu: ‹Etita, nikuhemange utume ke Rasaro mu mwitu, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />bushwa mbu basike bitu basanu bari mo, wendi katonde bo kongo batahieriyo mu minubo ino.› <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Iburahimu wamusako mbu: ‹Basike binu bari n'ebitabo bya Musa nambi <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa">by'ebatahwa</char>, bendi bamisange imbu ebweba byo!› <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Emutumba weba mbu: ‹Anga, etita Iburahimu! Ritamende mpo nensi. Ina kuba kuri ingu wamufuka wamenda katonde bo, basereke esansambi sabo.› <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Ina Iburahimu wamwire mbu: ‹Kuba banakinu mbo batamukocha irukira emitiro ya Musa na y'ebatahwa, batakoche hotu irukira emahano angu wafuka.›»<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu uhanange bushwa n'esansambi n'emusasiro</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mat 18.6-7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mar 9.42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yesu were <char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">ebanafunsi</char> bae mbu: «Ebinwa byerikiria ebea mu sansambi bisenda bibesengi ho ko, ina emwea ngu usingwange bampe bakire mu sansambi waherwa! <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Rakomenwa rero kuri emwea ngo waminwe osho mu rikoti n'imutaa mu nyansa, kukia wakiria uma mumbi ebakeke bano.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hano, kuri bea bima bahakange mbu ebakeke mbo nti nge bari n'erisimira rikeke.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Mukohyanga! Kuba munakinu wakora kibi umuhananga. Na kuba wasia ebubi bwae umusasiranga. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Kuba wakuronjee bubi meta arinda mu rotu na ukweyerengi ho meta arinda kakukonga musasiro, umusasiranga ho.»<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu uhanange bushwa n'erisimira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Kuruma nampo, <char style="w" lemma="Ntumwa">esantumwa</char> sere Nyere Kuritu mbu: «eNyere Kuritu, tuongereri erisimira.» <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Nae wasako mbu: «Kuba mumabesengi n'isimira rirengekane n'ekambuto k'eharandari, mumakochange iere emuti uno mbu wikutu mpo hari o, na wendi kwikome mu nyansa, na o wamuburukirengi.»<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Emukobe wahwa ikore nyere kurwabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />Yesu weba tu mbu: «Kuba uma mu banu uri na mukobe umuhingengi abe umurangengi bituana, entambi wamusunga ukurukange ekwishwa, mbeni nyere kurwabo wamumushishǎ mbu weye na warɨse? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Anga! Buno nge busemwire we: ‹Nironjei kasa bio, kuruma nampo mbara nchangi sakoma kongo unishee ebio. Entambi nji nasekinda irisa n'iomo, n'ongo ke nturisa n'iomo.› <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Mbeni banu mwanikirange mbu nyere kurwabo w'emukori ngo wamamutata bushwa mbu wakukora ebyakumwirenga we? Anga! <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Nge bubo hotu na banu. Entambi mukora biti ebwakubuhema Ongo ikora, mwendi mweba mbu: ‹Bate bakobe ho busa, twamakora ho imbi ebyakongwa bate ikora.›»<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu waramya babembi ikumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Yesu wakianga wendange ku Yerusaremu, wetere mu byati by'echuo cha ku <char style="w">Samaria</char> na cha ku Ngariraya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Entambi wakianga wamakime mu kubungu kima, babembi ikumi beya kuri we. Basimana kore nae,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Itukana n'eMyomba ya Musa, emubembi ntwakomenwanga ieya kwihi n'ebea. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Bar 13.46.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />na nti bakuange mbu: «eYesu Nyere Kuritu, tukwiri bonso!»<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Yesu warekia wamasunga bo, were bo mbu: «Mwendi kishea kuri <char style="w" lemma="Kuhani">ebakuhani</char>.» Barekia bendange ko, barama. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15-16" />Uma mu bo wabesenga <char style="w" lemma="Samaria">Musamaria</char>. eMusamaria ngo warekia wamasunga mbu wamarama, iwe wakuruka kuri Yesu na nt'utatange Ongo mu murenge mukiri. Windamya embaso yae kwansi mu makako a Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 17:15-16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Nampo ke Yesu washisha mbu: «Mbeni ntí bea ikumi nge bakurama? Ebampe mwenda bari kuni? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Mbeni kusira umpe munkati nabo wakuruka katata Ongo irenga emweni uno?» <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Yesu were eMusamaria ngo mbu: «Simana, iiri rabe. Erisimira rabe ramakuramya.»<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buni nge buseyayo eMwana w'eMwea</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mat 24.23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Kuruma nampo, <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisayo">eBafarisayo</char> bashisha Yesu mbu: «Mbeni <char style="w" lemma="Bwami bwa Ongo, Bwami bwa mu mbingu">eBwami bwa Ongo</char> buseyayo mu ani matu?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:20">Wasako bo mbu: «<char style="w" lemma="Bwami bwa Ongo, Bwami bwa mu mbingu">eBwami bwa Ongo</char> butangeya buri kikai kisungwange mu meso. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Kusira mwea wasebayo mbu: ‹Mukai, nge buno!› Abe: ‹Nge bubo!› Murukire, eBwami mbo ngie buri munkati ninu.»<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Kuruma nampo, Yesu were <char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">ebanafunsi</char> bae mbu: «Kuseyayo ntambi nji mukusondekanyayo inisunga ani <char style="w" lemma="Mwana w'eMwea">eMwana w'eMwea</char>, nakiro mu otu ruma ho, ina mutunisungiyo. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Ebea basebwireyo mbu: ‹Mukai, nge uo kuko!› Abe mbu: ‹mukai, nge uno kuno!› Ina kiro mumisayo bo. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Bushwa mbu ani eMwana w'eMwea nasekia nakuruka, nisesungwayo buri kimpenya bukianga chasungwa mu sankaro siti n'irisha chaka mu chuo kiti. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Ina nakomenwa kasa inuba nguru n'itinwa n'ebea b'ekiranga kino. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Ebyabesenga mu matu a Noa, nge bisebeseyo hotu mu matu ngi asekiayo ani eMwana w'eMwea nauruka. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Bushwa mbu mu matu ngo, ebea babesenga barisange n'iomo, babingange n'ibingwa ieya na mu rotu ndu rwakianga Noa wakime mu bwato. Nampo, mbura nyankende yake, yarisia echuo n'ishiria ebea bati. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Ngebumbo bwabesenga hotu mu biranga bya Roti. Ebea babesenga barisange n'iomo, nti bachurange n'ichuya, nti bekange n'iumba. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Ina erotu rwakianga Roti watuka ku Sondoma, Ongo wahicha rungere rwa kasha ituka mu mbingu n'ishiria ebea bati.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Ntan 18.20-33; 19.1-25.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Ngebumbo hotu busebeseyo erotu ruseyayo ani eMwana w'eMwea.<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />«Erotu ndo, kuba mwea uri hamambio watasikiyo tu mwikime mu numba mbu waringe mo bikai. Na kuba mwea usebeseyo ekwishwa watakurukiyo tu ku kwae. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Mwanikiranga mukari wa Roti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Ntan 19.26.</char></note>! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Kinsi mwea ngu wasehunayo iranga ebuingo bwae, waseriminyayo bo. Ina ingu waseriminyayo bo, waseramyayo bo. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Nibwirengi banu: Bea babi basebeseyo mu ntange nima mutu, uma waseringwayo na umpe wasesiayo mpo. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Bamina babi basebeseyo boorange hima, uma waserierwayo na umpe wasesiayo. [ <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Bea babi basebeseyo mwishwa rima, uma waserierwayo na umpe wasesiayo.]»<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Ebanafunsi bamushisha mbu: «eNyere Kuritu, mbeni ebinwa bino bisetayo kuni?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Yesu wasako bo mbu: «Ehasebeseyo ekinda nge hasekiayo esanju sakumanana.»<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Emushinga w'emushumbakari n'emushunguri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Yesu wakere ebanafunsi bae emushinga uno mwishea bo mbu rakomenwa kiro bendi bateterange mu rihema Ongo ematu ati. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Weba mbu: «Mu ubungu ruma, kwarikanga mushunguri wa binwa uma nti watasubahanga Ongo. Iwe wabesenga watasubahanga na nti tíwirae mu mwea uti-uti. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Murubungu ndo, kwarikanga hotu mushumbakari uma. Emushumbakari ngo wabesenga umweyerenga ematu ati imwire mbu: ‹Nikeri ebinwa byani ishu ebirikanga nani n'emurenda wani.›<verse eid="LUK 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />«Ina kwetanga matu mingi emushunguri ngo nt'umutinirenga. Kuruma nampo waanikira kumunda nae wisine mbu: ‹Nakiro mbu ntasubahanga Ongo na ntínirae mu mwea uti-uti, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />ina bushwa mbu emushumbakari uno waniruhya nguru, nasemuninka eriira rae kongo watendi tu weyange hano kanitaninga.›»<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Nampo Nyere Kuritu Yesu weba mbu: «Murukire imbu bweba emushunguri uno wema! <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Ngebumbo Ongo nae, ebea mbo barondoranga we, nambo bamurakengi mutu na mumwishi wakereyo bo erubansa ishu na watasiiyo mu risake bo. <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Nibwirengi mbu iwe wasebuninkayo eriira rinu tete. Ina ani <char style="w" lemma="Mwana w'eMwea">eMwana w'eMwea</char> nasekiayo nakuruka, mbeni nasekumanayo mu chuo nti mukiri bea bari n'erisimira?»<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Emushinga w'eMufarisayo n'emukongori w'ehoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Kwarikanga bea mbi babesenga bitatange mbu ibo nge bea baombokara mu makako a Ongo na nti banena bampe. Ngerikia ke Yesu wakere bo emushinga uno mbu: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />«Otu ruma, bea babi bendanga kǎhema kumunda <char style="w" lemma="Numba ya Ongo">n'eNumba ya Ongo</char>. Uma wabesenga <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisayo">Mufarisayo</char> na umpe nti mukongori wa horo. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />eMufarisayo wasimana nt'uhemange mu mutima wae mbu: ‹Tita Ongo, nakutata bushwa mbu ani ntarikanga buri ebea bampe: ibo banyai, bea ba bibí na basingirani. Nikutatange hotu bushwa mbu ntíniri buri emukongori uno w'ehoro. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Nihemanga mahemo erikwitinisha irisa n'iomo meta abi muriinga, na nininkananga echakumi ch'ebikai biti mbi bisheenga ani.›<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />«Ina emukongori w'ehoro iwe wasimana kore, na watashimi n'irarame ekwio. Ina wikaso-kaso mu bukuba murishea ebonso bwae na nt'uhemange mbu: ‹Tita Ongo, nikwiri bonso bushwa mbu ani mwea w'ebibi!›» <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Nampo ke, Yesu weba mbu: «Nibwirengi mbu emukongori w'ehoro wakuruka kukwae na ntwamaansirwa eriira mu makako a Ongo, ina ntí eMufarisayo ngo. Bushwa mbu kinsi mwea ngu witarishanga wasehichiwayo, ina kinsi mwea ngu wihichanga wasetarishiwayo.»<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wakasane etubonsobonso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mar 10.13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Otu ruma, bea bima barishie tu Yesu tubonso-bonso mbu warie mine hiyo na to. <char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">Ebanafunsi</char> barekia basunga mbo, bafinyae bo. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Ina Yesu weba mbu bamurishii ebana mbo n'ieba tu mbu: «Mureki ebana beye hano! Kiro muhangire bo, bushwa mbu <char style="w" lemma="Bwami bwa Ongo, Bwami bwa mu mbingu">eBwami bwa Ongo</char> buri kuri bea mbi ebasusanyiwa nabo.<figure style="fig" alt="Yesu anabariki watoto" file="WA03880b.tif" size="col" copy="Graham Wade" ref="18.16">Yesu ukasanengi ebana</figure> <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Muriira nibwirengi mbu: kinsi mwea ngu wafundwa ikoke eBwami bwa Ongo buri mwana mukeke, watakimiyo mo karankuso.»<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ushambarange na mutumba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mar 10.17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Kuruma nampo, mukwakare uma wa Bayuta washisha Yesu mbu: «eMuhani wakonda, mbeni nikie buni kongo nashee ebuingo bw'ematu ati?» <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yesu wamushisha mbu: «Umeba mbu nakonda bushwa nki? Kutarikanga mwea wakonda, ina Ongo wisine ho. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Ntíǒngosi ebweba emyomba: ‹Ang'ienda usingirana, ang'ienda ushura mwea, ang'ienda ushuma, ang'ienda ushukashuka, wendi usubaha iso na nsoko.›» <verse eid="LUK 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Emwea ngo wasako Yesu mbu: «Emyomba iti njo, nironjanga ebwebayo itukire ebuyu bwani.» <verse eid="LUK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Yesu warekia warukira ebinwa mbyo, wamwire mbu: «Urukwa ho kinwa kima nchi chahwa ironja ǒngo: enda kachuya ebikai biti mbi biri nabe, tinge ebusoki mbo na ubanyii byo ebasene. Kuba uronja bubo, ukubese na butumba mu mbingu. Kuruma nampo, weyanga unimise!» <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />N'emwea ngo warekia warukira ebinwa mbyo, watindibara nguru bushwa mbu iwe wabesenga mutumba nguru.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesu warekia wamasunga mbu emwea ngo wamatindibara nguru, weba mbu: «Iira, ntíratamba mu basoki ikime mu <char style="w" lemma="Bwami bwa Ongo, Bwami bwa mu mbingu">Bwami bwa Ongo</char>. <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Rasuma nguru kuri engamia ikime mu kiribu ch'enandi ina rasuma tu nguru mu mutumba ikime mu Bwami bwa Ongo.»<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Ebea mbi babesenga barukirange ebinwa mbyo beba ke mbu: «Rero-rero, inye ke ngwashukarayo!» <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesu were bo mbu: «Echasuma kuri ebea nge chatamba kuri Ongo.» <verse eid="LUK 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Nampo Petero wamwire mbu: «Kae ke, bate twamakinda isia ebiti biri rero nitu n'ikumisa ǒngo!» <verse eid="LUK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesu were bo mbu: «Nibwirengi muriira: kuba emwea wasia enumba yae, abe mukari, banachabo, babuti bae bushwa <char style="w" lemma="Bwami bwa Ongo, Bwami bwa mu mbingu">n'eBwami bwa Ongo</char>, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />Ongo wasemuninka bikai bingi nguru hano hansi, na mu matu ngi aseyayo, waseninkwayo ebuingo bw'ematu ati.»<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu watura tu emwasi w'erikwa n'erifuka rae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mar 10.32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Kuruma nampo, Yesu watinge ebanafunsi bae ikumi na babi, were bo mbu: «Munitee emate ke! Bate nge bano twendange ku Yerusaremu. Murubungu ndo nge kuri ebiti mbi byaandikwanga <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa">n'ebatahwa</char> itukana nani <char style="w" lemma="Mwana w'eMwea">eMwana w'eMwea</char>, na nge kuseberera byo. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Basenisibura mu mine y'entí Bayuta, basenisea, basenikambaa n'initurae inte. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Basenirasaka tushushu, kuruma nampo basenishura. Ina nasefuka erotu rw'emeta ashatu.»<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Ina esantumwa ntíbarukiranga kikai bushwa mbu ebinwa mbyo byabesenga byabisama. Ntíbasibanga kinki chakianga Yesu wahuna iere bo.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu waramya kihumihumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mar 10.46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Yesu wakianga wasonda ikime murubungu rwa ku Yeriko, wákumana kihumihumi kima chabesenga charika mwendende n'ense nti kikonga-kongange. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Warekia warukira erukindo rw'ebea bingi betange, washisha mbu: «Mbeni kinki cheta nku?» <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Ebea bamwire mbu: «Yesu wa ku Nasareti ng'wetange.» <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Ekihumihumi ncho chakua mbu: «eYesu Musike wa Ndauti, nikwiri bonso!»<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Ebea mbi babesenga basondora bamufine mbu wakobe, ina iwe wakua ketu na nguru mbu: «eYesu Musike wa Ndauti, nikwiri bonso!»<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yesu watindira, were bo mbu bamurishe hari we. Warekia weya kwihi na Yesu, Yesu wamushisha mbu: <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />«Ǒngo uhunange nikuronjei kinki?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Wasako mbu: «eNyere Kuritu, nisondange mbu nikai tu.» <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Nampo, Yesu wamwire mbu: «Eo ke kae tu! Erisimira rabe ramakuramya.» <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Hiha-hiha wabucha tu ikae, wamisa Yesu na nt'utatange Ongo. Ebea mbi basunganga mbo nabo batata Ongo.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Yesu wakumanana na Sakayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yesu wakianga wakime murubungu rwa ku Yeriko, weta munkati na ro. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Kai murubungu ndo nti muri mwea uma mbu nge Sakayo. Sakayo ngo wabesenga kapita k'ebakongori b'ehoro, na nti mutumba. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Wabesenga uhunange isunga Yesu, ina bushwa mbu wabesenga mwihi, ntíwakochanga imusunga bushwa n'ebwingi bw'ebea. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Bushwa nancho, watibita tete kubusondori n'ebea n'itaya mu muti kongo wasunga Yesu, bushwa mbu himpo nge hakomenwanga ho ieta Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Yesu wakianga weya mpo, wararame ekwio n'iire Sakayo mbu: «Sakayo, hita tete, bushwa mbu runotu nakomenwa isame mu mwabe.»<figure style="fig" file="WA03891b.tif" size="col" copy="Graham Wade" ref="19.5">Sakayo hiyo n'emuti</figure> <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Sakayo wahita tete n'ienda kakoke Yesu mu mwae na ngoa.<verse eid="LUK 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Ebea bati bakianga basunga mbo, babucha imutera mbu: «Rero-rero, Yesu wenda kasame mu numba ya mwea wa nsambi!» <verse eid="LUK 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Ina Sakayo wasimana, were Yesu mbu: «eNyere Kuritu, nasebanyie ebasene muhango w'ebehe byani, na kuba nashumanga kikai cha mwea mwimuhusa, nasemukuruchie cho meta anye.» <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yesu weba mbu: «Runotu, Ongo wamashukaya enumba ino bushwa mbu emwea uno hotu mwana wa mu ruanda rwa Iburahimu, <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />bushwa mbu ani <char style="w" lemma="Mwana w'eMwea">eMwana w'eMwea</char> nareya kasonda ebariminanga n'ishukaya bo.»<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mushinga w'ebakori bashatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat 25.14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Yesu wakera tu emushinga uno kuri mbi babesenga bamurukirengi. Nambu ebwakianga ngie ubungurengi ku Yerusaremu, ebea baanikira mbu <char style="w" lemma="Bwami bwa Ongo, Bwami bwa mu mbingu">eBwami bwa Ongo</char> ngie burikeya hiha-hiha. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Nampo ke Yesu wakere tu bo umpe mushinga mbu: «Kwarikanga wabume uma nti murusi. Emurusi ngo wenda mu chuo cha kore kongo bamusimika ko buri mwami. Kuruma n'erisimikwa, wakuruke tu kasimanire echuo chae. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Wakianga wasonda ienda, wabikira bea ikumi mu bakori bae. Wabanyie bo kira mwea kichere kima cha noro,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kikoroto kima chabesenga kikorerwanga mibisi iyana.</char></note> n'iere bo mbu: ‹Mwendi kanonka n'ebehe mbyo ieya nambu busekurukayo ani.›<verse eid="LUK 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />«Ina ebea b'echuo chae babesenga bamuyongwa. Bushwa nancho, batuma bea kuruma nae kongo bamwire mbu ntíbashima mbu wabesi mwami wabo. <verse eid="LUK 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Ina emwea ngo wasimikwa ho buri mwami, n'ikuruka tu ku kwabo. Warekia wamakuruka, weba mbu bamubikiri ebea ikumi mbi ebabanyienga we ebehe mwisiba kuba kira mwea wakukimisha singa. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Emukori waroso weya, weba mbu: ‹Enyere kuritu, ekichere chambesenga ǒngo chamabuta bimpe ikumi.› <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Emwami wamusako mbu: ‹Ushamucha, ǒngo mukori wakonda. Imbu bwamabesa ǒngo mwea w'inyihirwa mu bikai bikeke, nasekuninka isimanire mbungu ikumi.› <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Emukori w'emeta abi nae weya, weba mbu: ‹Enyere kuritu, ekichere kima chambesenga ǒngo chamabuta bimpe bisanu.› <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Emwami nae wamwire mbu: ‹Na ǒngo hotu, ukusimanire mbungu isanu.› <verse eid="LUK 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Kuruma nampo, umpe mukori nae weya n'ieba mbu: ‹Enyere kuritu, ekichere chambesenga ǒngo nge kino. Naranganga cho mu muri w'eribike mo behe. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Nakukusubahanga bushwa mbu ǒngo mwea wasuma. Ǒngo ukutonga entibyakubikanga ǒngo n'ikao entibyakuhinganga ǒngo.›<verse eid="LUK 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />«Emwami wamusako mbu: ‹Ǒngo mukori wema! Nasekukere erubansa itukana n'ebwameba ǒngo. Usibanga mbu ani nirikanga mwea wasuma, na nibakanga entibyakubikanga ani, na nikaonga entibyakuhinganga ani, <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />mbeni ke bushwa nki ufundwanga iria ebehe byani ekubanki? Mu rikuruka rani, namakumanange ebehe byani nti byamabuta!› <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Ngerikia were ebea babesenga mpo mbu: ‹Emukori ngu, mumunyake ekichere kima ch'enoro ncho tete, na muninke cho ingu uri n'ebichere ikumi.› <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Nabo bamwire mbu: ‹Enyere kuritu, ingu ngie uri na bichere ikumi!› <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Wasako bo mbu: ‹Nibwirengi mbu kinsi mwea ngu uri na kikai ng'waseninkwayo kimpe, ina eusira kikai wasenyakwa tu n'ekakeke kari rero nae. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Weba tu mbu: ebarenda bani mbi ebatinanga mbu ntabesi mwami wabo, murishe bo hano na mushure bo mu meso ani.›»<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wakime ku Yerusaremu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mar 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoh 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Yesu wakianga wameba ebinwa mbyo, wasondore ekikembe ch'ebea mu rienda ku Yerusaremu. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Wakianga wasonda ieya kwihi n'erubungu rwa ku Betefake na ku Betania kumushi n'erou rw'eMiseituni, watuma <char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">banafunsi</char> bae babi, were bo mbu: <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />«Mwendi murubungu eruri kubusondori ninu. Mukia mumeya kuro, mukusunga chana cha mbunda chaminwa kitangaria nensi umpe mwea, muboronga cho na murishe cho hano. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Kuba mwea wabushisha mbu bushwa nki mwobora cho, mumusakonga mbu: ‹Nyere Kuritu warae mu cho.›»<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Ebanafunsi mbo benda. Bakumana ebikai biti imbu bwakukianga Yesu were bo. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Barekia boborange echana ch'embunda cha, bisa cho bashisha bo mbu: «Mbeni banu mwoborange echana ch'embunda bushwa nki?» <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Basako bo mbu: «Nyere Kuritu warae mu cho.»<verse eid="LUK 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Ebanafunsi barishie Yesu echana ch'embunda cha. Batereka enchangi sabo hiyo n'emongo w'embunda, ituka mpo batarisha Yesu hiyo nayo. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Yesu wakianga ukiri muruendo, ebea nabo nti bansansange esanchangi sabo mu munse.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">eBayuta bakianga bakokengi emukwakare, bansansangǎ esanchangi sabo mu munse mwimunika itunda.</char></note><figure style="fig" file="lb00315b.tif" size="span" copy="Horace Knowles" ref="19.36">Yesu hiyo n'embunda</figure> <verse eid="LUK 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Wakianga ubungurengi murubungu rwa ku Yerusaremu, ihita n'erou rw'eMiseituni, <char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">ebanafunsi</char> babesenga bamoa nguru na nti batatange Ongo mu murenge mukiri bushwa n'ebishisharo biti byasunganga bo. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Babesenga bebange mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">«Wákasanirwe eMwami ngu weyange mu rina ra Nyere Kuritu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">Mu mbingu kubesi buhoro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">Na Ongo watatwe!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Sab 118.26.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Bushwa nambo, <char style="w">Bafarisayo</char> bima munkati n'ekikembe ch'ebea, bere Yesu mbu: «eMuhani, fine <char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">ebanafunsi</char> babe mbu bakobe!» <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yesu wasako bo mbu: «Nibwirengi banu: kuba ebea bano bamubibira, emakoi asekua.»<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu warire erubungu rwa ku Yerusaremu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Yesu wakianga urikasaa ku Yerusaremu, warekia wasunga kuro, wabucha ire. <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />Weba mbu: «Kuba na ǒngo umusibange ebyamukurishiengi ebuhoro runotu! Ina ubiswa bo, utukoche isunga bo enompena! <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Kuseyayo matu ngi asekiayo ebarenda babe basekutimbayo kongo bakukwanisha. N'entambi basekia bamumba erukito rw'erikwiranga kwihi ninu, nampo ke basekuekenyayo mu sankaro siti. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Basekushiriayo shu-shu, ǒngo n'ebana binu. Batakusieriyo kiro n'ikoi hambasiro na rimpe, bushwa mbu Ongo wameya kakushukaya, ina nt'ukumuteerera!»<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wahensa ebachurusi mu Numba ya Ongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mar 11.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoh 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Yesu wakianga wamakime habutara <char style="w" lemma="Numba ya Ongo">bw'eNumba ya Ongo</char>, wabucha ihensa ebachurusi mpo,<figure style="fig" file="lb00316b.tif" size="span" copy="Horace Knowles" ref="19.45">Yesu uhensange ebachurusi mu Numba ya Ongo </figure> <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />were bo mbu: «Mu Mitiro Yashurukara, Ongo weba mbu: ‹<char style="w" lemma="Numba ya Ongo">Enumba</char> yani isebeseyo numba ya mahemo.› Ina mumabundura yo ibese numba inji ibisamengi mo ebǐbi!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu washemba ebachurusi mbu ibo bǐbi bushwa mbu babesenga bahunanga mbu ebea bachure ebikai byabo kongo basibura byo kuri Ongo mu Numba ya Ongo. Babesenga bachuyanga ebikai mbyo busi bwasuma nguru kuri ebea. </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Soma <ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa 56.7</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Kirotu, Yesu wabesenga uhananga ebea kumunda <char style="w" lemma="Numba ya Ongo">n'eNumba ya Ongo</char>. <char style="w" lemma="Kuhani">Ebakwakare b'ebakuhani</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Bahani b'eMyomba">ebahani b'eMyomba</char> hima n'ebampe bakwakare babesenga basondanga buni bwamumuya bo. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Ina batashei mbu bwamuronjǎ bo, bushwa mbu ebea bati babesenga bamurukirirenga nguru.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Emaa a Yesu asaa kuni?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mar 11.27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Otu ruma, Yesu wabesenga uhanange n'ihubiri ebea eMwasi Wakonda kumunda <char style="w" lemma="Numba ya Ongo">n'eNumba ya Ongo</char>. <char style="w" lemma="Kuhani">Ebakwakare b'ebakuhani</char> <char style="w" lemma="Bahani b'eMyomba">n'ebahani b'eMyomba</char> hima n'ebakungu b'eBayuta bamusaire nsisu, <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />bamushisha mbu: «Ebinwa bino, twiri inye ngwakukutuma karonja byo, abe inye ngwakukuninka emaa erironja byo?»<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yesu wasako bo mbu: «Nani nibushishange kinwa kima. Muniiri ke, <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />mbeni Yohana wakutonga emaa erirubika kuni? Kwa Ongo abe kuri ebea?» <verse eid="LUK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Nampo, babucha ihakanyana mbu: «Kuba twamwire mbu emaa ae asaange kwa Ongo, wasetushisha mbu: ‹Bushwa nki ke ntímukumusimira?› <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Kuba twamwire tu mbu emaa a Yohana asaa kuri ebea, ebea bati basetushura na makoi, bushwa mbu ebati basimira mbu Yohana wabesenga <char style="w">mutahwa</char> wa Ongo.»<verse eid="LUK 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Nampo bamusako ke mbu: «Bate ntítosi kwakianga Yohana wakuto emaa erirubika ebea.» <verse eid="LUK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yesu nae were bo mbu: «Nani hotu ntabwiri mbu mu maa anye nge aronjange mo ani ebinwa mbi.»<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mushinga w'ebakori bema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mar 12.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Kuruma nampo, Yesu wakere ebea emushinga uno mbu: «Kwarikanga wabume uma ngu wahinganga ishwa ra misabibu. Wasombya ro bahingi bima kongo benda bamuninkange muhango mu mirime, nae wenda mu chuo cha kore matu mingi. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Emirime yakianga yamase, emwea ngo watuma mukori wae uma kuri ebahingi mbu bamuninke emuhango wae mu mirime. Ina ebahingi mbo bahumba emukori ngo n'imuhensa, n'imukurucha kobokobo. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Mine erishwa watumire tu bo umpe mukori, ina bamuhumba hotu n'imukambaa, n'imukurucha kobokobo. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Watumire tu bo mukori wa meta ashatu, nae hotu bamubabaya n'imutaa kumushi n'erishwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Nampo ke, minerishwa weba mbu: ‹Nasekia ke buni? Mbo! Nasetuma ke musikyani, kitwana chani, munantambi basemusubaha.› <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Ina ebakori mbo barekia basunga emwana ngo weyange, bamwende rwanko, beba mbu: ‹Uno nge mine emwandu w'erishwa rino, kai tumushure kongo twasia na ro.› <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Bamutinge, bamutaa kumushi n'erishwa n'imushura.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">«Nampo Yesu washisha ebea mbu: Ebahingi mbi, mbeni minerishwa wamuronja bo buni? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Waseya kashiria ebahingi mbo n'ininka ro bampe bahingi.» Ebea barekia barukira mbo, beba mbu: «Ebinwa buri mbyo, kiro byatuhiereyo rotu!» <verse eid="LUK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Ina Yesu wasindera bo n'iere bo mbu: «Muniri kuba eMitiro Yashurukara ino yeba buni!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">‹Erikoi ratawanga n'ebimbi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">iro nge ramabese ikoi rikiri r'enkuso y'enumba.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Sab 118.22.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Kinsi mwea ngu wasekireyo mu rikoi ndo wasenechaayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:18">nangu wasehukirwayo na ro risemubunguraayo.»<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Bahani b'eMyomba">Ebahani b'eMyomba</char> <char style="w" lemma="Kuhani">n'ebakwakare b'ebakuhani</char> barekia bamarukira mbo, basiba mbu Yesu wamakera emushinga ngo bushwa nabo. Hiha-hiha basonda imutinge, ina bakwa boba bushwa n'ebwingi bw'ebea.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eritua ehoro ya Kaisari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mar 12.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Ebakwakare mbo b'eBayuta babucha ikairire Yesu kongo bashee kinwa chimusongere kuri emukwakare w'eBaroma. Nampo ke basonda bea, batuma bo kuri Yesu. Ebea mbo bironjanga buri bea baombokara, kai babesenga basondange itingire Yesu mu binwa byae kongo bamusibura kuri ebakwakare b'echuo. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Ebea mbo bamwire mbu: «eMuhani, bate twosi mbu ebinwa byebangǎ ǒngo n'ebihananga ǒngo ebea birikanga b'iira. Utwiraenga rabe mu birira bya bea, ina ǒngo uhananga bo binwa byaombokara by'ense ya Ongo. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Eo twiiri ke, mbeni eMyomba yitu yarisia ituwa ehoro kuri Kaisari abe anga?»<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Ina Yesu warekia wamakengura ebwamamutea bo ebinwa mbyo, were bo mbu: <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />«Munishee kasa kikoroto kima.» Nampo ke washisha bo mbu: «Mbeni ensusanya ino yanye? N'erina rino raandikwa hano mbeni ranye?» Nabo basako mbu: «Bya Kaisari.»<figure style="fig" file="hk00168b.tif" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles" ref="20.24">Ebehe by'emwami Kaisari</figure> <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Nampo ke Yesu were bo mbu: «Kai mwendi muninka Kaisari ebikai mbi byae, na Ongo nae mbi byae.»<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Ebea mbo ntíbakochanga imushee mo kinwa echamumutingire bo mu mbi ebyabesenga byebange we munkati n'ebea. Ina bashisharanga mu kinwa nchi chasakonga we, bakoba!<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbeni ebakwire basefukayo?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mar 12.18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Kuruma nampo, <char style="w">Basandukayo</char> bima beyere Yesu. (eBasandukayo nge bebangǎ mbu ebakwire batafukiyo.) <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />Bamushisha mbu: «eMuhani, Musa watwandikirenga mu kitabo ch'eMyomba buno mbu: ‹Kuba mwea wabinga na wamakwa usira mwana, munachabo wahwa ibinga emushumbakari kongo wabutire ingu warikwa bana.› <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Ngebumbo, kwarikanga misike irinda ya bura buma. Entangi yabinga mumina, ina yakwa nti tíyasia mwana. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />W'emeta abi nae watinge emushumbakari ngo, ina nae wakwa nti tíwabuta n'emushumbakari. <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />Kuruma nampo, w'emeta ashatu nae hotu bubo. Rabesenga bumbo-bumbo mu bati barinda. Ebati bakwanga nti tíbaributa nae anga na mwana uma. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Kuruma nampo emushumbakari ngo nae wakwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Mbeni ke, erotu rw'erifuka, emumina ngo wasebeseyo wanye, bushwa mbu emisike irinda iti yamubinganga?»<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesu wasako bo mbu: «Mu chuo kino, ebea babingananga. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Ina ebea mbi ebasungwa mu makako a Ongo mbu bakomenwa ifuka mu rikime mu Bwami ebuseyayo, batabingiyo abe ibingwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Batakwiyo tu. Bushwa mbu basebeseyo buri bamaraika. Ibo nge bana ba Ongo bushwa barifuka. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Musa washeanga shu-shu mbu ebakwire basefukayo, ekwaandikanga we itukana n'ekitundi ch'ekasha.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Ituk 3.1-6.</char></note> Hiha nge habikira we Nyere Kuritu mbu Ongo wa Iburahimu, Ongo wa Isake na Ongo wa Yakobo.» <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Yesu weba tu mbu: «Ongo ntí Ongo w'ebakwire, ina iwe Ongo w'ebariho; ebea bati bari ho bushwa na we.»<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Bahani b'eMyomba">Bahani bima b'eMyomba</char> bamwire mbu: «eMuhani, umasubya shu.» <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Kuruma nampo, kusira mwea ingu werekanga imushisha tu kinwa kiti-kiti.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kirisitu mukiri irenga Ndauti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mar 12.35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Kuruma n'ebinwa mbyo, Yesu washisha ebea mbu: «Bushwa nki ebea bebange mbu <char style="w" lemma="Masia, Kirisitu, Rukombora">Kirisitu</char> nge Mwana wa Ndauti? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Ntí Ndauti wisine ke ngwebanga mu kitabo ch'eSaburi mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">‹Nyere Kuritu Ongo wakwere Nyere Kuritu mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">"Rika mu kuboko kwani kw'ekwabume,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />ieya n'erotu ndu rusekia ebarenda babe babese kikai ch'eritereke mo ebisando byabe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Sab 110.1.</char></note>."›<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />«Kuba Ndauti wakubikira Kirisitu mbu ‹Nyere kurwabo›, buni ke tu Kirisitu ngo ngwamubese musike wa Ndauti?»<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukohyanga kuri ebahani b'eMyomba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mar 12.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Ebea bati bakianga bakiri bateange Yesu emate, were <char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">ebanafunsi</char> bae mbu: <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />«Mukohyanga <char style="w" lemma="Bahani b'eMyomba">n'ebahani b'eMyomba</char>! Ibo bashimangǎ ietana-etana na nchangi sareha-reha. Na bashimangǎ tu ikeiwa munkati n'ebea n'irika mu bitumbi bya kubusondori <char style="w" lemma="Sinangoki">by'emasinangoki</char> nanku kuriwanga ebio. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Banyakangǎ ebashumbakari ebikai byabo biti. Na bahemangǎ tu mahemo a mundiendie kongo basungwa n'ebea. Bushwa nancho, Ongo wasehukumuyo bo nguru!»<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Ebisabo by'emushumbakari musene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mar 12.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yesu wakianga uri mu Numba ya Ongo, watambya emeso mu bea, wasunga ebukiange ebatumba baria ebisabo byabo mu nku y'ebisabo. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Wasunga tu mushumbakari uma musene ingu weyanga nae karia mo twabikoroto tubi. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Nampo Yesu weba mbu: «Nibwirengi muriira, emushumbakari uno musene, iwe nge wamakuto bisabo bingi irenga mbi ebyamakia ebea bati bakuto. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Bushwa mbu ebati bano, ebisabo byamakuto bo ibyo muhango wambi byakusianga mu behe byabo nti bamakindanya kasa emirao yabo iti. Ina emushumbakari uno, iwe mu busene bwae, wamakuto ebiti biri rero nae byerimusake mu buingo bwae.»<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu watura mwasi w'eribiha r'eNumba ya Ongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mar 13.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Bea bima babesenga bashambarange bushwa <char style="w" lemma="Numba ya Ongo">n'eNumba ya Ongo</char>. Babesenga bebange mbu yimbwa mu makoi akonda-konda hima na bimpe bikai mbi byakianga ebea basaba Ongo. Ina Yesu were bo mbu: <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />«Bino ebisungange banu, kwaseya matu ngi mutusungiyo tu ikoi rima hambasiro na rimpe, ebisusu biti bisekakurwayo.»<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ebinwa by'ematu a hende</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mar 13.3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Ngerikia ebanafunsi bae bamushisha mbu: «eMuhani, mbeni ebinwa mbi byebange ǒngo byasetayo mu ani matu, na buni nge busekiayo ebea basiba mbu ebinwa mbyo biri keya?» <verse eid="LUK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yesu wasako bo mbu: «Mukohyanga, kiro muhuswa na mwea uti-uti. Bushwa mbu bea bingi baseyayo mu rina rani n'ieba mbu ibo ke nge Kirisitu, entambi yameya! Ina kiro mumisa bo. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Mukukiayo murukira emyasi y'ebita n'ebushokoshoko, kiro musubahi bushwa mbu ebiti mbyo byakomenwa kasa isungwa, ematu ngo echuo kisebeseyo ntíchahiere nensi engendero ya cho.»<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Yesu weba tu mbu: «Bea ba chuo kima basekwanayo na bea ba kimpe chuo, na bwami buma busekwanayo na bumpe bwami. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Kwasetayo karingiri kakiri mu chuo. Kusebeseyo rwaka rwingi na makoni mingi asuma mu byuo. Kusesungwayo biteerere bya bishisharo ituka ekwio.<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />«Ina kubusondori n'erisungwa r'ebinwa mbyo, ebea bendi babuminange n'ibunubya, kongo musambishwa mu <char style="w" lemma="Sinangoki">masinangoki</char> n'ibutaa mu mwiyororo. Na basenda baburiange tu mu makako ebami n'ebakwakare b'echuo bushwa nani. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Ietere mbyo, mukwenda banu mwebange ebinwa ebyosi banu bushwa nani. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Kino nge chasibiriranga banu: kiro mwinubya na kwishishirisha mbu mbeni buni nge busenda bwebange banu. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Bushwa mbu ani ngi nendi nibuninkange ebinwa by'ebutesa ebisenda byebange banu, ieya n'entambi nji ebarenda binu batendi bakochange ienga byo abe itina byo. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />N'ebabuti binu, na basike binu, na banakinu, na bira binu nabo basebusiburayo kuri ebakwakare. Na bima munkati ninu basekererwayo ubansa rw'ikwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Ebea bati basebubaayo bushwa n'erina rani. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Ina mu biti mbyo, kusira anga n'uteo ruma rw'emintwe yinu indu ruseriminayo. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Mwendi mwiandiya, bushwa nancho mukushukayayo ebuingo bwinu.»<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Erishamburwa ra ku Yerusaremu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mat 24.15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mar 13.14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />Kuruma nampo, Yesu wenderana n'ieba mbu: «Mukukiayo musunga ebasura batimba erubungu rwa ku Yerusaremu, musibanga mbu ngie ruri kashamburwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Nampo, ebea mbi basebeseyo mu chuo cha ku Yundea babeki mu sangu, nambi basebeseyo ku Yerusaremu batuke kuro. Nambi basebeseyo mu tunsari kiro bakuruka tu.<verse eid="LUK 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />«Bushwa mbu ematu ngo ngyasekiayo Ongo wahukumu ebea kongo ebiti mbi byebwanga mu Mitiro Yashurukara bibererere.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Ose 9.7.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Mu matu ngo, risebeseyo buhanya kuri ebamina barito na mbi barishange ebana mabere, bushwa mbu kusebeseyo minubo mingi mu chuo ncho. Na Ongo wasesheayo ebea mbo mbu iwe wasubuke bo. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Bima baseshurwayo mu myere na bampe basendayo rereke mu byuo by'esankaro siti. Nambi ntíbosi Ongo basenantayo ku Yerusaremu ieya nambu busekiayo ematu aninkwanga bo arumira.»<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Erikuruka ra Yesu Kirisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mar 13.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />Kuruma nampo, Yesu weba tu mbu: «Ebea basesungayo biteerere mu mwishi, mu mweri na mu sankekeni. Na hano hansi, ebea basekwayo koha n'itingirwa na boba bushwa emibimbi n'emirurumo y'enyansa. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Ebea baseriminyayo ebwenge bushwa n'eboba mu rianikira ebinwa mbi bisetayo mu chuo. Bushwa mbu ebiti mbi biri n'emaa mu mbingu bisetenjiwayo. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Kuruma nampo, ebea basenisungayo ani <char style="w" lemma="Mwana w'eMwea">eMwana w'eMwea</char> bweyange ani mu rutundo na maa hima na busime bwingi. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Mu ntambi ebinwa mbyo bisekiayo byabucha isungwa, musimananga n'ibese na maa, bushwa mbu ematu inu erishukara ameya.»<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ebiteerere byerikuruka ra Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mar 13.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Kuruma nampo, Yesu wakere ebea emushinga uno mbu: «Mwihanisangǎ mu muti w'etini n'emiti impe: <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Entambi nji yasunga banu emasani ao abucha ishuka, banu musibanga mbu ekiranga chakonda ngie kiri keya. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Nge bumbo, mukukiayo musungǎ ebinwa mbyo ngie byetange, musibiriranga mbu <char style="w" lemma="Bwami bwa Ongo, Bwami bwa mu mbingu">eBwami bwa Ongo</char> ngie buri keya. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Nibwirengi muriira mbu: ebinwa bino biseberereshiwayo na bea bima b'ematu ano nensi nti tíbakwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Embingu n'echuo bisetayo, ina ebinwa byani ibyo bitetiyo karankuso.»<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Erotu rwa hende ruseyayo nsisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />Kuruma nampo, Yesu weba mbu: «Mukohyanga! Emitima yinu kiro yabinduke n'embusha y'erisonda irisa ringi, n'itamira, na kwinubya bushwa n'ebuingo bwinu. Kuba ntímukae shu, erotu rwa hende <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />rusebeseyo imbu bukianga emuteo watinge. Bushwa mbu erotu ndo ruseyayo, rusesarimyayo ebea bati b'echuo. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Mwendi mukohya na mwendi muhema kira ntambi. Murikia mbo, mukushee emaa eribeka ebinwa mbi biseyayo n'emaa erisimana mu makako nani, ani <char style="w" lemma="Mwana w'eMwea">eMwana w'eMwea</char>.» <verse eid="LUK 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Kirotu ndu rwakianga Yesu wabesenga usibanange mwihana ebea mu <char style="w">Numba ya Ongo</char>, wabesenga wendanga kasame mu rou rw'eMiseituni. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Na kirotu muranga-ranga, ebea bati babesenga beyanga kamurukira ha Numba ya Ongo.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Enama y'erishura Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoh 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Erotu rukiri rw'emikati nji isira chachu, rwabikirwa mbu <char style="w">Pasaka</char>,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ePasaka yashembwa hano nge yasubukia erotu ndu rwatukanga Baisiraeri mu bukobe bwa Farao ku Misiri, ina ntí nge Pasaka y'erifuka ra Yesu Kirisitu.</char></note> rwabesenga ngie ruri keya. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" /><char style="w" lemma="Kuhani">Ebakwakare b'ebakuhani</char> <char style="w" lemma="Bahani b'eMyomba">n'ebahani b'eMyomba</char> babesenga basondange buni buseshurishayo bo Yesu, ina babesenga basubahange ebea.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuta warisia isibura Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mar 14.10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Nampo ke, <char style="w">Mushumbu</char> wakime mu mutima wa Yuta Isikarioti, uma mu santumwa sa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Yuta wenda kashambara <char style="w" lemma="Kuhani">n'ebakwakare b'ebakuhani</char>, hima n'ebakwakare b'ebasura mbi barangangǎ eNumba ya Ongo, kongo warana nabo buni busesibure we bo Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Ebakwakare mbo bashima nguru, na barana nae mbu basemuninka behe. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yuta warisia, wabucha isonda ntambi yakonda y'erininka bo Yesu n'ebea nti tíbosi.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu warisa ebio bya hende hima n'ebanafunsi bae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26.17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mar 14.12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoh 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Erotu rukiri rw'emikati nji isira chachu rweya. Mu rotu ndo, eBayuta babesenga bashuranga mburi bushwa n'erotu rukiri rw'ePasaka. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yesu watuma Petero na Yohana, were bo mbu: «Mwendi katuteke bio byerotu rukiri <char style="w" lemma="Pasaka">rw'ePasaka</char> kongo twarisa.» <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Bamushisha mbu: «Mbeni ushima twendi katekere byo kuni?» <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Were bo mbu: «Mwendi murubungu rukiri. Mumeya ko, mukukumana mwea uma waria irea ra mecha. Emwea ngo mumumisanga mu numba nji yasekime mu we, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />na mwerenga mine mo mbu: ‹eMuhani ukushishange kuba hani nge hari buari mu numba haserire we ebio by'ePasaka hima <char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">n'ebanafunsi</char> bae.› <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Nae wasebushea buari bukiri ekwio inku ekwamatunganyiwa. Nanko nge kuteki banu ebio by'ePasaka.» <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Ebanafunsi mbo benda. Bakianga bameya ko, bakumana ebikai biti mbu bwakianga Yesu were bo. Nampo, bateke ho ebio byabo byerotu rukiri rw'ePasaka.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ebio byerikandire mo Nyere Kuritu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26.26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mar 14.22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Bako 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Entambi yakianga yameya, Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Ntumwa">n'esantumwa</char> sae barika n'ibucha irisa.<figure style="fig" file="WA03909b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="22.14">Yesu ubengange emukati</figure> <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Were bo mbu: «Nakuhunanga nguru irisa ninu ebio bino byerotu <char style="w" lemma="Pasaka">rw'ePasaka</char> kubusondori n'erinuba rani! <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Bushwa nibwirengi mbu ntarisiyo tu ninu Pasaka ieya n'erotu ndu rusekɨayo narisa imbi byarumira mu <char style="w" lemma="Bwami bwa Ongo, Bwami bwa mu mbingu">Bwami bwa Ongo</char>.»<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Nampo, Yesu watinge erusara, watata Ongo n'ieba mbu: «Mutingi erusara runo, na mwomu banu bati. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Bushwa nibwirengi mbu itukire enompena, ani nt'omu tuyo <char style="w">ndifai</char> ieya n'erotu ndu ruseyayo <char style="w" lemma="Bwami bwa Ongo, Bwami bwa mu mbingu">eBwami bwa Ongo</char>.»<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Kuruma nampo, Yesu watinge mukati, na watata Ongo. Wanoa o n'ininka esantumwa sae n'iere bo mbu: «Uno nge mubi wani ewamakinda isiburwa bushwa ninu. Mwendi muronja buno murinikandira.»<verse eid="LUK 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Bakianga bamahea irisa, Yesu waninka hotu bo usara rwa ndifai n'ieba mbu: «Erusara runo ng'erirai rishasha r'enchama yani eisekubuka bushwa ninu. Iro ng'erirai ndi raronjanga Ongo mu nchama yani inji isekubuka bushwa ninu.<verse eid="LUK 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />«Ina mukaenga! Emwea ngu usenisibura ngie urisange hima nani. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Mu riira, ani <char style="w" lemma="Mwana w'eMwea">eMwana w'eMwea</char> nasekwa imbu bwakianga Ongo weba. Ina waherwa emwea ngu wasenisibura!» <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Nampo, esantumwa sabucha ishishana munkati nato kuba inye ngwasekora ekinwa ncho!<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inye nge mukwakare?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Kuruma nampo, ebanafunsi babucha buhaka bukiri bw'isiba kuba inye ngwamubese mukwakare munkati nabo. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yesu were bo mbu: «Mu bea mbi ntíbosi Ongo, ebami babo basimanirengǎ bo mu maa. Ina ebakwakare bashimangǎ ebea babikire bo mbu: ‹Bakori ba binwa byakonda.› <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Ina kiro byendi bibesange mbo munkati ninu. Kinsi mwea ngu mukwakare mu banu ngwakomenwa ibese buri iwe nge mwanunke, n'emukwakare wahwa ibese buri iwe nge mukori. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Mbeni inye nge mukwakare mu bea bano: ingu warika mwirisa ebio abe ingu eumusheengi byo? Kai ntí ngu warika n'urisange ebio! Ina ani niri munkati ninu buri mukori.<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />«Banu ntímukunisianga mu ntambi y'emyereko yani. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Bushwa nancho, namabuninka eBwami imbu bwakianga hotu Tita wanininka bo, <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />kongo murisa n'iomo hima nani mu Bwami bwani. Na banu tu mukurikayo mu bitumbi by'ebami kongo muhukumuyo esanganda ikumi na sibi s'eBaisiraeri.»<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu were Petero mbu wasemutuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mar 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoh 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Kuruma nampo, Yesu were Simoni mbu: «eSimoni, Simoni! Rukira! <char style="w">Mushumbu</char> wamaninkwa ntambi y'eribufufura ebukianga emwea wafufura engano. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Ina namakuheme kongo utusii erisimira rabe kuri ani. N'entambi isekia ukuruka kuri ani, usakenga banakinu kongo baandira nguru mu risimira.»<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Petero wamwire mbu: «eNyere Kuritu, ani nasimira iminwa hima nabe n'ikwa hima nabe.»<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesu wamusako mbu: «Nikwirengi ǒngo Petero mbu runotu enchongore isebikira na nt'umakinda inituna meta ashatu mbu ntíǒngonosi.»<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Behe, kimbesa na mbenge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Kuruma nampo, Yesu washisha ebanafunsi bae mbu: «Mbeni nakianga nabutuma, banu nti tímuria behe, kimbesa abe birato, mbeni kuri kikai charukwanga banu?» Nabo mbu: «Anga!»<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Nae were bo mbu: «Eo ke, kinsi ngu uri na karufaranga watingi ko, nangu uri na kimbesa nae watingi cho, nangu usira mbenge wachuye enchangi yae kongo wachura yo. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Nibwirengi mbu rakomenwa ebinwa bino binihieri imbi ebyaandikwa mu Kitabo Chashurukara mbu: ‹Uansirwange munkati n'ebabisha.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Isa 53.12.</char></note> Iira, ebinwa biti mbi byanikae ani ngie biri kwihi n'ieya hende.»<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Nampo, ebanafunsi bamwire mbu: «eNyere Kuritu, kae, turi na mbenge sibi hano.» Nae wasako bo mbu: «Ae, mushiri mpo.»<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wahema Ongo mu rou rw'eMiseituni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mar 14.32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yesu watuka mpo, wátarie mu rou rw'eMiseituni imbu bwabesenga bukianga ho we. <char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">N'ebanafunsi</char> bae bamutucha. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Warekia wameya ko, were bo mbu: «Muheme kongo muhundusa emyereko.» <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Kuruma nampo, wishika kore kakeke nabo mu bwende ebwamuhierě mo ikoi ritawa na mwine, wakome emaru n'ihema mbu: <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />«eTita, kuba usasa, erusara runo rw'eminubo ino n'echei ro kore nani! Ina kiro byabunduke buri ebwashima ani, ina ebyashima ǒngo nge bikorwe.» [ <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Nampo, maraika uma watuka mu mbingu weya kongo wamuninka maa. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Yesu wabesenga na koha nguru, nampo wabucha ihema ketu na maa. N'esantubano sabucha imutuka mo n'irara ekwansi buri matondi a nchama.]<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Yesu wakianga wamakinda ihema, wasimana n'ikuruka hari <char style="w" lemma="Mwanafunsi">ebanafunsi</char> bae. Wakumana bo nti barere bushwa babesenga na bonso bwingi. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Were bo mbu: «Mbeni banu murere bushwa nki? Musumuke na muheme kongo kiro mukime mu myereko.»<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eritingirwa ra Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yoh 18.3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Yesu wakianga ukiri webange, hiha-hiha kikembe cha bea chamusaire nsisu. Yuta uma mu santumwa sae nge wasondorenga bo. Wákensere hari Yesu kongo wámukoke.<figure style="fig" file="WA03917b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="22.47">Yuta wasibura Yesu</figure> <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Ina Yesu wamushisha mbu: «eYuta! Mbeni mu rinikoke nge ranisibura mo ǒngo, ani <char style="w" lemma="Mwana w'eMwea">eMwana w'eMwea</char>?» <verse eid="LUK 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Ebea mbi babesenga hima na Yesu barekia basunga ebyasondanga isungwa, bamushisha mbu: «eNyere Kuritu, mbeni tukondae bo na mbenge?» <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Hiha-hiha uma mubo wakera ekote kw'ekwabume kw'ekahungu <char style="w" lemma="Kuhani">k'emukwakare w'ebakuhani</char>. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Ina Yesu weba mbu: «Koko, burombo!» Watinge mu kote kw'emwea o n'imuramya.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Nampo Yesu were <char style="w" lemma="Kuhani">ebakwakare b'ebakuhani</char>, n'ebakwakare b'ebasura mbi ebarangangǎ <char style="w" lemma="Numba ya Ongo">eNumba ya Ongo</char>, n'ebakungu mbi beyanga kamumina mbu: «Bushwa nki banu muniyere na mbenge hima na mihumbo buri ani mwibi? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Ematu ati nabesenga niri ninu mu Numba ya Ongo ina ntímunitingenga. Ina entambi ino nge yinu na ntambi y'emukwakare w'emwirimya.»<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petero watuna Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mat 26.57-58</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mar 14.53-54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yoh 18.12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Kuruma nampo, ebea mbo batinge Yesu. Bakianga bamamutinge, bamuria mu numba <char style="w" lemma="Kuhani">y'ekuhani mukwakare</char>. Petero wabesenga umisange bo kasando kihi na kare.<verse eid="LUK 22:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Barekia beya, bakoya kasha munkati n'ebutara bw'ekuhani mukwakare, n'irika. Petero nae weya kanyukara mu kasha hima nabo. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Mukori uma wamumina wasunga Petero ntwarika kumushi n'ekasha. Ekikumi ncho chamusisirisa nguru n'ieba mbu: «Ewabume ngu nae uri rero hima na Yesu!» <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Ina Petero wituna n'ieba mbu: «Ǒngo mumina, ntínosi emwea ngo!»<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Kuruma na ntambi nkeke, umpe mwea nae wasunga Petero n'imwire mbu: «Na ǒngo hotu uma mu bo.» Ina Petero wasako emwea o mbu: «Etita, ani ntínimosi.»<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Kwakianga kwameta buna ntambi nima, umpe mwea weba na kwimima mbu: «Muriira, emwea ngu iwe nae wabeseyo hotu hima na Yesu, bushwa mbu iwe nae mwea w'echuo cha ku Ngariraya.»<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Ina Petero wamwire mbu: «Etita, ntínosi chebange ǒngo!» Wakianga ukiri webange, enchongore yabikira nakuba. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Nyere Kuritu wikebera, wasindera Petero. Petero wasubukia ebinwa byamwerenga Nyere Kuritu mbu: «Nikwirengi ǒngo Petero mbu runotu enchongore isebikira na nt'umanituna meta ashatu mbu ntíǒngonosi.» <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Petero watuka habutara na nt'urengi nguru.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ebea basea Yesu n'imuhumba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mat 26.67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mar 14.65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Ebea mbi babesenga barangange Yesu babesenga bamuseange n'imuhumba. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Bamumina emeso n'imushisha mbu: «Tabura k'emwea ngu wamakukaso!» <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Ibo bamurekeranga bimpe binwa bingi by'imukambaa.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu warierwa ha Rushu rukiri rw'eBayuta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mar 14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yoh 18.19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Ebutu bwakianga bwamacha, ebakungu b'eBayuta <char style="w" lemma="Kuhani">n'ebakwakare b'ebakuhani</char> hima <char style="w" lemma="Bahani b'eMyomba">n'ebahani b'eMyomba</char> bakumanana mu Rushu rukiri rwabo. Nampo barisha Yesu mu makako abo. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Bamushisha mbu: «Eo twiri ke, mbeni ǒngo nge <char style="w" lemma="Masia, Kirisitu, Rukombora">Kirisitu</char>?» Yesu wasako bo mbu: «Nakiro namubwire, mutunisimiri, <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />na namubushishǎ kinwa mutunisubii. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Itukire enompena, ani <char style="w" lemma="Mwana w'eMwea">eMwana w'eMwea</char>, mu ruharo rw'ekwabume rwa Ongo mine maa nge mwenda karika ani.»<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Nampo ke, ebati bamushisha mbu: «Ngerieba mbu ǒngo ng'eMusike wa Ongo?» Na Yesu mbu: «Banu nge mumeba mbo!»<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Mu rikindanya, beba mbu: «Ntítwirae tuna mu mwea uti-uti ngu wamututure emyasi y'emwea uno! Bushwa mbu twamakinda irukira bate bisine ebyameba we!»<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Yesu warierwa kuri Pirato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27.1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mar 15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoh 18.28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Kuruma nampo, ebea bati mbi babesenga ha nkumanano y'eRushu rukiri rw'eBayuta basimana n'iria Yesu kuri Pirato. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Bakianga bameya ho, babucha imusogere mbu: «Twamakumanyanya emwea uno nt'usheereshange ebea bitu. Werengi rero bo mbu kiro bendi batuange tu ehoro kuri Kaisari, na webange tu mbu iwe kisine nge <char style="w" lemma="Masia, Kirisitu, Rukombora">Kirisitu</char>, mwami.»<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Pirato washisha Yesu mbu: «Mbeni ǒngo nge Mwami w'eBayuta?» Yesu wamusako mbu: «Ǒngo ng'umeba mbo!» <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Nampo, Pirato were <char style="w" lemma="Kuhani">ebakwakare b'ebakuhani</char> n'ekikembe ch'ebea mbu: «Ntínasunga kinwa nchi chamusingwa mbu emwea uno wahukumiwe ikwa.» <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Ina bimima nguru n'ieba mbu: «Emwea uno, ebinwa bihanange we ebea bisheeresha echuo kiti cha ku Yundea. Wakubuchie nabyo mu chuo cha ku Ngariraya, na nge uno wamarembera nabyo kuno ku Yerusaremu.»<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu warierwa kwa Herote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Pirato wakianga warukira ebinwa mbyo, washisha mbu: «Mbeni emwea uno mwisa ku Ngariraya?» <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Wakianga wamarukira mbu Yesu mwisa echuo nchi chabesenga chasimanirwa na Herote, were bo mbu barie Yesu kwa Herote bushwa mbu erotu ndo Herote wabesenga uri ku Yerusaremu.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Herote wabesenga urukiranga ho emyasi ya Yesu. Itukire kare nt'usondanga ho imusunga. Wabesenga uhunanga imusunga nt'uronjange bishisharo. Nampo ke wamoa nguru mu rimusunga. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Washishirisha Yesu binwa bingi, ina Yesu ntwamusakonga. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" /><char style="w" lemma="Kuhani">Ebakwakare b'ebakuhani</char> <char style="w" lemma="Bahani b'eMyomba">n'ebahani b'eMyomba</char> ebabesenga mpo babesenga bakwimima nguru mu rihambike Yesu binwa bingi. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Herote n'ebasura bae babucha ikambaa Yesu n'imucharika. Bamumbaricha nchangi inji yabesenga yakoma nguru, nampo Herote wamukurucha tu kwa Pirato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Herote bana Pirato babesenga barenda, ina itukire erotu ndo babese bamwira na mwira.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pirato wakera erubansa rwa Yesu mbu washurwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27.15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mar 15.6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yoh 18.39—19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Pirato wabikira <char style="w" lemma="Kuhani">ebakwakare b'ebakuhani</char> n'ebampe bakwakare hima n'ebea. <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />Were bo mbu: «Mumanirishie emwea uno mbu usheereshange ebea. Namamushisha mu makako inu bushwa n'ebinwa mbi byamamusongere banu, ina ani ntínasunga kiro na kinwa kima chema mu'mbi ebyamamusongere mo banu. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Herote nae ntíwasunga kinwa chema kuri we nge chasingwa wamatukuruchie tu we. Kai emwea uno ntwakukora kinwa chema inchi chamusingwa washurwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Kai naseninkana ho momba bamurase tushushu, kuruma nampo nasemwobora.» [ <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Mu kirotu rukiri rw'ePasaka, Pirato wabesenga woborenga bo mwea uma ituka mu mwiyororo.]<verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Ina ebea bati bakua mongo mbu: «Shura emwea uno, ina twoboreri Baraba!» <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Baraba ngo waminwanga bushwa n'eburunga mbu bwabesenga murubungu, na kwakwa mwea. <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Mu riira, Pirato wabesenga uhunange ibora Yesu. Weba tu kasa n'ebea. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Ina ebea babesenga bakuange mbu: «Mutundike mu musaraba, mutundike mu musaraba!»<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Pirato washisha tu bo r'emeta ashatu mbu: «Mbeni emwea uno wakukora kinki chema? Ani ntínasunga kiro kinwa kima chema nchi chamusingwa washurwa. Kai naseninkana ho momba bamurase tushushu, kuruma nampo nasemwobora.»<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Ina bakua ketu nguru n'ieba mbu Yesu watundikwe mu musaraba. N'emirenge yabo yahundusa Pirato. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Nampo, Pirato wasunga nti rakoma waronjei bo imbu ebuhunange bo! <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Wobore bo Baraba ngu waminwanga bushwa n'eburunga murubungu n'erikwa r'emwea. Kuruma nampo, wasibure bo Yesu kongo ebasura bamukore imbu ebwashima ebea.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ebasura batundika Yesu mu musaraba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoh 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Ebasura barekia bendange na Yesu, bakumana wabume uma mbu nge Simoni wa murubungu rwa ku Kurene na nt'utukange ekwishwa. Bamuriesha emusaraba wa Yesu, n'imwire mbu wamumise kuruma.<verse eid="LUK 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Bea bingi babesenga basiere Yesu kuruma. Mubo, habesenga hotu bamina bingi barengi na bonso bwingi bushwa nae. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yesu wikebera kuri ebamina n'iere bo mbu: «Banu bamina ba ku Yerusaremu, kiro murire bushwa nani! Ina mwiriri banu bisine n'ebana binu. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Bushwa mbu mu matu ngi eyange, ebea basebayo mbu: ‹Esangumba, nambi batangabutanga, n'ebatangarishanga bana mabere, nge bakasanirwa!› <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Mu matu ngo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">ebea basereyo esangu mbu: ‹Mutusuruki!› N'iire esantata mbu: ‹Mutusiki.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Ose 10.8.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Bushwa mbu kuba baronjee emuti mubisi mbo, ngyabere hani emuti wakama?»<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Ebasura barishanga tu babisha babi kongo bashura bo hima na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Bakianga bameya mpi habikirwangǎ mbu «Kahangasi», batundika Yesu mu musaraba. Batundika hotu n'ebabisha mbo, uma ekwabume kwa Yesu n'eumpe ekurembe kwae.<figure style="fig" file="WA03926b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="23.33">Yesu watundikwa mu musaraba</figure> <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />[Yesu weba mbu: «eTita, sasira bo bushwa mbu ntíbosi ebikorange bo.»]</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Mu risonda ibanya esanchangi nsi sabesenga sambara we, ebasura barekera mishari ekwansi kongo basiba emuhango wa kira mwea.<verse eid="LUK 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Ebea babesenga bakusimana mpo nti bakaengi. Ebakwakare b'eBayuta babesenga bamuseange na nti bebange mbu: «Wakushukayanga bampe, wishukaye ke nae, kuba iwe ho nge <char style="w" lemma="Masia, Kirisitu, Rukombora">Kirisitu</char> ngu warondorwanga na Ongo!»<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Ebasura nabo babesenga bamuseange. Bakensere kwihi nae n'imuninka ndifai eyashubuka, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />bamwire mbu: «Kuba ǒngo nge Mwami w'eBayuta muriira, ishukaye mpo ǒngo kisine!» <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Na hambasiro n'emuntwe wae habesenga haandikwa buno mbu: «Uno nge Mwami w'eBayuta.»<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Uma mu babisha mbi batundikwanga mpo, wabesenga umucharikange mbu: «Mbeni ntíǒngo nge <char style="w" lemma="Masia, Kirisitu, Rukombora">Kirisitu</char>? Ishukaye ke, na bate hotu tushukaye!» <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Ina eumpe wafine mine n'ieba mbu: «Mbeni ǒngo nt'usubaha Ongo nakiro mbu umahukumiwa hima n'emwea uno? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Bate babi twahukumiwa itukana n'ebibi byakoranga bate. Ina emwea uno usira bubi buti-buti bwakukora we.»<verse eid="LUK 23:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Kuruma nampo, weba mbu: «eYesu, ang'inobya mu ntambi isekurukayo ǒngo kasimanire ebea mu Bwami bwabe!» <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesu wamusako mbu: «Muriira, nikwirengi mbu runotu hona ukubese hima nani mu Paratiso.»<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Erikwa ra Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoh 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44-45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44-45" />Rakianga rarengeka buna ntambi mutuba sa mumwishi, emwishi warima. Emwirimya wirasa ekwansi mu chuo kiti ieya na mu ntambi mwenda. Enchangi nji yabesenga irembengi mu <char style="w">Numba ya Ongo</char> yabereka bebe bibí.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.44-45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Enchangi njo yabesenga yabanya mpi hashurukara nampi hashurukara nguru mu Numba ya Ongo.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:44-45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Nampo, Yesu wakua mu murenge mukiri n'ieba mbu: «eTita, natereka emutima wani mu mine yabe.» Wakianga wamahea ieba ebinwa mbyo, wákera emutima.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Sab 31.6.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Emukwakare w'ebasura ba ku Roma wakianga wamasunga ebyameta, watata Ongo n'ieba mbu: «Iira, emwea uno wabesenga w'iira!»<verse eid="LUK 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Ebea bati mbi beyanga kakae, bakuruka nti bikaso-kasongi mu bukuba bushwa n'ebonso. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Ebati mbi babesenga bosi Yesu n'ebamina mbi babesenga bamutindikia itukire mu chuo cha ku Ngariraya, babesenga bakusimana kore mu risunga mbu bwabesenga bwetange ebinwa biti mbyo.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eritawa ra Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoh 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-51" />Kwabesenga mwea uma mbu nge Yosefu w'erubungu rwa ku Arimatayo, mu chuo cha ku Yundea. Yosefu ngo wabesenga murongu na mwea waombokara. Wabesenga urindirengi <char style="w" lemma="Bwami bwa Ongo, Bwami bwa mu mbingu">eBwami bwa Ongo</char> bweye. Wabesenga tu uma mu bakwakare b'eRushu rw'eBayuta. Ina iwe ntwakimenga mu nama ya banachabo y'erishura Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Yosefu ngo wenda kuri Pirato n'imukonga ekinda cha Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Kuruma nampo, weba mbu bahiche cho. Wábiririre cho enchangi na wataa cho mu risinda rumbwa shu mu ukanga rukiri. Kusira mwea uti-uti ngu wabesenga wamatawanga mu ro.<figure style="fig" file="WA03929b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="23.53">Yesu warierwa murisinda</figure> <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Ebiti mbyo byetanga otu rwa asanu, <char style="w" lemma="Sabato">n'eSabato</char> nti ngie iri kabucha.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Ebamina mbi babesenga batindikiange Yesu itukire mu chuo cha ku Ngariraya, bamisa Yosefu. Basunga erisinda nambu bwaterekanga bo mo ekinda cha Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Kuruma nampo, bakuruka n'itunganya mafuta na marashi erisingo ekinda. Erotu <char style="w" lemma="Sabato">rw'eSabato</char>, baruhuka itukana n'ebweba eMyomba.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Yesu wafuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat 28.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mar 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoh 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Erotu rw'eriinga muranga-ranga, ebamina mbo baramuke hisinda nti bahata emarashi ngi atunganyangá bo. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Bakianga bameya ho, bakumana erikoi rikiri ndi rabesenga raribia erubi rw'erisinda nti ramashikwa kore n'erisinda. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Bakime kumunda n'erisinda, ina ntíbakumananga mo ekinda cha Nyere Kuritu Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Nampo barukwa busekia bo. Hiha-hiha, kumushi nabo hasungwa babume babi nti bambara nchangi sisanange nguru. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Ebamina batingirwa na boba nguru, nabo bindamya emintwe yabo ekwansi. Ina ebabume mbo bere ebamina mbu: «Bushwa nki banu musondekanyange mwea ngu ushere munkati n'ebakwi?<figure style="fig" file="WA03931b.tif" size="col" copy="Graham Wade" ref="24.5">Ebomina h'isinda ra Yesu</figure> <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Iwe usira tu hano, wamafuka! Musubukianga ebwabwirenga we nt'ukiri mu chuo cha ku Ngariraya. <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />Wamwirenga mbu iwe <char style="w" lemma="Mwana w'eMwea">eMwana w'eMwea</char> rakomenwa wasiburwe mu bea b'ensambi. Wamwirenga tu mbu wasetundikwa mu musaraba, ina wasefuka kuruma na matu ashatu.»<verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Nampo, ebamina mbo basubukia ebinwa byebanga Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Batuka hisinda, benda kature ebinwa mbyo kuri esantumwa ikumi na nima na kuri ebampe banafunsi. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Ebamina mbi baturenga <char style="w" lemma="Ntumwa">esantumwa</char> ikumi na nima emwasi nge bano: Maria wa ku Makitara, Shani na Maria nina wa Yakobo, hima na bampe bamina. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Ina esantumwa ntísasimiranga emwasi ngo, bahaka mbu binwa bya busa-busa. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Ina Petero iwe wasimana n'ienda hisinda nt'ukanyahange. Warekia weya ho, windama n'irungurira kumunda erisinda, ina wakumana ho emirembe y'enchangi njo, wakuruka kukwae na nt'ushisharange mumbi ebyakweta.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wasaire ebanafunsi bae babi munse ya ku Emausi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mar 16.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Erotu ruro-ruro ho, kai banafunsi babi ba Yesu babesenga bendange murubungu rwa ku Emausi, ubungu ndu rwabesenga ruri mu birometere buna ikumi na kima na ku Yerusaremu. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Babesenga bashambarange bushwa n'ebinwa mbi byakweta. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Barekia bakiri bebange n'ishishana, Yesu wisine wakumana bo n'imisanya nabo mongo. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Babesenga bamusungange ina emeso abo abumbirwanga kongo batamuteereri. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yesu washisha bo mbu: «Banu mwendange n'ishambara binwa nki?» Batindira na nti bari na bonso mu mitima yabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Uma mubo wabikirwa mbu Kireopa wamusako mbu: «Kai mu bea bati bari rero ku Yerusaremu ǒngo kisine ho nge ntíǒngosi ebinwa byakweta ko mu matu abi ano?» <verse eid="LUK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Yesu washisha bo mbu: «Mbeni binwa nki?» Nabo mbu: «Ebyakusunga Yesu wa ku Nasareti. Wabesenga <char style="w">mutahwa</char> na nti uri na maa mu rieba na mu rironja ebishisharo mu makako a Ongo na kuri ebea bati.<verse eid="LUK 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />«<char style="w" lemma="Kuhani">Ebakwakare bitu b'ebakuhani</char> hima n'ebampe bakwakare bitu, bamusibura kongo wakererwa ubansa rw'ishurwa. Nampo bamutundika mu musaraba. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Twabesenga twamamwinyihire mbu iwe ngwaseshukayayo eBaisiraeri. Kai, oho! Na runotu ngie matu ashatu ebinwa mbyo byeta. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Na bamina bima ba mu kikembe kitu bakutushishaya. Baramukeyo hisinda, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />ina ntíbasungayo ekinda chae. Bakurukayo n'itwire mbu <char style="w" lemma="Maraika">ebamaraika</char> bakusaire bo nsisu n'iere bo mbu Yesu munkangwe. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Banakitu bima hotu bendayo hisinda, nabo basungayo ebikai biti imbu bwakukianga ebamina bere bo. Ina nabo ntíbakusunga ekinda chae.»<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Nampo Yesu were bo mbu: «Banu birunge! Banu mutusibanga tete ebinwa byebanga <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa">ebatahwa</char>! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Mbeni ntírakomenwa rero mbu <char style="w" lemma="Masia, Kirisitu, Rukombora">Kirisitu</char> wasunge minubo kubusondori n'erikime mu busime bwae?» <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Ngerikia ke Yesu wansonsomore bo ebiti byaandikwanga kuri we mu Kitabo Chashurukara cha Ongo. Wabuchie mu bitabo mbi byakianga Musa waandika, n'iyere mu bitabo biti by'ebatahwa.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Bakianga babungurengi erubungu rwendange mo ebanafunsi babi mbo, rasungwa buri Yesu iwe usondange ienda kore, <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />ina ebanafunsi mbo bamuhema warike nabo bushwa mbu abesenga ngie murisisi n'ebutu nti bwamasiro. Nampo wakime mu numba n'irika nabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Entambi Yesu wakianga urisange nabo, watinge mukati, watata Ongo. Wanoa o n'ininka bo o. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Nampo ke emeso abo oboka, nabo bamuteerera ke. Ina hiha-hiha, Yesu wariribana mu meso abo. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Babucha ishishana mbu: «Iira! Etambi yebange rero we nitu mu munse n'itunsosomore eMitiro Yashurukara, emitima yitu yakubesenga ntyamarisa ngoa!»<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Hiha-hiha basimana n'ikuruka ku Yerusaremu. Bakumana esantumwa ikumi na nima hima n'ebampe banafunsi himpi habesenga hatumana bo <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />nti bebange mbu: «Iira, Nyere Kuritu wamafuka! Simoni wakumusunga!» <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />N'ebanafunsi babi mbo nabo bature babine ebyakusunganga bo mu munse, nambu bwakukianga bateerera Yesu entambi nji yakunoanga we emukati.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wishea kuri ebanafunsi bae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoh 20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Miko 1.6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Ebanafunsi bakianga bakiri bebange mu binwa mbyo, Yesu wisine wisaisha munkati-nkati nabo, n'iere bo mbu: «Mubesi na buhoro!»<verse eid="LUK 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Bisarima na batingirwa na koha, bahaka mbu batingwa na kifwasi. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Ina Yesu were bo mbu: «Bushwa nki mumakwa boba? Bushwa nki banu munitikatikange? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Mukai emine n'ebisando byani: mu riira, ani nge uno! Munitingi mo, na munikai, bushwa mbu ekifwasi kitarikanga na mununku n'ikua, ina ani niri nabyo imbu bunisungange banu.»<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Wakianga ukiri webange mbo, washea bo emine n'ebisando byae. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Ebanafunsi mbo babesenga ntíbasimira nensi ebinwa mbyo bushwa n'esangoa n'erishishara. Nampo ke Yesu washisha bo mbu: «Mbeni banu muri na bio hano?» <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Bamuninka chunda kima cha kikwa chahwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Watinge cho n'irisa cho mu meso abo. <verse eid="LUK 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Kuruma nampo were bo mbu: «Ematu abesenga ani ninu, nabwirenga mbu ebinwa biti byaandikwanga bushwa nani mu Kitabo ch'eMyomba na mu mbi <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa">by'ebatahwa</char>, na mu kitabo ch'eSaburi, byakomenwa biti bibererere.»<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Nampo ke Yesu wobora bo emyanikiri kongo bateerera ebwaandikwa eMitiro Yashurukara. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Were bo mbu: «Raandikwa mbu <char style="w" lemma="Masia, Kirisitu, Rukombora">Kirisitu</char> wahwa inubiwa, na wasefuka munkati n'ebakwi kuruma na matu ashatu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Isa 53; Ose 6.2.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Na mu rina rae nge basehubiri ebea bati mbu bareki esansambi sabo kongo basasirwa to. N'emurimo ngo ubuchii ku Yerusaremu. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Banu ngi mwendi muturange ebiti mbi byakusunganga banu. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Munirukiri, naseburebeka echakianga Tita waburaa. Ina murike kasa ku Yerusaremu ieya n'erotu rwasesheeyo banu emaa ngi asetuka mu mbingu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Miko 1.4-5.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wenda mu mbingu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mar 16.19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Miko 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Kuruma nampo, Yesu wenda nabo kwihi n'erubungu rwa ku Betania. Nampo waria emine yae kwiyo n'ikasane bo. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Warekia ukiri ukasanengi bo, wasia bo n'itarishwa mu mbingu.<figure style="fig" alt="Yesu anapanda mbinguni" file="WA03935b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="24.51">Yesu wataya mu mbingu</figure> <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Ina ibo bindama mu makako ae, kuruma nampo bakuruka ku Yerusaremu na ngoa ningi. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Babesenga barikanga mu <char style="w">Numba ya Ongo</char> ematu ati nti bamutatange.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>